's supposed to snow tomorrow.","天气预报说明天会下雪。"]]],"accordance":[[["n.",["一致","和谐"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky",8086,1,0],"accordingly":[[["adv.",["相应地","因此","于是"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky",5589,2,0,[["Accordingly, besides noun declension patterns, there also existed a greater variety of verb conjugation patterns than in Modern English.","因此，除了名詞的變格之外，也存在比現代英語多的動詞的各種變型。"]]],"accordion":[[["n.",["手风琴"]],["adj.",["可折叠的"]]],"toefl",14592,1,0,"s:accordions"],"accost":[[["v.",["招呼","搭讪","勾引","引诱"]]],"toefl gre",19030,0,0,"d:accosted/i:accosting/3:accosts"],"account":[[["n.",["报告","解释","估价","理由","利润"],["a formal contractual relationship established to provide for regular …"]],["v.",["报帐","解释","导致","报偿","占"]],["",["帐户","帐号"]]],"gk cet4 ky toefl ielts",1071,5,1,"s:accounts/d:accounted/i:accounting",[["The game was called off on account of the rain.","比賽因為下雨取消了。"]]],"accountability":[[["n.",["负有责任","可说明性"]],["",["衡算计量"]]],"gre",4799,0,0,"s:accountabilities",[["I take accountability for my mistake.","我来承担失败的责任。"]]],"accountable":[[["adj.",["负有责任的","可说明的","可解释的"]]],null,5713,2,0,[["Legal frameworks exist to hold war criminals accountable.","法律架構的存在，使戰爭罪犯的責任可以追究。"]]],"accountancy":[[["n.",["会计工作","会计学","会计学术","会计职业"]]],null,35429,1,0,[["It's possible to branch out from computing to jobs in banking, accountancy and so on.","有可能將電腦工作擴展到銀行業務, 會計業務等等。"]]],"accountant":[[["n.",["会计人员","会计师"]]],"gk ky toefl ielts",5949,2,0,"s:accountants",[["Allan was lucky and passed the tax accountant examination.","艾伦很幸运地考过了税务师考试。"]]],"accredit":[[["v.",["信托","确认","归结于","委派","发行信用证"]]],"toefl",16480,1,0,"d:accredited/i:accrediting/s:accredits",[["He was accredited to the United States to represent Japan.","他被任命为驻美日本大使。"]]],"accreditation":[[["n.",["委派","信托","鉴定合格"]],["",["立案","备案","任命"]]],null,10209,0,0,"s:accreditations"],"accrete":[[["v.",["连生","合生","附依","使依附","使连接"]],["adj.",["合生的"]]],"gre",27629,0,0,"d:accreted/3:accretes/i:accreting"],"accretion":[[["n.",["自然增大","添加","添加物","连生"]],["",["停滞堆积"]]],"gre",17492,0,0,"s:a