 mind that the picky reader is very difficult to fool.","翻译其实是一件吃力不讨好的事，因为一种语言在另一种语言中的对应物藏在往往隐藏在深不可测之处，翻译者需要百般寻觅，而且，…"]]],"alabaster":[[["n.",["雪花石膏"]],["adj.",["雪花石膏制的"]]],"gre",22647,0,0,"s:alabasters"],"alacrity":[[["n.",["敏捷","轻快","乐意"]]],"gre",27693,0,0],"alamo":[[["n.",["白杨"]]],null,15914,0,0],"alarm":[[["n.",["惊恐","警报","警钟"]],["v.",["使惊恐","警告"]],["",["报警信号"]]],"gk cet4 ky toefl ielts",3693,3,1,"s:alarms/d:alarmed/i:alarming",[["Kurt didn't wake up yesterday because the alarm didn't ring.","昨天闹钟没响，Kurt也就没醒过来。"]]],"alarmingly":[[["adv.",["让人担忧地"]]],null,18659,0,0],"alas":[[["int.",["唉"]]],"cet6",8520,1,0,[["Many of our pioneers are still alive... but, alas, many of them aren't alive any more.","我們的先驅者中許多還活著...但是，唉，其中有許多已經死了。"]]],"alaska":[[["n.",["阿拉斯加州"]]],"ielts",0,0,0,[["The bar-tailed godwit migrates from Alaska to New Zealand.","斑尾塍鷸從阿拉斯加遷徙至紐西蘭。"]]],"alaskan":[[["adj.",["阿拉斯加的","阿拉斯加州的"]]],null,11861,0,0,"s:alaskans",[["On the 14th of April of 2015, I walk to the Richmond Public Market, I first climbing the stairs outside. Inside, the wide atrium-like building is like a garden in a jungle surrounding, I imagine. Already quite hungry, I trot to Captain Wa, the food vendor, to get noodles with squid, fish, and tofu, as well as hot tea. As I eat, a handsome First Nations man in a purple T-shirt walks by. Then a handsome, stocky Jewish fellow walks by. A few minutes later, I begin to thirst, so I get a cold Mint Bubble Green Tea at the vendor QQ Bubble Tea and Coffee. I sit by the stairs to sip. A threesome family sits eating nearby, the man being black, the woman being Oriental, and the child being a hybrid. Addicted to Bubble Tea, I get another one, this time at Peanut's. It is a cold Green Apple Bubble Green Tea. It is delicious. I take the escalator down. On my way to the washroom, I notice a big aquarium full of probably giant red Alaskan king crabs with barnacles on their legs. They remind me of extraterrestrials, somehow. At the bookstore, I buy a heavily illustrated green botany book in sinograms. I left it on top of a box a month ago and it is still there. It is $14. I take the escalator up. Addicted to Bubble Tea, I spend my remaining coins on a cold Lychee Bubble Green Tea. It is delicious with even bits of white lychee flesh.","2015 年 4 月 14 日，我步行前往列治文公共市場，先是爬上了外面的階梯。市場內部寬敞的中庭式建築，讓我感覺彷彿…"]]],"albanian":[[["n.",["阿尔巴尼亚人"]]],null,12196,0,0,"s:albanians",[["My dream is to study Albanian in Tirana.","我的夢想是在地拉那學習阿爾巴尼亞語。"]]],"albeit":[[["conj.",["尽管","虽然"]]],"gre",6086,2,0],"albino":[[["n.",["白化病者","白化体"]],["",["白化病患者"]]],"gre",25420,0,0,"s:albinos"],"album":[[["n.",["粘贴簿","唱片套"]],["",["白色物"]]],"gk cet6 ky ielts",2215,4,0,"s:albums",[["He sat quietly at his desk, flipping through the yellowed photo album.","他靜靜地坐在書桌前，翻閱著那本泛黃的相簿。"]]],"alchemy":[[["n.",["炼金术","魔力","炼丹术","金丹术"]]],"toefl gre",17003,0,0],"alcohol":[[["n.",["酒精","酒","醇","乙醇"]]],"gk cet4 ky",2191,3,1,"s:alcohols",[["What pain are you trying to cover up with alcohol?","你借酒浇愁是为了什么事？"]]],"alcoholic":[[["n.",["酒鬼","酒精中毒者"]],["adj.",["酒精的"]]],"gk",7755,2,1,"s:alcoholics",[["People who drink alcoholic beverages are not allowed to enter.","飲酒者不准禁入。"]]],"alcoholism":[[["n.",["酗酒","酒精中毒"]],["",["酒中毒"]]],null,9107,0,0],"alcove":[[["n.",["凹室","壁龛","小亭"]]],"gre",13738,1,0,"s:alcoves"],"alder":[[["n.",["桤木"]],["",["赤杨木"]]],"toefl",18527,0,0,"s:alders"],"alderman":[[["",["市议员","市长助理","地方官"]],["n.",["市政委员会委员","高级市政官"]]],null,17294,0,0,"s:aldermen"],"ale":[[["n.",["麦芽酒"]]],null,12830,1,0,"s:ales/p:aled",[["Pale ale is a low-alcohol beer.","淡啤酒是一種酒精含量低的啤酒。"]]],"alert":[[["adj.",["警觉的","灵敏的","留心的"]],["v.",["使警觉","通知","使意识到"]],["n.",["警报"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky toefl gre",5318,3,0,"d:alerted/i:alerting/3:alerts",[["A tsunami is coming, so please be on the alert.","海啸来了，密切注意啊。"]]],"alertness":[[["n.",["警戒","机敏"]]],null,18261,0,0],"alfalfa":[[["n.",["苜蓿","紫苜蓿"]]],null,15340,0,0],"algae":[[["n.",["藻类","海藻"]]],"toefl",9463,1,0,"s:algaes"],"algebra":[[["n.",["代数学"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 toe