, American elms, and hemlocks.","植物園內種植了 450 多株杜鵑花，還有楓樹、美國榆樹和鐵杉等樹木，用於景觀美化。"]]],"arc":[[["n.",["弧","弧形","弓形","弧光"]]],"cet6 toefl ielts",5923,1,0,"s:arcs/i:arcking/p:arcked",[["It's the answer that led those who've been told for so long, by so many, to be cynical and fearful and doubtful about what we can achieve, to put their hands on the arc of history and bend it once more toward the hope of a better day.","就是這個答案，讓那些長久以來被灌輸要嘲諷、害怕和懷疑自身能力的人們 把他們的手放在歷史的弧線上，將它彎向一個更美好的一…"]]],"arcade":[[["n.",["拱廊","拱形建筑物","有拱廊的街道"]],["",["弓形组织","连拱"]]],null,12052,1,0,"s:arcades/i:arcading/d:arcaded",[["I have a lot of arcade machines.","我有很多电玩。"]]],"arcane":[[["adj.",["神秘的","晦涩难解的"]]],"gre",13167,1,0,"t:arcanest"],"arch":[[["adj.",["主要的","调皮的","傲慢无礼的","狡猾的"]],["n.",["拱门","拱形","足弓"]],["v.",["使成弓形","拱起","成弓形"]]],"gk cet6 ky toefl ielts gre",6326,2,0,"s:arches/p:arched/i:arching",[["The cat arched its back and stretched itself.","猫弓起背，伸了个懒腰。"]]],"archaeological":[[["adj.",["考古学的","考古学上的"]]],"toefl ielts",6992,0,0],"archaeologist":[[["n.",["考古学家"]]],null,6264,0,0,"s:archaeologists",[["Tom is an archaeologist leading the excavations near Rome.","湯姆是位考古學家，在領導羅馬附近的發掘項目。"]]],"archaeology":[[["n.",["考古学"]]],"toefl gre",8477,2,0],"archaic":[[["adj.",["古体的","过时的","古老的","古代的","原始的"]]],"toefl ielts",13117,1,0,[["That expression is archaic.","那種表達方式已經過時了。"]]],"archbishop":[[["n.",["大主教"]]],null,11823,0,0,"s:archbishops"],"archdiocese":[[["n.",["大主教之管区"]]],null,17555,0,0,"s:archdioceses"],"archeologist":[[["n.",["考古学家"]]],null,19988,0,0,"s:archeologists"],"archer":[[["n.",["弓箭手","射箭运动员"]]],"gre",14695,0,0,[["The archer killed the deer.","射手打死了鹿。"]]],"archery":[[["n.",["射箭术"]]],null,19386,0,0,[["Mr. Sato practices archery on weekends.","佐藤先生在週末練習射箭。"]]],"archetypal":[[["adj.",["原型的"]]],null,15612,0,0],"archetype":[[["n.",["原型"]]],"gre",15672,1,0,"s:archetypes"],"archipelago":[[["n.",["群岛","多岛屿的海"]]],"toefl gre",14572,0,0,"s:archipelagos"],"architect":[[["n.",["建筑师","设计者","缔造者"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky toef