h yet he lives like a beggar.","他很富有，但活得像个乞丐。"]]],"begin":[[["v.",["开始"],["have a beginning, in a temporal, spatial, or evaluative sense"]]],"zk gk",164,5,1,"p:began/i:beginning/d:begun/3:begins",[["To be surprised, to wonder, is to begin to understand.","感到惊讶、感到惊奇就是明白的开始。"]]],"beginner":[[["n.",["初学者"]]],"cet4",8837,2,0,"s:beginners",[["You are a good tennis player, as beginners go.","以初學者來說，你打網球已經算是打得不錯了。"]]],"begrudge":[[["v.",["嫉妒","羡慕","勉强允给","吝惜"]]],"toefl gre",20345,0,0,"p:begrudged/3:begrudges/i:begrudging",[["Our boss begrudged us even a small raise in pay.","我们的老板就连给我们涨一点工资都舍不得。"]]],"beguile":[[["v.",["诱骗"]]],"toefl gre",25475,0,0,"d:beguiled/i:beguiling/3:beguiles"],"behalf":[[["n.",["利益","方面"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts",4434,3,1,[["Please say hello to your family on my behalf.","请代我向你的家人问好。"]]],"behave":[[["v.",["举止端正","行为规矩","检点(自己的)行为","使表现好"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts",3660,3,1,"i:behaving/p:behaved/3:behaves",[["He is very much ashamed of having behaved so badly.","他為自己的行為感到非常羞恥。"]]],"behavior":[[["n.",["行为","举止"],["manner of acting or controlling yourself"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts",658,0,0,"s:behaviors",[["This behavior shows a lack of respect for the performance.","這種行為是對演出的不尊重。"]]],"behavioral":[[["adj.",["行为的"]]],null,3752,0,0],"behaviour":[[["n.",["行为","举止","特性","性能","特点"]]],"zk gk toefl",10352,4,1,"s:behaviours",[["I am fed up with his behaviour.","我厌烦了他的行为。"]]],"behavioural":[[["adj.",["行为的"]]],null,31578,1,0],"behead":[[["v.",["斩首","砍头"]]],null,18382,0,0,"d:beheaded/i:beheading/3:beheads"],"behemoth":[[["n.",["庞然大物"]]],null,13240,0,0,"s:behemoths"],"behest":[[["n.",["命令"]]],null,17210,0,0,"s:behests"],"behind":[[["adv.",["在后地"]],["prep.",["在...背后"]]],"zk gk",421,5,1,[["The police will put you behind bars for twenty years.","警方會把你關在牢裡二十年。"]]],"behind-the-scenes":[[["adj.",["幕后的"]]],null,0,1,0],"behold":[[["v.",["看到","注视","看"]]],"gre",10497,1,0,"i:beholding/3:beholds/p:beheld",[["You scorned both the Nymphs, who beheld your deeds, and me the mighty Pan.","你蔑視了目睹你罪行的仙女們，也蔑視了我を這位強大的潘神。"]]],"beholden":[[["adj.",["负有义务的","受惠的"]]],"gre",18867,0,0],"beholder":[[["n.",["观看者"]]],"gre",17707,0,0,"s:beholders",[["Beauty is in the eye of the beholder.","情人眼裡出西施。"]]],"behoove":[[["v.",["理应","应该","理所当然"]]],"gre",22545,0,0,"i:behooving/p:behooved/3:behooves"],"beige":[[["n.",["薄斜纹呢","米色"]],["adj.",["淡棕色的"]]],null,11013,1,0,"s:beiges",[["It's a sunny 3rd of July of 2025. On the 7th will be the Star Festival—Tanabata—in Japan. This morning, here on Lulu Island, I strolled to Tim Hortons café twice—Iced Coffee with oat milk, then Strawberry Watermelon Sparkling Quencher with a Sausage Farmer's Wrap. I went to the \"Clam Temple.\" On the way, I glanced at the charming bamboo grove. An old man had dug holes beside it to put compost—eaten mangoes and cherries. At the café, I spoke to Greg, the white man who eventually wants to own a B&B in Kushiro, Hokkaido, with his Japanese wife. The native Ainu and marshes are attractions there. Today, head-shaven Greg is wearing a beige T-shirt and beige shorts—maybe a hint of Chabacano?","今天是 2025 年 7 月 3 日，陽光明媚。7 月 7日是日本的七夕。今天早上，在露露島上，我兩次去了提姆霍頓斯咖…"]]],"belabor":[[["",["殴打","鞭打","辱骂"]],["v.",["痛打"]]],"gre",0,0,0,"i:belaboring/p:belabored/3:belabors"],"belated":[[["",["过了期的","落后了的"]],["adj.",["迟来的"]]],"gre",17806,1,0],"belatedly":[[["adv.",["延迟地","延续地"]]],null,16339,0,0],"belch":[[["v.",["打嗝","喷吐","吼叫着发出(命令)"]],["n.",["打嗝","喷吐"]]],"gre",17429,1,0,"p:belched/i:belching/3:belches"],"beleaguer":[[["v.",["围","围攻"]]],"gre",0,0,0,"d:beleaguered/i:beleaguering/3:beleaguers"],"beleaguered":[[["adj.",["围困的","包围的"]]],null,12686,1,0],"belgian":[[["n.",["比利时人"]],["adj.",["比利时的"]]],null,10401,0,0,"s:belgians",[["Jacques is a Belgian name.","雅克是比利时的名字。"]]],"belgium":[[["n.",["比利时"]]],"gk",0,0,0,[["She decided to move to Belgium.","她决定搬到比利时。"]]],"belie":[[["v.",["掩饰","与...不符","使失望"]]],"toefl gre",14713,1,0,"3:belies/i:belying/p:belied"],"belief":[[["n.",["信念","相信","信仰"],["any cognitive content held as true"]]],"gk cet4 ky toefl",1378,3,1,"s:beliefs",[["We should try to avoid imposing our own beliefs on others.","我們應該盡量避免把我們自己的信念強加在別人身上。"]]],"believable":[[["adj.",["可信的"]]],null,13443,1,0,[["Is it believable?","可信嗎？"]]],"believe":[[["v.",["相信"],["accept as true; take to be true"]]],"zk gk",212,5,1,"p:believed/3:believes/i:believing",[["Everyone would like to believe that dreams can come true.","人人都愿意相信美梦可以成真。"]]],"believer":[[["n.",["信徒"]]],"toefl",5362,1,0,"s:believers",[["I don't like false believers.","我不喜欢虚伪的信徒。"]]],"belittle":[[["v.",["轻视","贬低"]]],"toefl gre",15936,1,0,"i:belittling/d:belittled/3:belittles"],"bell":[[["n.",["铃","钟"]],["",["响铃命令"]]],"zk gk",2646,3,1,"s:bells/p:belled/i:belling",[["I don't want red bell peppers, I want green ones.","我不要紅色的柿子椒, 而是要綠色的。"]]],"belle":[[["n.",["美女"]]],null,15427,0,0,"s:belles"],"bellicose":[[["adj.",["好战的","好斗的"]]],"gre",24633,0,0],"belligerence":[[["n.",["交战","好战性","斗争性"]]],"gre",27292,0,0],"belligerent":[[["adj.",["好战的","交战的","交战国的"]],["",["交战一方","交战国","交战集团"]]],"toefl",15987,1,0,"s:belligerents"],"bellow":[[["v.",["怒吼"]]],null,12281,1,0,"p:bellowed/i:bellowing/3:bellows"],"bellwether":[[["n.",["系铃带头羊","前导","领导者"]]],"gre",0,0,0,[["Although the male goat kids are often culled because they will never produce milk, they are sometimes castrated instead and allowed to remain in the herd as a \"wether\". With a bell around its neck, such a \"bellwether\" is usually the leader for the rest of the herd.","雖然公山羊羔經常因為無法產奶而被淘汰，但有時牠們會被閹割，並作為「閹羊」留在羊群中。這種脖子上掛著鈴鐺的「領頭羊」通常…"]]],"belly":[[["v.",["使鼓起","鼓起","匍匐前进"]],["n.",["腹部","食欲"]]],"gk ky ielts",3805,2,0,"s:bellies/p:bellied/i:bellying",[["He had an infection in his belly button.","他的肚脐发炎了。"]]],"belong":[[["v.",["属于","合适"],["be owned by; be in the possession of"]]],"gk cet4 ky toefl",1639,3,1,"i:belonging/p:belonged/3:belongs",[["Who does the car belong to when the owner dies?","主人死後車子歸誰呢？"]]],"belongings":[[["n.",["财产","所有物","相关事物","附属物"]]],"gre",9215,1,0,[["Pleas