Japan, and tennis ace Naomi Osaka, who left the prestigious Wimbledon tournament in June.","貝茨曾在 1984 年洛杉磯夏季奧運會上獲得三枚金牌，他是少數幾位能夠體會到像體操運動員西蒙拜爾斯 (她在日本奧運會上…"]]],"bilingual":[[["adj.",["双语的"]]],"ielts gre",9541,1,0,"s:bilinguals",[["Being at least bilingual is a must in today's world.","在当今的世界，拥有双语种是必要的"]]],"bilious":[[["adj.",["患胆(或肝)病的","胆汁质的","坏脾气的","胆汁的"]]],"gre",32379,0,0],"bilk":[[["v.",["欺骗","赖帐","使受挫折"]],["n.",["赖帐者","骗子"]]],"gre",25865,0,0,"i:bilking/p:bilked/3:bilks"],"bill":[[["n.",["帐单","清单","钞票","鸟嘴","广告"]],["v.",["开帐单","(用招贴)宣布"]]],"zk gk cet4 ky toefl ielts",8026,4,1,"s:bills/d:billed/i:billing",[["Lobbyists for the bill funneled bribes into a campaign fund.","該法案的說客把遊說賄款匯入了競選基金。"]]],"billboard":[[["n.",["广告牌","布告板"]],["v.",["宣传"]]],null,7143,1,0,"s:billboards"],"billiards":[[["n.",["台球","桌球"]]],null,19012,0,0],"billing":[[["n.",["节目次序","广告"]],["",["开票(发票","帐单)"]]],null,8811,0,0,"s:billings"],"billion":[[["num.",["十亿","十亿个"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky toefl",612,5,0,[["The Milky Way consists of about a hundred billion stars.","银河系大约由一千亿颗恒星组成。"]]],"billionaire":[[["n.",["亿万富翁"]]],null,9507,1,0,"s:billionaires",[["I always dreamed of being a billionaire.","我總是梦想著成為億萬富翁。"]]],"billow":[[["v.",["象巨浪般汹涌","象巨浪般波动","使翻腾"]],["n.",["巨浪"]]],"gre",12401,1,0,"i:billowing/p:billowed/s:billows"],"billowy":[[["adj.",["巨浪似的","汹涌的"]]],"gre",28611,0,0],"bimbo":[[["n.",["男人(尤指彪形大汉)","女人"]]],null,22410,1,0,"s:bimbos"],"bin":[[["n.",["(贮存谷物等的)容器","箱子"]],["",["二进制","商业信息网"]]],"ky gre",0,2,1,"s:bins/p:binned/i:binning",[["Hey, Tom, can we get two bins of lettuce?","嘿，湯姆，我們可以買兩箱生菜嗎？"]]],"binary":[[["",["二进制的","二态的","二进制","二进制文件传输类型设置命令"]],["adj.",["由两部分组成的","二进位的","二元的"]]],null,11187,1,0,"s:binaries",[["To claim sex is binary requires ignoring intersex people, which is unscientific and purely ideological.","若要聲稱性別是二元的，就需要忽視陰陽人，這是不科學的，且純粹屬於意識形態問題。"]]],"bind":[[["v.",["绑","约束","装订","包扎","使结合"]],["",["赋值","绑定"]]],"cet4 ky toefl ielts",2496,2,0,"d:bound/i:binding/3:binds",[["We are bound to each other by a close friendship.","友谊紧紧联系着我们。"]]],"binder":[[["n.",["捆缚者","用以绑缚之物","活页夹"]],["",["粘结剂"]]],null,12699,1,0,"s:binders"],"binge":[[["n.",["狂闹","狂欢"]]],null,12678,1,0,"s:binges/i:bingeing/p:binged"],"bingo":[[["n.",["宾戈(一种赌博游戏)","烈酒"]]],"gk",15245,1,0],"binoculars":[[["n.",["双目镜","双筒镜"]]],null,7607,1,0],"bio":[[["n.",["个人简历","小传"]]],null,17047,0,0,"s:bios"],"biochemical":[[["adj.",["生物化学的"]]],null,14303,1,0,"s:biochemicals"],"biochemistry":[[["n.",["生物化学","生化"]]],"gk toefl",17884,1,0,"s:biochemistries",[["In the morning of the 27th of February of 2022, on my way out of my Lulu Island house, I saw my neighbours the redhead Rochelle of Russian-Mennonite ancestry and the grey-haired moustached Al from the Anglophone section of Montreal; he was from many generations of Canadians. He said that he did not know French, when he lived in Montreal. I ate a slice of pesto cheese pizza at the pizzeria. The vendor was from Mumbai. Through the window, I could see a young brown-blond-haired man in a dark-grey hooded jacket and blue shorts, which made him look like a \"big boy.\" At the cafe, there was an under-age-30 crowd of ten outside, of whom one looked like a handsome Jew. Inside was a table of five or six over-age-30 people, of whom one was a handsome tomboy in a dark-green jacket and army-green pants. I drank my iced black tea. Heading out of the cafe, I saw the \"big boy\" smoking in the wooded park. I took the long route home, through the grassy school field littered with goose poop, the northern snowcapped mountains obscured by clouds, an Animistic-Buddhistic view seemingly of a different planet. Near my house, parked in a truck were Olivia and Daniel. Olivia was studying Biochemistry. In the back seat of the truck was a fully black German Shepherd.","2022 年 2 月 27 日早上，我正要離開盧盧島的家，卻碰見了鄰居——紅頭髮的俄羅斯門諾派血統的羅謝爾，以及來自蒙…"]]],"biodegradable":[[["adj.",["能进行生物降解的"]]],null,19358,0,0],"biodiversity":[[["n.",["生物多样性"]]],null,7767,1,0],"biofuel":[[["",["生物燃料"]]],null,19413,0,0,"s:biofuels"],"biographer":[[["n.",["传记作者"]]],"toefl",10519,1,0,"s:biographers"],"biographical":[[["adj.",["传记的"]]],null,13287,1,0],"biography":[[["n.",["传记"]]],"gk ky toefl ielts",4875,2,0,"s:biographies"],"biological":[[["adj.",["生物学的"]]],"ielts",2564,2,0,"s:biologicals",[["As soon as we are born, the world gets to work on us and transforms us from merely biological into social units.","我們一出生在這個世界上，就會開始受到周遭環境的影響，從生物單位慢慢進化成社會單位。"]]],"biologically":[[["adv.",["生物学","生态学"]]],null,12839,0,0],"biologist":[[["n.",["生物学家"]]],"toefl",5075,0,0,"s:biologists",[["Tom is studying to become a marine biologist.","湯姆爲了當海洋生物學家學習。"]]],"biology":[[["n.",["生物学","生物"]]],"gk cet4 ky ielts",4226,2,1,[["She studied the bat's anatomy for her biology project.","她為了完成生物學作業，研究了蝙蝠的解剖構造。"]]],"biomass":[[["n.",["生物量","生物质"]]],null,10431,0,0],"biomedical":[[["adj.",["生物医学"]]],null,12136,0,0],"biopsy":[[["n.",["活组织检查"]]],null,10421,0,0,"s:biopsies/d:biopsied"],"biosolids":[[["n.",["生物固体（从处理过废水中取得的固体或半固体材料","常用作肥料）"]]],null,14150,0,0],"biosphere":[[["n.",["生物圈","生物层"]]],"gre",14277,1,0],"biotech":[[["n.",["生物技术"]]],"cet6",11124,0,0],"biotechnology":[[["n.",["生物工艺学","生物技术"]]],null,9499,1,0,"s:biotechnologies",[["It's very easy to drink potato shochu now that the potato-like smell has been reduced to a low level through use of the latest biotechnology.","透過現今的生物科技，蕃薯燒酒已經變得十分容易入口了，因為那種難聞的蕃薯味道大部分已經被去除了。"]]],"bioterrorism":[[["n.",["生物恐怖活动"]]],null,19994,0,0],"bipartisan":[[["adj.",["两党连立的"]]],null,6644,1,0],"bipartisanship":[[["",["两党制"]]],null,18965,0,0],"biped":[[["n.",["两足动物"]],["adj.",["有两足的"]]],"gre",40451,0,0,"s:bipeds"],"bipedal":[[["",["两足的"]]],"ky toefl",29097,0,0,"s:bipedals"],"bipolar":[[["adj.",["有两极的","双极的"]],["",["双极性"]]],null,10604,0,0,"s:bipolars"],"birch":[[["n.",["桦树","桦木","桦条"]],["",["桦"]]],null,11505,1,0,"s:birches/d:birched/i:birching",[["Birch trees have white bark.","桦树有白树皮。"]]],"bird":[[["n.",["鸟","羽毛球"],["warm-blooded egg-laying vertebrates characterized by feathers and for…"]],["v.",["打鸟"],["watch and study birds in their natural habitat"]]],"zk gk",1122,4,1,"s:birds/i:birding/p:birded",[["If I were a bird, I could fly to you.","如果我是一隻小鳥，我就可以飛到你的身邊了。"]]],"birdcage":[[["n.",["鸟笼"]]],"gk",32730,0,0,"s:birdcages"],"birdie":[[["n.",["小鸟"]]],null,11341,2,0,"i:birdying/p:birdied/3:birdies"],"birmingham":[[["n.",["伯明翰"]]],"ielts",0,0,0,[["The train for Birmingham leaves from platform 3.","去伯明翰的火车从3号站台出发。"]]],"birth":[[["n.",["出生","起源"],["the time when something begins (especially life)"]],["",["生产","分娩"]]],"zk gk cet4 ky ielts",1499,3,1,"s:births/i:birthing/p:birthed",[["They were pleased at the birth of their first child.","他們第一箇孩子出生了，很高興。"]]],"birthday":[[["n.",["生日"]]],"zk gk",2433,3,1,"s:birthdays",[["It is really marvelous of you to remember my birthday.","你還記得我的生日，那真是太好了。"]]],"birthplace":[[["n.",["诞生地"]]],"gk",11526,1,0,"s:birthplaces"],"birthright":[[["n.",["生来就有的权利","长子继承权"]]],null,18539,0,0,"s:birthrights"],"biscuit":[[["n.",["饼干","素坯"]]],"zk gk cet4 ky",8068,2,1,"s:biscuits",[["He shared his box of biscuits with all his friends.","他和他所有的朋友分享了他的那盒饼干。"]]],"bisect":[[["v.",["分成两部份","对分"]]],null,19926,0,0,"3:bisects/d:bisected/i:bisecting"],"bisexual":[[["adj.",["两性的","雌雄同体的"]]],null,12468,1,0,"s:bisexuals",[["Mary's wife is bisexual.","玛丽的妻子是双性恋。"]]],"bishop":[[["n.",["主教","(国际象棋中的)象","热果子酒"]]],"gk cet6",3437,0,0,"s:bishops"],"bison":[[["n.",["野牛"]]],"toefl",10820,0,0,"s:bisons",[["Bison is unique.","野牛很獨特。"]]],"bistro":[[["n.",["小酒馆","夜总会"]]],null,14625,0,0,"s:bistros"],"bitch":[[["n.",["母狗","母狼","母狐"]]],null,5650,2,0,"s:bitches/i:bitching/p:bitched",[["It's written abazure (bitch). Surely this must mean a slut?","上面寫的是「abazure (婊子)」。這肯定是指「蕩婦」吧？"]]],"bite":[[["v.",["咬","刺痛","穿透"]],["n.",["咬","一口"]]],"gk cet4 ky toefl ielts",3153,5,1,"p:bit/i:biting/s:bites",[["The things he says are not the least bit important.","他说的话根本毫无意义。"]]],"bitter":[[["adj.",["苦的","痛苦的","怀恨的"]],["adv.",["刺骨"]],["v.",["(使)变苦"]]],"zk gk cet4 ky toefl ielts",358