int out any flaws. He consumes meager amount of food, while offering boastful riches to the Gods and ancestors; He always don the crudest attire, but wears lavish garments when worshipping; He resides in a small house, yet forges water ways and ditches with all his might. Figures like Yu the Great, I honestly cannot point out any reprehensible flaws.\"","孔子說：\"像夏禹的為人，我找不到可以指責的漏洞。自己吃著菲薄的飲食，而卻用豐厚祭品祭拜祖先與神明；自己平時穿粗劣的衣裳…"]]],"boat":[[["v.",["乘船","以船运"],["ride in a boat on water"]],["n.",["船"],["a small vessel for travel on water"]]],"zk gk ielts",1231,4,1,"s:boats/i:boating/p:boated",[["The lost fishing boat made a safe return to harbour.","迷路的渔船安全地返回了港口。"]]],"boater":[[["n.",["船工","硬草帽"]]],null,15141,0,0,"s:boaters/p:boatered"],"bob":[[["n.",["短发","悬挂的饰品","浮子","摆动","轻敲"]],["v.",["剪短","敲击","振动","上下跳动"]]],null,8817,2,0,"i:bobbing/p:bobbed/s:bobs",[["Bob plays not only the guitar but also the flute.","Bob不仅会弹吉他还会吹笛。"]]],"bode":[[["v.",["预示"]]],"gre",15027,1,0,"3:bodes/p:boded/i:boding",[["His laziness boded ill for the future.","他的懒惰是他未来不好的预兆。"]]],"bodice":[[["n.",["女服的紧身上衣"]]],null,18948,0,0,"s:bodices/p:bodiced"],"bodily":[[["adj.",["身体的"]],["adv.",["亲自"]]],"toefl",8434,2,0,[["Ebola spreads from person to person through bodily fluids.","埃博拉通過體液在人與人之間傳播。"]]],"body":[[["n.",["身体","人","尸体","主要部分","团体"],["the entire structure of an organism (an animal, plant, or human being)"]],["v.",["赋以形体"]],["",["体"]]],"zk",313,5,1,"s:bodies/i:bodying/p:bodied",[["I'd like to know how the body absorbs these substances.","我想知道這些物質是怎麼被人體吸收的。"]]],"bodyguard":[[["n.",["保镖","护卫"]]],"gre",8100,2,0,"s:bodyguards/i:bodyguarding",[["The bodyguard was wearing an earpiece.","保镖戴着耳机。"]]],"bog":[[["v.",["使陷于泥沼","陷于泥沼"]],["n.",["沼泽"]]],"gre",11278,2,0,"s:bogs/d:bogged/i:bogging",[["Where's the bog?","厕所在哪？"]]],"bogey":[[["n.",["妖怪","可怕的人(物)"]],["",["标准"]]],null,15162,1,0,"s:bogeys/p:bogeyed/i:bogeying"],"boggle":[[["v.",["犹豫","踌躇","吃惊","搪塞","搞坏"]],["n.",["犹豫","吃惊"]]],"gre",21558,1,0,"3:boggles/i:bogglin