n the brooch.","寶石師傅在胸針上鑲了一枚大珍珠。"]]],"brood":[[["n.",["一窝","一伙"]],["v.",["孵","沉思"]]],"cet4 cet6 ielts gre",14517,1,0,"p:brooded/s:broods/i:brooding",[["In a sunny spot stood a pleasant old farm-house close by a deep river, and from the house down to the water side grew great burdock leaves, so high, that under the tallest of them a little child could stand upright. The spot was as wild as the centre of a thick wood. In this snug retreat sat a duck on her nest, watching for her young brood to hatch; she was beginning to get tired of her task, for the little ones were a long time coming out of their shells, and she seldom had any visitors.","陽光明媚的地方，坐落著一座宜人的老農舍，緊鄰一條深深的河流。從農舍一直到河邊，長滿了高大的牛蒡葉，最高的牛蒡葉下，可以…"]]],"brook":[[["n.",["小溪"]],["v.",["容忍"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky toefl gre",22189,1,0,"s:brooks/p:brooked/i:brooking",[["The murmur of the brook lulls me to sleep.","溪流潺潺，催我入眠。"]]],"broom":[[["n.",["扫帚","金雀花"]],["v.",["扫除"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky",9418,1,0,"s:brooms",[["I can't find the broom.","我找不到掃把了。"]]],"broth":[[["n.",["原汁清汤","肉汤"]],["",["肉汤(培养基)"]]],null,5690,1,0,"s:broths",[["You're right. The noodle broth here is a bit expensive.","您说得对。这里的面汤比较贵。"]]],"brothel":[[["n.",["妓院"]]],null,12966,1,0,"s:brothels",[["I plan to work in a brothel.","我打算去妓院做事。"]]],"brother":[[["n.",["兄弟"],["a male with the same parents as someone else"]]],"zk gk",614,5,1,"s:brothers",[["My younger brother really likes to take photos of mountains.","我弟弟很喜欢拍山的照片。"]]],"brotherhood":[[["n.",["手足情谊","兄弟关系"]]],"gk",13702,0,0,"s:brotherhoods",[["Their goal and activating main idea was indeed brotherhood and justice among the peoples.","他们的目标和活动的主要思想是真正的四海一家和各民族的普遍公正。"]]],"brow":[[["n.",["眉毛","额","眉","睫毛"]]],"cet4 ky",5800,1,0,"s:brows",[["The sweat was dripping off my brow.","汗水從我的額頭上落下。"]]],"browbeat":[[["v.",["对...吹胡子瞪眼睛","吓唬"]]],"gre",31119,0,0,"d:browbeaten/i:browbeating/3:browbeats"],"brown":[[["n.",["褐色"],["an orange of low brightness and saturation"]],["adj.",["褐色的"]],["v.",["(使)变褐色"],["fry in a pan unt