rast with this one.","和這幅比起上來，那幅畫的色彩鮮艷多了。"]]],"coloring":[[["n.",["着色","色彩","色调","面色","气色"]]],null,12898,0,0],"colorless":[[["adj.",["无色的"]],["",["无色"]]],null,16173,0,0,[["The colorless green thought sleeps angrily.","無色的綠色意念憤怒地沉睡著。"]]],"colossal":[[["adj.",["巨大的","巨像似的"]]],"toefl ielts gre",12711,1,0],"colossus":[[["n.",["巨像","巨人"]]],"gre",20646,0,0],"colour":[[["v.",["把...涂上颜色","粉饰","使脸红","歪曲","变色"]],["n.",["颜色","面色","颜料","外貌"]]],"zk gk",0,5,1,"s:colours/d:coloured/i:colouring",[["Many Chinese people consider red to be the best colour.","很多中國人認為红色是最好的顏色。"]]],"colourful":[[["adj.",["颜色丰富的","鲜艳的","艳丽的","多色的","丰富多彩的"]],["",["有色的"]]],null,33859,2,0,[["Their flag was colourful.","他们的旗五颜六色。"]]],"colt":[[["n.",["小马","苔绳","无经验的年轻人"]]],"toefl gre",15287,1,0,"s:colts/i:colting"],"coltish":[[["adj.",["小马似的","蹦蹦跳跳的","不守纪律的"]]],"gre",41676,0,0],"column":[[["n.",["专栏","圆柱","纵队","列","柱形物"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky ielts",2074,3,1,"s:columns",[["The opinion column discusses the importance of voting.","意見欄討論了投票的重要性，"]]],"columnist":[[["n.",["专栏作家"]]],null,4402,2,0,"s:columnists",[["Ali works as a sports columnist for the newspaper.","阿里是報社的體育專欄作家。"]]],"coma":[[["n.",["昏迷","麻木","彗发"]],["",["彗差","彗形像差"]]],"gre",9163,1,0,"s:comas",[["The patient is in a deep coma.","患者现在处于深度昏迷状态。"]]],"comatose":[[["adj.",["昏睡的","昏睡状态的"]],["",["昏迷的"]]],"gre",19074,0,0],"comb":[[["v.",["梳头发","梳毛","(浪)涌起"]],["n.",["头梳","鸡冠"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky",7329,1,0,"p:combed/i:combing/s:combs",[["Comb your hair before you go out.","在你出門之前，把你的頭髮梳一梳。"]]],"combat":[[["v.",["战斗","争斗","与...战斗","与...斗争"]],["n.",["争斗","战斗"]]],"cet6 ky ielts gre",3412,3,0,"i:combating/3:combats/d:combatted/p:combated",[["In real combat, you must not forget that hesitation is a very dangerous thing.","在实战中，你要知道三心二意是很危险的。"]]],"combatant":[[["n.",["争斗者","格斗者"]],["",["战斗者","参战者"]]],null,10776,1,0,"s:combatants",[["The art of modern warfare does not necessarily require soldiers to be armed to the teeth to be effective as combatants.","現代戰術並無指明士兵必須全副武裝上陣