员","(南非)布尔人部队"]]],null,11443,1,0,"s:commandos"],"commemorate":[[["v.",["纪念"]]],"ky toefl ielts gre",8691,2,0,"i:commemorating/d:commemorated/3:commemorates",[["The Dragon Boat Festival commemorates Qu Yuan.","端午節是紀念屈原的。"]]],"commemoration":[[["n.",["纪念","纪念物","庆典"]]],null,15453,0,0,"s:commemorations"],"commemorative":[[["adj.",["纪念的"]]],null,15718,1,0,"s:commemoratives"],"commence":[[["v.",["(使)开始","得学位"]]],"cet6 ky toefl ielts gre",9454,1,0,"d:commenced/i:commencing/3:commences"],"commencement":[[["n.",["开始","毕业典礼"]]],"gre",13566,0,0,[["With North Korea's announcement on the 26th of its nuclear development plan based upon the agreement stemming from the Six Party Talks, and the United States' commencement of procedures to remove North Korea from its designation on the list of State Sponsors of Terrorism, the families of abductees have expressed growing unease that it may constitute an abandonment of the abductee issue.","随着北朝鲜在26号宣布了按照六方谈话上达成的共识所制定的核计划发展，美国将其从美国的恐怖主义捐助国的名单上去除。被绑架…"]]],"commend":[[["v.",["嘉奖","委托给","推荐"]]],"cet6 ky toefl ielts",10548,1,0,"d:commended/3:commends/i:commending",[["Mark is so honest that everybody commends him for it.","馬克是如此的誠實所以每個人都讚揚他。"]]],"commendable":[[["adj.",["值得赞美的","很好的"]]],null,19247,1,0,[["Emperor Qin Shi Huang and Emperor Wu of Han, though remarkable in their achievements, somewhat lacked in literary grace; Emperor Taizong of Tang and Emperor Taizu of Song, though commendable in their elegance, still fall slightly short in their brilliance. The proud conqueror, Genghis Khan, knew only how to bend the bow and shoot great eagles. All of them are now bygone, and if you want to count the truly remarkable figures, look to the present age.","惜秦皇汉武，略输文采；唐宗宋祖，稍逊风骚。一代天骄，成吉思汗，只识弯弓射大雕。俱往矣，数风流人物，还看今朝。"]]],"commensurate":[[["adj.",["同量的","同等的","相称的"]]],"gre",16742,0,0],"comment":[[["n.",["注解","批评","评论","备注"],["a written explanation or criticism or illustration that is added to a…"]],["v.",["评论","注解"],["make or write a comment on"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts",1363,4,1,"s:comments/p:commented/i:commenting",[["All you have to do is to make a comment.","你所要做的就是留下意見。"]]],"commentary":[[["n.",["注释","评论","说明","评注"]]],"cet6 toefl ielts gre",5032,2,0,"s:commentaries"],"commentate":[[["v.",["注释","解说","评论时事"]]],null,0,1,0,"i:commentating/p:commentated/3:commentates"],"commentator":[[["n.",["评论员","实况广播员","注释者","时事评论员"]]],"toefl",5355,3,0,"s:commentators",[["John Motson is one of the most famous British commentators.","约翰莫斯顿是英国最有名的评论员之一。"]]],"commerce":[[["n.",["商业","商务","贸易"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky toefl",4647,3,0,[["Osaka is the center of commerce in Japan.","大坂是日本的商业中心。"]]],"commercial":[[["adj.",["商业的","商用的","商品化的"],["connected with or engaged in or sponsored by or used in commerce or c…"]],["n.",["商业广告节目"],["a commercially sponsored ad on radio or television"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts",1027,4,1,"s:commercials",[["The economist and statistician based in Ivory Coast says commercial trade in the region is primarily conducted with France.","這位常駐科特迪瓦的經濟學家兼統計學家表示，該地區的商業貿易主要與法國進行。"]]],"commercialism":[[["n.",["商业主义","商业精神","利润第一主义","商业习惯","商业用语"]]],null,19499,0,0],"commercialization":[[["",["商业化"]]],null,15905,0,0],"commercialize":[[["v.",["使商业化","使商品化","使能营利","在...发展商业"]]],"toefl",18042,0,0,"p:commercialized/i:commercializing/3:commercializes"],"commercially":[[["adv.",["商业上","通商上"]]],null,8634,0,0],"commingle":[[["v.",["混合"]]],"toefl gre",27157,0,0,"p:commingled/i:commingling/3:commingles"],"commiserate":[[["v.",["怜悯","同情"]]],"toefl gre",23875,0,0,"p:commiserated/i:commiserating/s:commiserates"],"commission":[[["n.",["委任状","任官令","所委职责","佣金","犯"]],["v.",["委任","委托制作","使服役"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts gre",2379,4,1,"d:commissioned/s:commissions/i:commissioning",[["His remuneration consists of a base salary plus commissions.","他的薪水包括基本工資和提成。"]]],"commissioner":[[["n.",["委员","理事","行政长官","政府的特派员","地方地官"]]],"toefl",4320,3,0,"s:commissioners",[["It wasn't me, commissioner!","局长，那不是我！"]]],"commit":[[["v.",["委托(托付)","犯