刚开始并没有太多资金，也没有得到许多人的支持。我们的竞选活动并非始自华盛顿…"]]],"concourse":[[["n.",["集合","总汇","群集"]]],null,19068,0,0,"s:concourses"],"concrete":[[["adj.",["具体的","实在的","混凝土的"]],["n.",["凝结物","混凝土"]],["v.",["(使)凝结","用混凝土浇筑"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts gre",3310,3,1,"i:concreting/d:concreted/3:concretes",[["When we looked down, we saw a concrete jungle.","我們往下看，是一片水泥叢林。"]]],"concur":[[["v.",["同意","一致","同时发生","并发"]]],"toefl gre",9171,1,0,"p:concurred/3:concurs/i:concurring"],"concurrence":[[["n.",["赞同","意见一致","协力","同时发生","一致"]]],"toefl",21954,0,0],"concurrent":[[["adj.",["同时发生的","一致的","并行的","并发的","共行的"]],["n.",["同时发生的事件"]]],"toefl",12234,1,0,"s:concurrents"],"concurrently":[[["",["并行地"]]],null,15764,0,0],"concussion":[[["n.",["剧烈摇动","震荡"]]],"gre",12161,0,0,"s:concussions"],"condemn":[[["v.",["判刑","责备","谴责","定罪","宣告有罪"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts gre",4138,3,0,"d:condemned/i:condemning/3:condemns",[["It is important to condemn racism, but that alone is not enough.","譴責種族主義很重要，但光是譴責種族主義是不夠的。"]]],"condemnation":[[["n.",["非难","宣告有罪","非难的理由"]]],"toefl",9852,0,0,"s:condemnations"],"condensation":[[["n.",["压缩","凝缩","冷凝","冷凝作用","缩合"]]],"toefl",15298,0,0,"s:condensations"],"condense":[[["v.",["使浓缩","使压缩","缩短","浓缩","凝结"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts gre",13674,1,0,"d:condensed/i:condensing/s:condenses"],"condenser":[[["n.",["凝结器","冷凝器","缩写者","聚光器","电容器"]]],"toefl",27316,0,0,"s:condensers"],"condescend":[[["v.",["谦逊","屈就","堕落"]]],"gre",28540,0,0,"p:condescended/3:condescends/i:condescending",[["Sami was extremely rude and condescending to Layla.","Sami对Layla非常粗鲁和傲慢。"]]],"condescending":[[["adj.",["谦逊的","故意屈尊的","有优越感的"]]],"gre",15341,0,0,[["Sami was extremely rude and condescending to Layla.","Sami对Layla非常粗鲁和傲慢。"]]],"condescension":[[["n.",["屈尊","傲慢态度"]]],null,19400,0,0],"condign":[[["adj.",["(尤指惩罚)应得的","适宜的"]]],"gre",0,0,0],"condiment":[[["n.",["辛辣调味品"]],["",["调味品"]]],"toefl gre",16952,0,0,"s:condiments",[["The fridge is overloaded with condiments.","冰箱装满了调味品。"]]],"condition":[[["v.",["使健康","以.