 是三個女孩中跳得最漂亮的。"]]],"dancer":[[["n.",["舞蹈演员","跳舞者"]]],"ielts",3663,2,1,"s:dancers",[["I know that Tom is a terrible dancer.","我知道汤姆是个差劲的舞蹈员。"]]],"dandelion":[[["n.",["药蒲公英"]],["",["蒲公英"]]],null,16227,1,0,"s:dandelions"],"dandy":[[["adj.",["服装浮华的","极好的"]],["n.",["花花公子"]]],"gre",16577,1,0,"s:dandies/i:dandying/t:dandiest"],"dane":[[["n.",["丹麦人"]]],null,9795,0,0,"s:danes"],"danger":[[["n.",["危险","威胁","危险物","危机"],["the condition of being susceptible to harm or injury"]]],"zk gk cet4 ky ielts",1546,4,1,"s:dangers",[["Red, as opposed to green, is a sign of danger.","紅色，相對於綠色，是危險的標誌。"]]],"dangerous":[[["adj.",["危险的","危害的"],["involving or causing danger or risk; liable to hurt or harm"]]],"zk gk cet4 ky toefl ielts",1457,4,1,[["It can be dangerous for young people to ride motorcycles.","年轻人骑摩托车可能会很危险。"]]],"dangerously":[[["adv.",["危险","不安全"]]],null,8838,0,0],"dangle":[[["v.",["摇晃地悬挂着","追求","使摇晃地悬挂"]],["n.",["悬垂"]]],"toefl gre",5695,1,0,"i:dangling/p:dangled/3:dangles",[["The American Museum of Natural History’s “Creatures of Light” exhibit features jellyfish that glow green, anglerfish whose lantern-like bulbs dangle from their foreheads and luminous glowworms that hang mucus-like strands from cave ceilings to attract and ensnare their prey.","美國自然歷史博物館的「光之生物」展覽展出了發綠色光的水母、額頭上提著燈籠的琵琶魚，以及在洞穴頂棚上懸掛粘液狀細絲，用來…"]]],"danish":[[["adj.",["丹麦的","丹麦人的","丹麦文的"]],["n.",["丹麦文"]]],null,8261,0,0,[["My Danish pronunciation is not very accurate.","我的丹麦语发音不是很标准。"]]],"dank":[[["adj.",["阴湿的","潮湿的"]]],"toefl gre",16049,0,0,"r:danker"],"dapper":[[["adj.",["整洁的","整齐的","短小精悍的"]]],"gre",18440,0,0,"s:dappers"],"dappled":[[["adj.",["斑纹的","花斑的"]]],"gre",22117,0,0],"dare":[[["n.",["挑战","挑动","大胆"]],["v.",["敢","胆敢"]]],"zk gk cet4 cet6 ky",3348,3,1,"p:dared/i:daring/3:dares",[["I don't dare ask the boss to borrow the car.","我不敢問老闆借車。"]]],"daredevil":[[["n.",["铤而走险的人","蛮勇的人"]],["adj.",["蛮勇的","不怕死的"]]],"gre",22673,0,0,"s:daredevils"],"dark":[[["adj.",["黑暗的","暗的","深色的","隐密的","模糊的"],["devoid of or deficient in li