 true?","聽說不交水費就會被停水，是真的嗎？"]]],"defeat":[[["n.",["败北","失败"]],["v.",["击败","使落空"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts",3326,4,1,"d:defeated/s:defeats/i:defeating",[["Being challenged in life is inevitable, being defeated is optional.","生命中你无法选择接踵而至的挑战，但是你可以选择不成为一个失败者。"]]],"defeatist":[[["n.",["失败主义者"]]],"gre",28702,0,0,"s:defeatists",[["You can't fight a good fight with such a defeatist attitude.","抱著失敗主義的態度你無法打一場漂亮的仗。"]]],"defecate":[[["v.",["除去污物","澄清","净化","排便"]]],"toefl",26436,0,0,"p:defecated/i:defecating/3:defecates"],"defect":[[["",["缺损","缺陷"]],["n.",["缺点"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts gre",5946,2,0,"s:defects/p:defected/i:defecting",[["To be perfect she lacked just one defect.","要变得完美，她就是少了一个缺点。"]]],"defection":[[["n.",["背叛","缺乏","毛病","缺点","过失"]]],"toefl",13837,0,0,"s:defections"],"defective":[[["adj.",["有缺陷的","欠缺的"]],["n.",["有缺陷的人","不完全变化词"]]],"toefl",10995,1,0,"s:defectives",[["Some diseases are caused by a defective gene.","一些疾病的产生原因是基因缺陷。"]]],"defector":[[["n.",["背叛者","叛离者","变节分子","开小差者"]]],null,15798,0,0,"s:defectors"],"defence":[[["n.",["防卫","防卫设备"]],["",["(诉讼程序中的)辩护"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky ielts",21674,4,1,"s:defences"],"defend":[[["v.",["防护","辩护","防卫","作...的辩护律师","为...答辩"],["argue or speak in defense of"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky toefl",1750,4,1,"i:defending/d:defended/3:defends",[["To defend ourselves, we had to tell a lie.","為了保護自己，我們只好說謊。"]]],"defendant":[[["n.",["被告"]],["",["被告方"]]],"cet6 ielts gre",3356,2,0,"s:defendants",[["The defendant will appeal to a higher court.","被告会向上级法院上诉。"]]],"defender":[[["n.",["防卫者","防护者","辩护者"]],["",["辩护人","保护人"]]],null,4820,2,0,"s:defenders",[["England always does well in the World Cup matches because of their strong defenders.","因为有强大的后卫，英格兰队在世界杯比赛中总是表现良好。"]]],"defense":[[["n.",["防卫","防卫物"],["(military) military action or resources protecting a country against …"]],["",["防御"]]],"toefl gre",657,0,0,"s:defenses",[["The defense of the master thesis is just happening next month.","下个月就要进行硕士论文答辩了。"]]],"defenseless":[[["adj.",["无防备的"]]