胚胎的"]]],"toefl gre",10348,0,0],"emend":[[["v.",["修订","校勘"]]],"toefl gre",45301,0,0,"d:emended/i:emending/3:emends"],"emerald":[[["n.",["翡翠","绿宝石","翠绿色"]],["adj.",["翡翠的","翠绿色的"]]],"gre",12382,1,0,"s:emeralds"],"emerge":[[["v.",["浮现","形成","出现","(事实)显露"],["come out into view, as from concealment"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts",1300,4,1,"p:emerged/3:emerges/i:emerging",[["A chicken hatches an egg and a chick emerges.","母雞孵蛋，孵出小雞。"]]],"emergence":[[["n.",["出现","浮现","发生"]]],"toefl",5719,0,0,[["The 1960s saw the emergence of the Civil Rights movement in the United States.","一九六零年代，美國興起民權運動。"]]],"emergency":[[["n.",["紧急状况","紧急事件","紧急需要"],["a sudden unforeseen crisis (usually involving danger) that requires i…"]],["",["紧急情况"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky ielts gre",1725,4,1,"s:emergencies",[["In case of an emergency, get in touch with my agent.","万一有紧急情况，联系我的代理人。"]]],"emergent":[[["adj.",["紧急的","浮现的","出现的","自然发生的","意外的"]]],null,13858,0,0,"s:emergents"],"emeritus":[[["adj.",["名誉退休的","退休后保留头衔的"]]],null,10529,0,0],"emigrant":[[["n.",["移民","侨民"]],["adj.",["移民的","移居的"]]],"toefl",15516,1,0,"s:emigrants",[["The emigrants have endured physical and mental pain.","移民们忍受着肉体和精神的痛苦。"]]],"emigrate":[[["v.",["(使)移居","(使)移民"]]],"cet6 ky toefl ielts gre",10660,2,0,"p:emigrated/i:emigrating/3:emigrates"],"emigration":[[["n.",["移民","移居外国(或外地)"]],["",["血细胞渗出"]]],null,12465,0,0,"s:emigrations"],"emigre":[[["n.",["逃亡者","流亡者"]]],null,18098,0,0,"s:emigres"],"eminence":[[["n.",["显赫","名家","高处"]],["",["隆起","隆凸"]]],"toefl gre",20054,1,0,"s:eminences"],"eminent":[[["adj.",["显赫的","杰出的","有名的"]]],"ky toefl ielts gre",11109,1,0],"eminently":[[["adv.",["很","突出地","非常"]]],null,16238,1,0],"emir":[[["n.",["埃米尔(穆斯林国家酋长等的称号)"]]],null,20573,1,0,"s:emirs"],"emirate":[[["n.",["埃米尔的地位","酋长国"]]],null,23668,1,0,"s:emirates"],"emissary":[[["n.",["密使","间谍","使者"]],["adj.",["充当密使的","充当间谍的"]]],"gre",16487,0,0,"s:emissaries"],"emission":[[["n.",["发射","射出","发行","遗精"]]],"cet6 toefl",2915,2,0,"s:emissions",[["Saving energy can reduce the emission of greenhouse gases into the atmosphere.","節約能源可減少溫室氣體排出到大氣層。"]]],"emit":[[["v.",["发出","放射","发表(意见等)","散发","发行"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts gre",6273,1,0,"p:emitted/i:emitting/3:emits"],"emmy":[[["n.",["埃米奖(美国电视艺术奖)"]]],null,9462,0,0],"emollient":[[["n.",["软化剂","润肤剂"]],["adj.",["使柔软的"]]],"gre",37573,0,0,"s:emollients"],"emolument":[[["n.",["薪水","报酬"]]],"toefl gre",44843,0,0,"s:emoluments"],"emote":[[["v.",["装模作样","表现感情"]]],"gre",31449,0,0,"i:emoting/3:emotes/p:emoted"],"emotion":[[["n.",["情绪","激动","强烈的情感","情感"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts",2117,3,1,"s:emotions",[["Having a competitive mentality can give rise to negative emotions.","攀比心理会让人产生负面情绪。"]]],"emotional":[[["adj.",["情绪的","情感的"],["determined or actuated by emotion rather than reason"]]],"cet4 cet6 toefl",1617,3,1,[["It is not good for a scientist to get emotional.","對一個科學家來說，多愁善感是不好的。"]]],"emotionally":[[["adv.",["在情绪上"]]],null,4650,0,1],"emotive":[[["adj.",["使感动的","动感情的","感情的","情绪的"]]],null,22370,1,0],"empathetic":[[["adj.",["移情作用的","同感的（等于empathic）"]]],null,17215,0,0],"empathize":[[["",["移情","神入"]]],null,16751,0,0,"i:empathizing/3:empathizes/d:empathized"],"empathy":[[["n.",["移情作用","共鸣"]],["",["移情","神入"]]],"gre",7585,1,0,"s:empathies"],"emperor":[[["n.",["皇帝","君主"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky ielts",7060,2,0,"s:emperors",[["In an empty place, an emperor has no power.","在空無一物的地方, 皇帝再大的權力也無用。"]]],"emphasis":[[["n.",["强调","加强","重点","强语气"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky toefl",2346,3,1,[["I would like to place particular emphasis on this point.","我想特别强调这一点。"]]],"emphasize":[[["v.",["强调","加强语气","着重"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts",1975,3,1,"d:emphasized/3:emphasizes/i:emphasizing",[["Line art emphasizes form and outline, over color, shading, and texture.","線條藝術強調形式和輪廓，而不是顏色、陰影和紋理。"]]],"emphatic":[[["adj.",["语调强的","着重的","强调了的"]]],"toefl gre",14058,1,0],"emphatically":[[["adv.",["强调地","着重地"]]],null,10680,1,0],"emphysema":[[["n.",["肺气肿","气肿"]]],null,17854,0,0],"empire":[[["n.",["帝国","帝权"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky",4218,3,1,"s:empires",[["They built their empire in Peru about five hundred years ago.","他们大约五百年前在秘鲁建立了帝国。"]]],"empirical":[[["adj.",["完全跟据经验的","经验主义的"]]],"cet6 ky ielts gre",5285,1,0,"s:empiricals",[["In its more extreme variants, cis ideology can include denial of the empirical reality of intersex and transgender people.","在更極端的變體中，順性別意識形態可能包括否認陰陽人和跨性別者的現實經歷。"]]],"empirically":[[["adv.",["以经验为主地"]]],null,12908,0,0],"empiricism":[[["n.",["经验主义","庸医的医术","经验论"]],["",["经验医学"]]],"gre",24305,0,0],"employ":[[["v.",["雇用","使用","使从事于"]],["n.",["雇用"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky toefl",1962,3,1,"d:employed/3:employs/i:employing",[["His age didn't enter into our decision not to employ him.","我们决定不录用他时，并没有考虑他的年龄问题。"]]],"employee":[[["n.",["职员","员工","受雇人员"],["a worker who is hired to perform a job"]],["",["职工","雇员"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts",930,4,1,"s:employees",[["Two thirds of the employees of this company are engineers.","这个公司三分之二的雇员是工程师。"]]],"employer":[[["n.",["雇主","老板","业主"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts",2297,3,1,"s:employers",[["Germany is to ban employers from snooping on Facebook.","德国将禁止雇主在脸书上偷窥。"]]],"employment":[[["n.",["雇用","职业","工作","职工招请"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky ielts",2534,3,1,"s:employments",[["They guaranteed regular employment to their workers.","他們對他們的員工保證就業。"]]],"empower":[[["v.",["授予权力","允许","使能够"]],["",["授权","准许","转委"]]],"toefl gre",6207,1,0,"d:empowered/3:empowers/i:empowering"],"empowerment":[[["n.",["授权","许可"]]],null,8404,0,0],"empress":[[["n.",["皇后","女皇"]]],null,20918,1,0,"s:empresses",[["This 14th of May of 2025 is cloudy skies interspersed with blue spaces. I walked to the Roman Catholic church on St. Albans Road twice, once in the morning and again in the afternoon, my 12th and 13th times this spring. In the morning was confession for the little boys and girls in uniform. They were of different races, in the big worship hall. The priest was in the confession booth talking to a student. At the Adoration Chapel, I noticed a nice pot of orchids on the front left. In the afternoon, the big worship hall was mostly empty, a condition which I usually prefer. At the road was a handsome muscle man in white tank top jogging. The big purple-bloom tree seems like an Empress Tree, a Paulownia, because of the big heart-shaped leaves. Reminiscent of Jacaranda with its purple blooming, it's saudade for me about South America. At Tim Hortons café, I enjoyed Scrambled Eggs with Sausage and Potatoes and an Earl Grey Tea with oat milk in the morning, and an Iced Classic Lemonade in the afternoon. The day was full of walking. At home, I study bits of Lojban and Esperanto. I have many books in Esperanto. I tend towards Animism-Buddhism in my Syncretism.","2025 年 5 月 14 日，天空多雲，間或有藍色空間。我兩次走到聖奧爾本斯路上的羅馬天主教堂，一次在早上，一次在下…"]]],"emptiness":[[["n.",["空虚","无知"]]],null,9389,1,0,"s:emptinesses",[["It's Lulu Island, 3 August 2025. After supper—green figs tender with sunlight, sweet vinegar from yesterday’s pickled jar, and reheated Alfredo—I sat on the balcony and watched the conifer. Stillness below, a street without cars, without haste. My lime water, iced, caught the light. Michael, the Franco-Danish ufologist, has been in my conversations lately. We speak of inner things: the trance of smart devices, the mind’s eye dwindling. He says cafés aren’t cafés anymore. People forget how to look, how to linger. I tell him of Arthur in Japan—how he'd stare into blank walls like a monk gazing at emptiness. Lately I ask machines to speak like poets, and they do. They mimic Elizabethan verses and the old wistful lilt of Tagalog ballads. I pick blackberries along the path to Tim Hortons. \"¡Moras!\" I shout like a child. My friend Mora, whose blood flows with Andes mist, would smile. Today, I bought lemons. I meant limes, but lemons are all right. / blackberry morning— / a fig's ghost on my fingers / and the street still sleeps","現在是 2025 年 8 月 3 日，露露島。晚餐後，陽光下嫩綠的無花果，昨天醃製的甜醋，還有重新加熱的阿爾弗雷多義麵…"]]],"empty":[[["adj.",["空的","空虚的","空腹的","空洞的"]],["v.",["倒空","使变空","使排出","流空"],["make void or empty of contents"]],["n.",["空的东西","空车"],["a container that has been emptied"]],["",["空"]]],"zk gk toefl ielts",1644,3,1,"d:emptied/i:emptying/3:empties/r:emptier/t:emptiest",[["I hurried to the house only to find it empty.","我匆匆忙忙的趕到那房子去，但卻發現裏面原來是空的。"]]],"empty-handed":[[["adj.",["空手的","徒手的"]]],null,0,1,0],"empyreal":[[["adj.",["最高天的","九天的","苍天的"]]],"gre",0,0,0],"empyrean":[[["n.",["最高天","九天","苍天"]]],"gre",0,0,0],"emulate":[[["v.",["效法","尽力赶上","同...竞争"]],["",["仿真"]]],"toefl gre",9025,1,0,"d:emulated/i:emulating/3:emulates"],"emulsify":[[["v.",["使乳化"]],["",["乳化"]]],"gre",33777,0,0,"3:emulsifies/d:emulsified/i:emulsifying"],"emulsion":[[["n.",["乳状液","乳剂","乳化作用","乳液","乳浊液"]]],null,20596,1,0,"s:emulsions/d:emulsioned"],"enable":[[["",["允许","使能","打开"]],["v.",["使能够"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky toefl",2192,3,1,"3:enables/p:enabled/i:enabling",[["His large income enables him to travel abroad every year.","他的收入很高，所以每年都能出國旅行。"]]],"enact":[[["v.",["制定法律","扮演","颁布"]],["",["法令","法规","条例"]]],"toefl gre",4710,2,0,"d:enacted/i:enacting/3:enacts"],"enactment":[[["n.",["制定","条例","法规","法令","颁布"]]],"toefl",12667,0,0,"s:enactments"],"enamel":[[["n.",["珐琅","瓷釉"]],["v.",["涂以瓷釉","彩饰"]]],"gre",12226,1,0,"s:enamels/p:enamelled/i:enamelling"],"enamor":[[["v.",["迷住","使迷恋"]]],null,17342,0,0,"i:enamoring/p:enamored/3:enamors",[["He was enamored of the girl.","我迷上一个女孩。"]]],"enamored":[[["adj.",["倾心于...的","被迷住的","迷恋的"]]],"gre",26372,0,0,[["He was enamored of the girl.","我迷上一个女孩。"]]],"encampment":[[["n.",["露营","宿营"]]],null,15809,0,0,"s:encampments",[["We ambushed several hundred of their new J-37 robots behind enemy lines in a staging area and we destroyed them all by sending a herd of explosive laden sheep through their encampment.","我們在敵後集結區伏擊了他們數百台新型 J-37 機器人，並透過派出一群攜帶炸藥的綿羊穿過他們的營地，將它們全部摧毀。"]]],"encapsulate":[[["v.",["装入胶囊","封进内部","压缩","做成胶囊"]]],"gre",15818,1,0,"d:encapsulated/3:encapsulates/i:encapsulating"],"encase":[[["v.",["把...装入箱内","包住"]]],"toefl",13206,1,0,"d:encased/i:encasing/s:encases"],"enchant":[[["v.",["施魔法","使入迷"]]],"cet6 toefl gre",17449,1,0,"d:enchanted/3:enchants/i:enchanting"],"enchanted":[[["adj.",["中魔法的","着了魔的","狂喜的","极乐的"]]],null,15015,0,0],"enchanting":[[["adj.",["迷人的","妩媚的","迷惑人的"]]],null,17378,1,0],"enchantment":[[["n.",["魔法","妖术","魅力"]]],null,17674,0,0,"s:enchantments"],"enchilada":[[["n.",["以辣椒调味之一种墨西哥菜"]]],null,19992,0,0,"s:enchiladas"],"encipher":[[["v.",["译成密码"]],["",["编码"]]],"gre",0,0,0,"i:enciphering/p:enciphered/3:enciphers"],"encircle":[[["v.",["环绕","围绕","包围"]]],null,10550,1,0,"p:encircled/i:encircling/3:encircles",[["The pond was encircled with trees.","池溏的四周長滿了樹木。"]]],"enclave":[[["n.",["被包围的领土"]],["",["被包围物"]]],null,9097,1,0,"s:enclaves"],"enclose":[[["v.",["围绕","圈起","放入封套","附上"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts",8459,2,0,"d:enclosed/i:enclosing/3:encloses",[["She sent me the enclosed check.","她把随附的支票寄给了我。"]]],"enclosure":[[["n.",["附件","围墙","围绕"]],["",["机壳","外壳"]]],"cet6 ky toefl ielts gre",9856,1,0,"s:enclosures",[["An initial medical examination conducted in September showed the elephant’s nails had cracked and were overgrown due to improper care and an insufficient enclosure with flooring that damaged its feet.","9 月進行的初步體檢顯示，由於照料不當和圍欄地面破損，導致大象的爪子開裂並過度生長，從而損傷了牠的腳。"]]],"encode":[[["v.",["把(电文、情报等)译成密码"]],["",["编码"]]],null,11568,1,0,"i:encoding/d:encoded/3:encodes",[["If you want to use Chinese characters, be sure you've saved your files in the UTF-8 encoding.","如果你想使用中文字符，你应该以UTF-8编码来保存你的文件。"]]],"encomiast":[[["n.",["宣读或写作颂辞之人","赞美者","阿谀者"]]],"gre",0,0,0],"encomium":[[["n.",["赞辞","称赞","赞美"]]],"gre",33489,0,0,"s:encomiums"],"encompass":[[["v.",["围绕","完成","包括","包含","环绕"]]],"toefl gre",5635,1,0,"3:encompasses/i:encompassing/p:encompassed"],"encore":[[["n.",["再演唱的要求","要次登场"]],["int.",["再演唱一次"]],["v.",["要求再演(或唱)"]]],null,18134,1,0,"s:encores/d:encored/i:encoring",[["The pianist played two encores.","這位鋼琴家演奏了兩首安可曲。"]]],"encounter":[[["v.",["遇见","邂逅","会战","偶然相遇"]],["n.",["相会","相遇","遭遇"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts gre",2712,3,1,"d:encountered/s:encounters/i:encountering",[["His encounter with her is enriching his inner life.","与她的相遇丰富了他的精神生活。"]]],"encourage":[[["v.",["鼓励","支持","激励"],["inspire with confidence; give hope or courage to"]],["",["怂恿","煽动","助长"]]],"zk gk cet4 cet6 ky toefl",1184,4,1,"d:encouraged/3:encourages/i:encouraging",[["Tom encouraged Mary to learn how to speak French.","汤姆鼓励玛丽学着说法语。"]]],"encouragement":[[["n.",["鼓励","激励","奖励"]],["",["怂恿","煽动","助长"]]],"gk",6193,2,1,"s:encouragements",[["Tom needs encouragement.","湯姆需要鼓勵。"]]],"encroach":[[["v.",["侵犯","侵蚀","蚕食","侵入","侵占"]]],"toefl gre",15316,1,0,"d:encroached/i:encroaching/3:encroaches"],"encroachment":[[["n.",["侵蚀","侵犯","侵占","侵入"]]],null,16225,0,0,"s:encroachments"],"encrust":[[["v.",["包上外壳","镶嵌外层","结壳"]]],null,19368,0,0,"d:encrusted/i:encrusting/3:encrusts"],"encryption":[[["",["加密"]]],null,15642,0,0,"s:encryptions"],"encumber":[[["v.",["妨害","阻塞","拖累"]],["",["使负(债等)","负有义务"]]],"toefl gre",27430,0,0,"d:encumbered/i:encumbering/s:encumbers"],"encyclopedia":[[["n.",["百科全书"]]],"ky toefl ielts gre",10470,1,0,"s:encyclopedias",[["I want to leave my name on the encyclopedia.","我要在百科全書上留名。"]]],"encyclopedic":[[["adj.",["如百科辞典的","百科全书式的"]]],"gre",20268,0,0,[["She has an encyclopedic knowledge of cooking.","她是一部活生生的廚藝百科全書。"]]],"end":[[["n.",["结束","终点","目标","末端","梢"],["either extremity of something that has length"]],["v.",["结束","终结","终止"]]],"zk gk ielts",278,5,1,"p:ended/s:ends/i:ending",[["The unhappy event made him put an end to himself.","那件不幸的事故使他自殺身亡。"]]],"endanger":[[["v.",["危及","使危险"]]],"cet6 toefl",7141,2,0,"i:endangering/d:endangered/3:endangers",[["Murdering elephants, tigers and other endangered species is not just cruel; it's also illegal.","杀害大象、老虎等濒危物种，不仅是残忍的，也是非法的。"]]],"endear":[[["v.",["使受喜爱","使受钟爱"]]],null,18772,1,0,"p:endeared/3:endears/i:endearing"],"endearing":[[["adj.",["引起爱情的","令人钟爱的","可爱的"]]],"gre",15909,1,0],"endeavor":[[["n.",["努力","尽力"]],["v.",["努力","尽力"]]],"cet6 ky toefl",5892,0,0,"s:endeavors/i:endeavoring/p:endeavored",[["He 