ual tailoring techniques to enhance and exhibit every unique female form.","一件传统式样的旗袍是完全手工制作的，也需要劳动密集的裁缝业技术，为了增加而显示每种独一无二的女性体态。"]]],"enhancement":[[["n.",["提高","美化","增进","增强","增加"]]],null,7849,0,0,"s:enhancements"],"enigma":[[["n.",["谜","费解的事物"]]],"toefl",14247,1,0,"s:enigmas"],"enigmatic":[[["adj.",["费解的","谜一般的","高深莫测的"]]],"toefl",11873,1,0,[["The Mona Lisa has an enigmatic smile.","蒙娜丽莎有着神秘的微笑。"]]],"enjoin":[[["v.",["吩咐","命令","嘱咐","禁止","责成"]]],"gre",19159,0,0,"p:enjoined/3:enjoins/i:enjoining"],"enjoy":[[["v.",["享受","喜欢","欣赏","享有","获得某种利益"],["derive or receive pleasure from; get enjoyment from; take pleasure in"]]],"zk gk",881,4,1,"p:enjoyed/i:enjoying/3:enjoys",[["We enjoyed watching the fireworks on a bridge last summer.","去年夏天，我们在桥上看焰火看得很过瘾。"]]],"enjoyable":[[["adj.",["可从中得到乐趣的","令人愉快的"]]],"gk",9019,2,1,[["This photograph reminds me of enjoyable times when I was a child.","这张照片让我想起童年的快乐时光。"]]],"enjoyment":[[["n.",["享乐","快乐","享受"]],["",["使用权"]]],null,7629,1,1,"s:enjoyments",[["No hobby is as cheap as reading, nor provides such long lasting enjoyment.","没有任何娱乐像阅读这般廉价，也没有任何愉悦像阅读这般持久。"]]],"enlarge":[[["v.",["扩大","增大","详述"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky",7530,2,0,"d:enlarged/i:enlarging/3:enlarges",[["He tried to enlarge his sphere of influence.","他试图扩大自己的势力范围。"]]],"enlargement":[[["n.",["扩大","肿大","肥大","增大","放大的照片"]]],null,13723,0,0,"s:enlargements"],"enlighten":[[["v.",["教育","启发","启蒙","开导","教导"]]],"cet6 ky toefl ielts gre",11536,1,0,"i:enlightening/d:enlightened/3:enlightens",[["The most enlightened way of living is to despise social conventions while at the same time living your life in conformity to them.","最光明的处世方法是既蔑视社会的因袭，又过着与社会的因袭不相矛盾的生活。"]]],"enlightened":[[["adj.",["有知识的","进步的","文明的"]]],null,10398,1,0,[["The most enlightened way of living is to despise social conventions while at the same time living your life in conformity to them.","最光明的处世方法是既蔑视社会的因袭，又过着与社会的因袭不相矛盾的生活。"]]],"enlightenment":[[["n.",["启迪","教化"]]],"toefl",11067,1,0,"s:enlightenments",[["Vesak is a Buddhist holiday which celebrates the birth, enlightenment and death of the Buddha.","卫塞节是佛教的一个节日，纪念佛陀的诞生、成道和涅槃。"]]],"enlist":[[["v.",["征募","参与","谋取","从军","应募"]]],"ky toefl gre",5254,1,0,"p:enlisted/i:enlisting/3:enlists",[["Enlist!","參加吧！"]]],"enlistment":[[["n.",["征募","服役期限"]]],null,19063,0,0,"s:enlistments"],"enliven":[[["v.",["使活泼","使生动"]]],"gre",15255,1,0,"d:enlivened/3:enlivens/i:enlivening"],"enmesh":[[["v.",["使绊住","使陷入"]]],"gre",20263,0,0,"d:enmeshed/i:enmeshing/3:enmeshes"],"enmity":[[["n.",["敌意","憎恨"]]],"toefl gre",17158,0,0,"s:enmities"],"ennoble":[[["v.",["授予爵位","使高贵"]]],"gre",25832,0,0,"d:ennobled/i:ennobling/s:ennobles"],"ennui":[[["n.",["倦怠","厌倦"]]],"toefl gre",24297,0,0],"enormity":[[["n.",["暴行","极恶","巨大","重罪","大罪"]]],"toefl gre",15686,0,0,"s:enormities",[["And I know you didn't do this just to win an election. And I know you didn't do it for me. You did it because you understand the enormity of the task that lies ahead. For even as we celebrate tonight, we know the challenges that tomorrow will bring are the greatest of our lifetime: two wars, a planet in peril, the worst financial crisis in a century.","我知道你们的所做的一切并不只是为了赢得选举，我也知道你们做这一切并不是为了我。你们这样做是因为你们明白前面的任务有多么…"]]],"enormous":[[["adj.",["巨大的","庞大的"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts gre",1994,3,1,[["Compiling a dictionary demands an enormous amount of time.","編字典是一項極花時間的工作。"]]],"enormously":[[["adv.",["非常地","巨大地"]]],null,7412,0,0],"enough":[[["n.",["充足","够","很多"],["an adequate quantity; a quantity that is large enough to achieve a pu…"]],["adj.",["充足的","足够"]],["adv.",["足够"]],["int.",["够了"]]],"zk gk",374,5,1,[["He was kind enough to take me to the hospital.","他好心地把我送到医院。"]]],"enquire":[[["v.",["询问"]]],"ky ielts",29201,0,0,"p:enquired/i:enquiring/3:enquires",[["I am going to enquire at the service desk if there are any restaurants around here.","我要去櫃台打聽這裡附近有沒有餐廳。"]]],"enquirer":[[["n.",["寻问者","追究者"]]],null,13831,0,0,"s:enquirers"],"enquiry":[[["",["询价","询盘"]],["n.",["询问"]]],"gk ielts",24159,0,1,"s:enquiries"],