ls in the world act with clear goals and distinct intentions. But once these actions are brought together by the great torrents of life, clarity recedes and chaos ensues.","世界上任何人的独自活动，都是清醒而目标明确的，然而一旦被生活的洪流聚在一起，就变得混沌不清了。"]]],"ensuing":[[["adj.",["接著发生的"]]],null,9789,0,0],"ensure":[[["v.",["确定","保证","担保","保护","确保"],["v make certain of"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky gre",1754,4,1,"i:ensuring/3:ensures/p:ensured",[["I want to ensure my phone has good customer support.","我想要確定手機能有優秀的客戶服務。"]]],"entail":[[["v.",["使成为必需","需要","使承担","遗传给"]],["n.",["限定继承"]]],"cet6 ky toefl ielts gre",6162,1,0,"3:entails/p:entailed/i:entailing"],"entangle":[[["v.",["使纠缠","卷入","使混乱"]]],"toefl ielts gre",14257,1,0,"d:entangled/i:entangling/3:entangles"],"entanglement":[[["n.",["纠缠","卷入","缠绕物"]],["",["缠结"]]],"toefl",15426,0,0,"s:entanglements"],"enter":[[["v.",["进入","参加","开始","输入","回车"],["to come or go into"]]],"zk gk cet4 ky",709,4,1,"p:entered/i:entering/3:enters",[["She scraped her shoes clean before she entered the house.","她进屋前擦了鞋。"]]],"enterprise":[[["n.",["企业","事业心","进取心","干事业"]]],"gk cet6 ky toefl ielts gre",2499,3,0,"s:enterprises",[["Seven months ago, chefs from a Lebanese social enterprise named Souk el Tayeb began teaching the women new cooking skills, including such traditional dishes as samke harra — fish stuffed with pine nuts, coriander and chili sauce — and ma'amoul cookies.","七個月前，一家名為蘇克埃爾塔耶布的黎巴嫩社會企業的廚師開始教這些婦女新的烹飪技能，包括薩姆克哈拉 (在魚裡塞滿松子、香…"]]],"enterprising":[[["adj.",["有魄力的","有进取心的","有事业心的"]]],"toefl",16208,0,0],"entertain":[[["v.",["娱乐","招待","怀抱","款待"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky toefl",4949,3,1,"d:entertained/i:entertaining/3:entertains",[["I think a movie is more entertaining than any book.","我认为一部电影的乐趣远胜于任何一本书。"]]],"entertainer":[[["n.",["表演娱乐节目的人","演艺人员"]]],"toefl",8547,1,1,"s:entertainers"],"entertainment":[[["n.",["娱乐","款待","娱乐表演"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts",2350,3,1,"s:entertainments",[["The latest entertainment magazine has many Korean influences.","最近的娛樂雜誌上很多有關韓流的內容。"]]],"enthral":[[["v.",[