outh Korean woman has headed into orbit, and it will also be the first time that \"kimchi\"—that spicy, garlicky cabbage dish that epitomizes South Korea—will be served at the zero-gravity dinner table.","這次任務充滿了里程碑：這將是韓國女性首次進入太空軌道，也是代表韓國的蒜味辣白菜——「泡菜」，第一次出現在零重力餐桌上。"]]],"epoch":[[["n.",["新纪元","时代","时期"]]],"cet6 ky toefl ielts gre",12794,1,0,"s:epochs"],"eponymous":[[["adj.",["齐名的"]]],null,23201,1,0],"epoxy":[[["",["环氧","表氧","桥氧"]],["adj.",["环氧的"]]],null,17451,0,0,"3:epoxies/p:epoxied"],"equable":[[["adj.",["平静的","变动小的"]]],"gre",43969,0,0,[["It's lucky that his parents are so equable.","值得庆幸的是他双亲性情非常温和。"]]],"equal":[[["adj.",["相等的","平等的","胜任的","合适的","平静的"],["having the same quantity, value, or measure as another"]],["n.",["对手","匹敌","同辈"]],["v.",["等于","比得上"],["be identical or equivalent to"]],["",["等长度编码"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts",1830,4,1,"3:equals/d:equalled/i:equalling",[["No, that's not right. You have to set α equal to β.","不，这样不对。应该设α等于β。"]]],"equality":[[["n.",["平等","均匀","相等","同等"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky toefl",4590,0,0,"s:equalities",[["The love of democracy is that of equality.","爱民主就是爱平等。"]]],"equalize":[[["v.",["使相等","补偿","相等"]]],null,17737,2,0,"d:equalized/i:equalizing/3:equalizes",[["In the last minute, Marcello scored an equalizing goal.","在最后一分钟，马塞洛射进一球，将比赛打成平局。"]]],"equally":[[["adv.",["相等地","同样地","平等地"]]],null,2369,1,1,[["By the 1940s, the qipao came in a wide variety of designs and fabrics, with an equally wide variety of accessories.","到了四十年代，旗袍有了种类繁多的图案和面料，也有了同样种类繁多的饰品。"]]],"equanimity":[[["n.",["平静","镇定","沉着"]]],"gre",22634,0,0],"equate":[[["v.",["使相等","视为平等","等同"]]],"cet6 toefl gre",7997,1,0,"d:equated/3:equates/i:equating",[["You can't equate nationalism with fascism.","你不能將民族主義與法西斯混為一談。"]]],"equation":[[["n.",["相等","等式","平衡","方程式","反应式"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts gre",3982,2,0,"s:equations",[["It's stable because all the roots of this equation are negative.","它是可靠的, 因為這個方程式所有的根都是負的。"]]],"equator":[[["n.",["赤道","中纬线"]]],"cet6 ky toefl ielts g