ated at a great distance in time or space or degree"]]],"zk gk",252,5,1,"r:further/t:furthest",[["That way is very far, so we took a taxi.","那路当然挺远的，我们打的去算了。"]]],"far-reaching":[[["adj.",["深远的","广泛的","伸至远处的"]]],"toefl gre",0,1,0],"faraway":[[["adj.",["遥远的","恍惚的","出神的"]]],null,12293,1,0,[["A good neighbour is better than a faraway friend.","一個好鄰居勝於一個遙遠的朋友。"]]],"farce":[[["n.",["闹剧","滑稽剧","胡闹"]]],"toefl gre",13948,1,0,"s:farces/i:farcing/p:farced"],"fare":[[["v.",["进展","进步","经营","过活"]],["n.",["费用","旅客","食物"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky ielts",4776,3,0,"s:fares/d:fared/i:faring",[["What is the fare from Osaka to Akita?","从大阪到秋田的车费是多少？"]]],"farewell":[[["n.",["辞别","再见","再会"]],["int.",["再会"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky ielts gre",8121,2,0,"s:farewells",[["A farewell meeting was held in honor of Mr Jones.","舉行了一場歡送會以紀念瓊斯先生。"]]],"farm":[[["n.",["农场","农田"],["workplace consisting of farm buildings and cultivated land as a unit"]],["v.",["耕种","种田"],["be a farmer; work as a farmer"]]],"zk gk ielts",1258,4,1,"s:farms/d:farmed/i:farming",[["I live on a farm not too far from Boston.","我住在离波士顿不远的一个农场。"]]],"farmer":[[["n.",["农夫","农场主","农民","承包者"],["a person who operates a farm"]]],"zk gk cet4 cet6 ky",1589,4,1,"s:farmers",[["\"Get rid of it, of course!\" answered the farmer.","\"擺脫它, 當然!\" 這個農夫回答。"]]],"farmhouse":[[["n.",["农舍"]]],null,8393,1,0,"s:farmhouses"],"farmland":[[["n.",["农田"]]],null,8682,1,0,"s:farmlands"],"farrow":[[["n.",["一窝小猪","猪的一胎"]]],"gre",0,0,0,"i:farrowing/p:farrowed/s:farrows"],"fart":[[["n.",["屁"]],["v.",["放屁"]]],null,18709,1,0,"i:farting/s:farts/p:farted",[["I farted in class, and the teacher threw me out.","我上課的時候放屁，被老師趕出了班房。"]]],"fascia":[[["n.",["带","招牌"]],["",["筋膜","绷带"]]],"gre",26330,0,0,"s:fascias"],"fascinate":[[["v.",["令人入神","使着迷","入迷"]]],"cet6 ky toefl ielts gre",5834,1,0,"d:fascinated/3:fascinates/i:fascinating",[["The tourists were fascinated with the exquisite scenery.","觀光客被獨特的景致所吸引。"]]],"fascinating":[[["adj.",["迷人的","吸引人的","使人神魂颠倒的"]]],"cet6 toefl ielts",4204,0,0,[["