 desk.","书桌上一叠专业书里有几本卡通书混在里面。"]]],"graphical":[[["adj.",["图的","记录的","图示的","图解的","书法的"]],["",["图解式的"]]],null,16927,0,0,[["In its graphical representation, the normal distribution is a bell-shaped curve, with the value growing as one moves closer to the middle and decreasing as one moves away.","在图形上，正态分布是一种钟形曲线，越接近中心，取值越大，越远离中心，取值越小。"]]],"graphically":[[["adv.",["生动地","活灵活现地","(正式)用图表表示","以图显示"]]],null,16184,0,0],"graphics":[[["n.",["制图法","制图学","图解算法","图形显示"]],["",["图形","DOS外部命令:打印图形方式下的屏幕内容"]]],"toefl",0,0,0,[["Featuring an upgraded graphics engine with smoother movement, detailed environments, and varied competition modes and player-management features, the new title closely mirrors real-world competition.","新作採用升級版圖形引擎，呈現更流暢的動作與更細緻的場景，並提供多樣的比賽模式與球員管理功能，使遊戲更貼近真實世界的競技…"]]],"graphite":[[["n.",["石墨"]]],"cet6 toefl gre",11261,1,0,"s:graphites"],"grapple":[[["n.",["抓住","系紧","掌握","与...扭打"]],["v.",["抓住","掌握"]]],null,8354,1,0,"i:grappling/p:grappled/3:grapples"],"grasp":[[["n.",["把握","抓紧","理解","抓","柄"]],["v.",["抓住","紧握","领会","抓"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky toefl",4181,2,0,"p:grasped/i:grasping/3:grasps",[["The handle came away from the door when I grasped it.","我握住門把，它就從門上掉了下來。"]]],"grass":[[["n.",["草","草原","牧场","禾本"]]],"zk gk ielts",2014,3,1,"s:grasses/p:grassed/i:grassing",[["The notice in the park said \"Keep off the grass\".","公園的告示牌上寫着「請勿踐踏草地」。"]]],"grasshopper":[[["n.",["蚱蜢","蝗虫"]]],"cet6 toefl",15296,0,0,"s:grasshoppers/p:grasshoppered",[["That's not a grasshopper. It's a locust!","那不是蚂蚱。是蝗虫！"]]],"grassland":[[["n.",["牧草地","草原"]]],null,11859,1,0,"s:grasslands"],"grassy":[[["adj.",["草绿色的","象草的","长满草的"]]],"cet6",10102,1,0,"s:grassies/t:grassiest/r:grassier",[["In the morning of the 27th of February of 2022, on my way out of my Lulu Island house, I saw my neighbours the redhead Rochelle of Russian-Mennonite ancestry and the grey-haired moustached Al from the Anglophone section of Montreal; he was from many generations of Canadians. He said that he did not know French, when he lived in Montreal. I ate a slice of pesto cheese pizza at the pizzeria. The vendor was from Mumbai. Through the window, I could see a young brown-blond-haired man in a dark-grey hooded jacket and blue shorts, which made him look like a \"big boy.\" At the cafe, there was an under-age-30 crowd of ten outside, of whom one looked like a handsome Jew. Inside was a table of five or six over-age-30 people, of whom one was a handsome tomboy in a dark-green jacket and army-green pants. I drank my iced black tea. Heading out of the cafe, I saw the \"big boy\" smoking in the wooded park. I took the long route home, through the grassy school field littered with goose poop, the northern snowcapped mountains obscured by clouds, an Animistic-Buddhistic view seemingly of a different planet. Near my house, parked in a truck were Olivia and Daniel. Olivia was studying Biochemistry. In the back seat of the truck was a fully black German Shepherd.","2022 年 2 月 27 日早上，我正要離開盧盧島的家，卻碰見了鄰居——紅頭髮的俄羅斯門諾派血統的羅謝爾，以及來自蒙…"]]],"grate":[[["v.",["装格栅于","磨擦","轧碎","磨碎","使焦急"]],["n.",["炉格","炉篦","炉栅","火炉","壁炉"]]],"ielts gre",8512,2,0,"p:grated/i:grating/s:grates"],"grateful":[[["adj.",["感谢的","感激的","令人快意的","受欢迎的"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky toefl gre",3672,2,1,[["I'm grateful to you for inviting me to the party.","謝謝你邀我參加派對。"]]],"gratefully":[[["adv.",["感激地"]]],null,14306,0,0],"gratification":[[["n.",["令人满足的事(或物)","满足","喜悦"]],["",["愿望满足","满意"]]],"gre",12309,0,0,"s:gratifications"],"gratify":[[["v.",["使满足"]]],"toefl gre",17764,1,0,"d:gratified/i:gratifying/3:gratifies",[["Always do right. This will gratify some people and astonish the rest.","坚持做对的事情。这会满足一部分人同时使另一部分人感到惊讶。"]]],"gratifying":[[["adj.",["悦人的","令人满足的"]]],null,13842,0,0],"gratis":[[["adv.",["免费地","白送地"]],["adj.",["免费的"]]],"gre",29686,0,0],"gratitude":[[["n.",["感激之情"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts gre",7058,1,0,[["We express our gratitude for Mr Smith's outstanding, challenging speech.","我们对史密斯先生杰出的，给人启发的讲话表示感激。"]]],"gratuitous":[[["adj.",["免费的","无理由的"]],["",["无代价的"]]],"toefl gre",16720,1,0],"gratuity":[[["n.",["小费","赠物","赏钱"]],["",["小帐","赏金","退职金"]]],"ielts gre",21615,0,0,"s:gratuities",[["No gratuity accepted.","不收小費。"]]],"grave":[[["n.",["墓穴","坟墓","终结","死亡"]],["adj.",["庄重的","严肃的","重大的","低沉的"]],["v.",["雕刻"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky ielts gre",3358,3,1,"s:graves/t:gravest/r:graver/i:graving/p:graven",[["She carried that habit to her grave.","她到死都改不了那個習慣。"]]],"gravel":[[["n.",["砂砾","碎石"]],["",["沙砾","尿沙"]]],"cet6 ielts gre",5620,1,0,"s:gravels/i:gravelling/p:gravelled"],"gravely":[[["adv.",["重大地","严肃地","庄重地"]]],null,13074,0,0],"gravestone":[[["n.",["墓石","墓碑"]]],null,18519,0,0,"s:gravestones"],"graveyard":[[["n.",["墓地"]]],null,9979,1,0,"s:graveyards",[["They buried him in the graveyard by the church.","他們把他埋葬在教堂旁的墓園。"]]],"gravitate":[[["v.",["被重力吸引","沉下","下降","使受重力吸引"]]],null,12561,0,0,"p:gravitated/i:gravitating/3:gravitates"],"gravitation":[[["n.",["引力","重力","沉下"]]],"toefl",26117,1,0,"s:gravitations"],"gravitational":[[["adj.",["重力的"]]],"toefl gre",9340,0,0],"gravity":[[["n.",["地心引力","重力"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts gre",3956,2,0,"s:gravities",[["If you can use gravity to your advantage, do so.","你如果能利用重力，那就这么做吧。"]]],"gravy":[[["n.",["肉汁","外快"]]],null,9062,1,0,"s:gravies",[["Would you like some more gravy?","你想再來些醬汁嗎？"]]],"gray":[[["adj.",["灰色的","灰白的","面色苍白的","年老的","老练的"]],["n.",["灰色","暗淡"],["a neutral achromatic color midway between white and black"]],["v.",["(使)变灰色"]]],"cet4 cet6",1939,0,1,"s:grays/i:graying/p:grayed",[["I like the gray sweater more than the purple one.","比起紫色的毛衣，我更喜歡灰色的毛衣。"]]],"graze":[[["n.",["吃草","放牧","擦伤","轻擦"]],["v.",["(使)吃草","放牧","轻擦","擦伤"]]],"cet6 ky toefl ielts gre",7524,2,0,"i:grazing/d:grazed/3:grazes",[["Cows are grazing in the meadow.","牛在牧地上吃草。"]]],"grease":[[["n.",["脂肪","兽脂","油脂","贿赂"]],["v.",["涂脂于","贿赂"]]],"cet6 ky toefl ielts gre",7921,1,0,"p:greased/i:greasing/s:greases",[["Grease the waffle maker.","給鬆餅機塗上油。"]]],"greasy":[[["adj.",["油腻的","含脂肪多的"]]],"toefl",9740,1,0,"t:greasiest/r:greasier",[["I bought a handmade dried persimmon in Hsinchu. It tastes sweet but not greasy.","我在新竹買了一塊手工柿餅，味道甜而不膩。"]]],"great":[[["adj.",["大的","非常的","主要的","重大的","崇高的"]],["n.",["全部","大人物","大师"],["a person who has achieved distinction and honor in some field"]],["adv.",["顺利地","得意地"]]],"zk gk",160,5,1,"r:greater/t:greatest/s:greats",[["This is considered to be a matter of great importance.","这被认为是一件大事。"]]],"greatly":[[["adv.",["很","非常"]]],"cet4 cet6",3436,0,1,[["The number of tourists has increased greatly in recent years.","近年的遊客數量大幅增加。"]]],"greatness":[[["n.",["大","巨大","广大"]]],null,8879,0,0],"greece":[[["n.",["希腊"]]],"gk ielts",0,0,0,[["He was born in Greece.","他生在希臘。"]]],"greed":[[["n.",["贪欲","贪婪"]]],"cet6",6753,1,0,"s:greeds",[["Greed is always hungry.","吃着碗里，看着锅里。"]]],"greedy":[[["adj.",["贪婪的","贪得的","贪吃的"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts",8908,0,0,"r:greedier/t:greediest",[["A miser hoards money not because he is prudent but because he is greedy.","守财奴积聚钱财不是因为他谨慎，而是因为他贪婪。"]]],"greek":[[["n.",["希腊人","希腊语"]],["adj.",["希腊的","希腊人的"]],["",["希腊"]]],"gk cet4 cet6",4063,0,0,"s:greeks",[["Olympus? Isn't that where Greek gods hang out or something?","奧林匹斯山？那不是希臘眾神鬼混的地方？"]]],"green":[[["adj.",["绿色的","未成熟的","新鲜的","青春的","无经验的"]],["n.",["绿色","绿色颜料"],["green color or pigment; resembling the color of growing grass"]]],"zk gk ielts gre",890,5,1,"s:greens/r:greener/t:greenest",[["A green carpet will not go with this blue curtain.","绿色的毯子和这条蓝色的帘子不配。"]]],"greenery":[[["n.",["绿叶","绿树","装饰用的绿树枝或叶"]]],null,14777,1,0,[["What is the size of this district's greenery area?","这片小区的绿地面积有多少？"]]],"greengrocer":[[["n.",["蔬菜水果商","菜贩"]]],"gk",31343,0,0,"s:greengrocers"],"greenhorn":[[["n.",["生手","无经验的人","不懂世故的人"]]],"gre",29891,0,0,"3:greenhorns"],"greenhouse":[[["n.",["温室"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky gre",5166,2,0,"s:greenhouses",[["Some scientists believe that the greenhouse effect is imaginary.","有的科學家認為溫室效應是虛構的。"]]],"greenish":[[["adj.",["呈绿色的"]]],null,16399,0,0],"greet":[[["v.",["问候","致敬","欢迎","映入眼帘"]]],"gk c