odies to dry and harden, then they fly to the tops of trees where they feed and look for a mate, which they do by making a loud buzz.","蟬破土而出後，會蛻皮，等待身體乾燥變硬，然後飛到樹頂覓食和尋找配偶，牠們通過發出響亮的蟬鳴來尋找配偶。"]]],"hardheaded":[[["adj.",["不易激动的","冷静的","脚踏实地的","无懈可击的"]]],"toefl gre",0,0,0],"hardihood":[[["n.",["胆大无敌","刚毅","厚颜","强壮"]]],"gre",0,0,0],"hardliner":[[["n.",["强硬路线者"]]],null,0,2,0,"s:hardliners"],"hardly":[[["adv.",["刚刚","几乎不","勉强是"]]],"zk gk cet4 cet6 ky toefl",1741,4,1,[["I could hardly follow what Jane said in her speech.","我幾乎完全跟不上 Jane 的演講內容。"]]],"hardness":[[["n.",["坚硬","困难","严厉","勇气"]],["",["硬度"]]],"toefl",17667,0,0,"s:hardnesses"],"hardship":[[["n.",["艰难","辛苦","苦难","受苦","吃苦"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky toefl",6922,2,0,"s:hardships",[["The people's hardships are our hardships.","人民的困难就是我们的困难。"]]],"hardware":[[["n.",["硬件","五金器具","零件"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts",4019,2,0,[["The transition from hardware to software happened gradually.","由硬體到軟體的轉變是緩慢的。"]]],"hardwood":[[["n.",["硬木","硬木材","阔叶材","落叶树"]]],null,8979,1,0,"s:hardwoods",[["I prefer hardwood floors to carpet.","我喜歡硬木地板勝過地毯。"]]],"hardworking":[[["adj.",["苦干的","不辞辛劳的"]]],"gk",0,0,0,[["She is used to living a hardworking and frugal life.","她习惯了勤俭的生活"]]],"hardy":[[["adj.",["难的","艰苦的","坚硬的","勇敢的"]],["adv.",["努力地","辛苦地","坚硬地"]]],"cet6 toefl ielts gre",10388,2,0,"r:hardier/t:hardiest"],"hare":[[["n.",["野兔"]],["v.",["飞跑"]]],"cet4 cet6",14507,1,0,"s:hares/i:haring/p:hared",[["If you run after two hares, you will catch neither.","脚踏两条船，必定落空。"]]],"harem":[[["n.",["闺房","(闺房里的)妻妾"]]],null,17828,0,0,"s:harems"],"hark":[[["v.",["倾听"]]],null,19428,1,0,"i:harking/3:harks/p:harked"],"harm":[[["n.",["伤害","害处"]],["v.",["伤害","损害"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky toefl",3651,3,1,"d:harmed/i:harming/s:harms",[["This kind of magazine can do harm to young people.","这种杂志对年轻人有害。"]]],"harmful":[[["adj.",["有害的","伤害的"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 toefl ielts",5809,2,1,[["Playing games all night is very harmful to your health.","通宵玩游戏很伤身体的。"]]],"harmless":[[["adj.",["无害处的","未受损害的