sociable than the Sand Witch. This Witch, who lives underneath the heaps of sand at the ocean's edge, where, in the summertime, you dig with your shovel, is not at all like other witches. She never rides on a broomstick, and she never goes down chimneys. In the first place there are no broomsticks or chimneys on the beach at the sea-shore, and in the second place she would not know how to ride on a broomstick or climb down a chimney, if there were. All the Sand Witch knows how to do is to sink into the sand when anything scares her, and to come up through the sand when she sees a chance to get acquainted with a person she never was acquainted with before. So now you know what a Sand Witch is. And if Junior Jenks, seven years old, and dreadfully sunburnt, had known what you know, he would have been much better prepared to face the one that came up right under his nose all of a sudden one hot July morning.","在所有童話故事裡出現的女巫中，沒有一個比沙女巫更討人喜歡、更善於交際了。這位女巫住在海邊堆積如山的沙子下面，夏天的時候…"]]],"hear":[[["v.",["听到","倾听","听说","审理","听见"],["perceive (sound) via the auditory sense"]]],"zk gk",195,5,1,"d:heard/i:hearing/3:hears",[["I look forward to hearing your thoughts on this matter.","我期待听到你在这件事上的想法 。"]]],"hearken":[[["v.",["倾听"]]],"gre",27162,0,0,"i:hearkening/p:hearkened/3:hearkens"],"hearsay":[[["n.",["传闻","谣言"]]],"toefl gre",17347,0,0],"heart":[[["n.",["心","心脏","中心","内心","感情"],["the locus of feelings and intuitions"]],["v.",["鼓励"]]],"zk gk ielts",460,4,1,"s:hearts",[["He learnt the periodic table by heart just for fun.","他背週期表只是為了好玩。"]]],"heartache":[[["n.",["心痛","悲叹"]]],null,16260,1,0,[["I feel heartache.","我觉得心痛。"]]],"heartbeat":[[["n.",["心跳"]]],"ielts",8254,1,0,"s:heartbeats"],"heartbreak":[[["n.",["心碎","伤心事"]]],null,14300,1,0,"s:heartbreaks",[["Hsin-yi got so much slimmer lately. Is it gym or heartbreak?","欣怡最近瘦好多喔，是去健身房還是失戀啊？"]]],"heartbreaking":[[["adj.",["令人悲伤的","极其累人的","令人动情的"]]],null,12509,0,0,[["It was a heartbreaking story.","那是一個叫人心碎的故事。"]]],"heartbroken":[[["adj.",["心碎的"]]],