inguists, literature scholars, historians, sociologists, economists, and other scholars investigate everything that has to do with gnomes.","他在一家科學機構工作，在那裡有語言學家，文學學者，歷史學家，社會學家，經濟學家和其他學者探討一切有關侏儒的事。"]]],"historic":[[["adj.",["历史上著名的","有历史性的"]]],"cet6 ky ielts",2492,3,0,[["There are many famous historic buildings in Kyoto.","京都有很多有名的古建筑。"]]],"historical":[[["adj.",["历史的","史实的","历史上的"],["of or relating to the study of history"]],["",["历史性的"],["having once lived or existed or taken place in the real world as dist…"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky ielts",1472,3,1,[["Many important historical events took place 7000 years B.C.","公元前七千年那段时间发生了很多重要的历史事件。"]]],"historically":[[["adv.",["历史上地","从历史观点上说"]]],null,3817,0,0],"historiography":[[["n.",["编史","历史之编纂"]]],null,17303,0,0],"history":[[["n.",["历史","过去","经历","发展过程","历史学"],["the aggregate of past events"]]],"zk gk cet4 cet6 ky ielts",350,5,1,"s:histories",[["The history of China is older than that of Japan.","中国历史比日本历史更悠久。"]]],"histrionic":[[["adj.",["演员的","演剧的","矫揉造作的"]],["n.",["演员","演剧","戏剧性"]]],"gre",29277,0,0,"s:histrionics"],"hit":[[["v.",["打","打击","碰撞","打中","袭击"]],["n.",["打击","打","冲撞","讽刺"],["(baseball) a successful stroke in an athletic contest (especially in …"]],["",["击中","找到","瞬时打扰"]]],"zk gk cet4 cet6 ky ielts",535,5,1,"i:hitting/3:hits",[["A massive earthquake of magnitude 8.8 hit the Japanese islands today.","今天，8.8级的强大地震袭击了日本的岛屿。"]]],"hitch":[[["n.",["猛拉","急推","蹒跚","故障"]],["v.",["猛拉","系住","蹒跚","被钩住"]]],null,11186,1,0,"p:hitched/i:hitching/s:hitches",[["Tom hitched a ride to Boston.","汤姆搭便车去波士顿了。"]]],"hitchhike":[[["v.",["搭便车","要求(搭便车)"]]],"ielts",18714,0,0,"i:hitchhiking/p:hitchhiked/3:hitchhikes",[["I don't like hitchhiking.","我不喜欢搭便车。"]]],"hitherto":[[["adv.",["迄今","至今"]]],"cet6 ky ielts gre",16041,1,0,[["Karl Marx says, \"The history of all hitherto existing societies is the history of class struggles.\"","卡尔·马克思说：“ 到目前为止的一切社会的历史都是阶级斗争的历史。”"]]],"hitter":[[["n.",["打手","打击的人"]]],null,6539,1,0,"s:hitters"],"hive":[[["v.",["进入蜂房