cent on their investment.","他們在這次的投資中得到百分之八的收益。"]]],"investor":[[["n.",["投资者"],["someone who commits capital in order to gain financial returns"]]],null,1702,4,0,"s:investors",[["The investor stole the capital of his client.","投资者把他客户的资金窃取了."]]],"inveterate":[[["adj.",["根深的","成癖的","积习的"]],["",["慢性顽固性的","绵延难治的"]]],"gre",24646,0,0],"invidious":[[["adj.",["引起反感的","惹人不快的","不公平的","诽谤的"]]],"gre",26230,0,0],"invigilate":[[["v.",["看守","监考"]]],"ielts gre",0,0,0,"d:invigilated/i:invigilating/3:invigilates",[["We went to a secondary school to invigilate today.","我们今天去一所中学监考了。"]]],"invigorate":[[["v.",["使精力充沛","鼓舞","搞活","使健壮"]]],"gre",20365,1,0,"p:invigorated/3:invigorates/i:invigorating"],"invincible":[[["adj.",["不能征服的","无敌的"]]],"ielts",14952,1,0],"inviolable":[[["adj.",["不可亵渎的","不可侵犯的","神圣的"]]],"gre",26584,0,0,[["My room is an inviolable refuge.","我的房間是不可侵犯的避難所。"]]],"invisibility":[[["n.",["看不见","难觉察的","看不见的东西"]]],null,17123,0,0,[["I have the power of invisibility, but it only works when I’m wearing a freshly washed shirt.","我有隱身之能，不過僅限於我穿一件剛洗過的上衣的時候。"]]],"invisible":[[["adj.",["看不见的","无形的","表面上看不见的","未列在公开帐目的"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky ielts",3811,2,0,"s:invisibles",[["If I were invisible, I wouldn't have to wear anything.","若我是隱形的，就不用穿衣服了。"]]],"invitation":[[["n.",["邀请","请柬","引诱","招待","吸引"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky",4072,3,1,"s:invitations",[["It is very impolite of her to decline our invitation.","她拒绝我们的邀请很不礼貌。"]]],"invite":[[["v.",["邀请","请求","引起","招致"],["increase the likelihood of"]],["n.",["邀请"],["a colloquial expression for invitation"]]],"zk gk cet4 cet6 ky",1601,4,1,"d:invited/3:invites/i:inviting",[["He was invited to be the chairman of the club.","他受邀做俱乐部的主席。"]]],"invocation":[[["n.",["祈祷","符咒"]]],"toefl",15173,0,0,"s:invocations"],"invoice":[[["n.",["发票","发货单"]],["v.",["开发票","记清单"]]],"cet6 ielts gre",15708,1,0,"s:invoices/d:invoiced/i:invoicing"],"invoke":[[["v.",["祈求","恳求","实行","援引","引起"]],["",["调用","请求"]]],"toefl gre",5414,1,0,"d:invoked/i:invoking/3:invokes"],"involuntarily":[