o follow him thither with modesty / enough, and likelihood to lead it; as thus: Alexander died, / Alexander was buried, Alexander returneth into dust; the dust is / earth; of earth we make loam; and why of that loam (whereto he / was converted) might they not stop a beer barrel? / Imperious Caesar, dead and turn'd to clay, / Might stop a hole to keep the wind away. / O, that that earth which kept the world in awe / Should patch a wall t' expel the winter's flaw!","不，說真的，一點也不；但要循著合理的推論、憑著適度的謹慎 / 跟隨他到那裡，就像這樣：亞歷山大死了，/ 亞歷山大被埋葬…"]]],"journal":[[["n.",["日记","杂志","日报"]],["",["轴颈"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts",2780,4,0,"s:journals",[["My dad keeps a journal every day.","我爸爸每天都记日记。"]]],"journalism":[[["n.",["新闻业","报章杂志","报刊","新闻出版"]]],"toefl",4524,2,0,[["In a democracy, it is important for journalism to be independent.","在民主国家，报刊的独立性是很重要的。"]]],"journalist":[[["n.",["新闻记者","从事新闻杂志业的人"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts",2099,4,1,"s:journalists",[["Mr Tani is not so much a scholar as a journalist.","Tani 先生與其說是學者，倒不如說是新聞工作者。"]]],"journalistic":[[["adj.",["新闻业的","新闻工作者的","报刊特有的","新闻工作的"]]],"toefl",9983,0,0],"journey":[[["n.",["旅程","旅行","行程"]],["v.",["旅行","游历"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky",2409,3,1,"s:journeys/p:journeyed/i:journeying",[["Reading a book can be compared to making a journey.","阅读一本书可以比作一次旅行。"]]],"jovial":[[["adj.",["快活的","高兴的","愉快的"]],["",["国际算法语言的朱尔斯文本"]]],"toefl gre",19973,0,0],"joy":[[["n.",["欢喜","乐事","高兴"]],["v.",["使快乐","令人高兴","欢喜"]]],"zk gk cet4 ky",2816,3,1,"s:joys/i:joying/p:joyed",[["Language learning brings a lot of joy in our life.","学语言是人生中的一大乐事。"]]],"joyful":[[["adj.",["欢喜的","高兴的","令人高兴的"]]],"cet4 cet6",11426,1,0,[["Loving and being loved are the most joyful things in the world.","爱和被爱是世上最幸运的事。"]]],"joyous":[[["adj.",["快乐的","高兴的"]]],"toefl",12213,1,0],"joyriding":[[["",["疯狂驱车","偷车者"]]],null,45539,1,0],"joystick":[[["",["控制杆","操纵杆"]],["n.",["(飞机的)操纵杆"]]],null,18860,0,0,"s:joysticks"],"jubilant":[[["adj.",["欢呼的","喜洋洋的"]]],"toefl gre",18234,1,0],"jubilation":[[["n.",