arments when worshipping; He resides in a small house, yet forges water ways and ditches with all his might. Figures like Yu the Great, I honestly cannot point out any reprehensible flaws.\"","孔子說：\"像夏禹的為人，我找不到可以指責的漏洞。自己吃著菲薄的飲食，而卻用豐厚祭品祭拜祖先與神明；自己平時穿粗劣的衣裳…"]]],"meagre":[[["adj.",["瘦的","不毛的","贫乏的","贫弱的","少量的"]]],"ielts",38175,1,0],"meal":[[["n.",["一餐","膳食","粗粉"],["the food served and eaten at one time"]],["v.",["进餐"]]],"zk gk ielts",1710,3,1,"s:meals",[["We arrived to find a huge meal ready for us.","我們到達後發現一頓大餐已經為我們準備好了。"]]],"mean":[[["adj.",["低劣的","卑贱的","简陋的","吝啬的","惭愧的"]],["v.",["意谓","想要","意欲","预定","用意"],["mean or intend to express or convey"]],["n.",["平均数","中间","中庸"],["an average of n numbers computed by adding some function of the numbe…"]]],"zk gk toefl ielts gre",154,2,1,"3:means/p:meant/i:meaning",[["I can't get at the exact meaning of the sentence.","我抓不到句子的确切含义。"]]],"meander":[[["n.",["(河流的)蜿蜒","漫步","迂回旅行"]],["v.",["蜿蜒流动","漫步","使蜿蜒曲折"]]],"toefl gre",12806,1,0,"p:meandered/s:meanders/i:meandering"],"meaningful":[[["adj.",["意味深长的"]]],"cet6 toefl",3769,2,0,[["Everyone listened and was very happy, thinking this wedding was both original and meaningful.","大家听了，都很高兴，觉得这个婚礼又新颖又有意义。"]]],"meaningfully":[[["adv.",["意味深长地"]]],null,17999,0,0],"meaningless":[[["adj.",["无意义的"]]],null,7995,1,0,[["Life without love is meaningless.","没有爱的人生没有意义。"]]],"meanness":[[["n.",["吝啬","卑鄙","劣等"]]],null,19328,0,0,"s:meannesses"],"meantime":[[["n.",["间隔时间","其时"]],["adv.",["其间"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky",4813,2,0],"meanwhile":[[["n.",["其时","其间"]],["adv.",["同时","于此时"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky",1847,4,1,[["Meanwhile, Jiang Qin distracted Jiang Feng's older brother Yan Daxia.","与此同时江琴分散了江枫的哥哥燕大侠的注意力。"]]],"measles":[[["n.",["麻疹","风疹","家畜囊尾蚴病","米珠","囊尾蚴病(家畜)"]]],null,17914,1,0,[["Love is like the measles; we all have to go through it.","愛情就像麻疹──一生總要經歷一次。"]]],"measly":[[["",["米珠的","含囊尾蚴的"]],["adj.",["患麻疹的"]]],"gre",23217,0,0],"measurable":[[["adj.",["可测量的","不久的","重要的"]]],"cet4 cet6",11403,1,0],"measure":[[["n.