 a telescope?","你知道顯微鏡和望遠鏡有甚麼分別嗎？"]]],"microscopic":[[["adj.",["显微镜的","用显微镜可见的","微观的","(非正式)极微小的","细微的"]]],"cet6 toefl gre",9581,1,0],"microscopy":[[["n.",["显微镜使用","用显微镜检查","显微镜学"]],["",["显微镜检查"]]],null,19770,0,0],"microwave":[[["n.",["微波"]]],"gk cet6 toefl",5846,2,0,"s:microwaves/p:microwaved/i:microwaving",[["It is about time we bought a new microwave oven.","我们是时候买新的微波炉了。"]]],"mid":[[["adj.",["中间的","中央的","中部的"]],["prep.",["在...之中"]]],"ielts",7347,0,0,"s:mids",[["Since the mid-20th century, the number of hutongs in Beijing has dropped dramatically as they are demolished to make way for new roads and buildings.","二十世纪中以后，北京胡同的数量显著地下降，因为人们把它们拆毁以便给新的楼房和街路让路。"]]],"midair":[[["n.",["半空中"]]],"toefl",0,0,0],"midday":[[["n.",["正午","中午"]],["adj.",["正午的"]]],"gk cet4 cet6",9129,1,1,[["Will you be at home at midday today?","今天中午你在家吗？"]]],"middle":[[["n.",["中央","中间","腰部"],["an intermediate part or section"]],["adj.",["中央的","中庸的","中间的"]]],"zk gk",988,5,1,"s:middles/i:middling/p:middled",[["The bus stopped suddenly in the middle of the street.","巴士突然在路中心停了下來。"]]],"middle-aged":[[["adj.",["中年的"]]],null,0,2,0,[["She's a middle-aged fat woman.","她是個中年胖女人。"]]],"middleman":[[["n.",["中间人","调解人","中人"]]],null,19569,1,0,"s:middlemen"],"midget":[[["n.",["侏儒"]],["adj.",["小型的"]]],"gre",17846,0,0,"s:midgets"],"midlands":[[["n.",["英国中部"]]],null,0,2,0],"midlife":[[["n.",["中年"]]],null,12891,0,0],"midmorning":[[["n.",["上午十时左右"]]],"ielts",0,0,0],"midnight":[[["n.",["午夜","子夜","半夜"]],["adj.",["午夜的","半夜的"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ielts",3461,3,1,"s:midnights",[["I had instant noodles as a midnight snack.","我消夜吃了速食面。"]]],"midpoint":[[["n.",["中点","一半"]]],null,16132,0,0,"s:midpoints"],"midsection":[[["n.",["中央部分","上腹部"]],["",["正中切开"]]],null,17293,0,0,"s:midsections"],"midst":[[["n.",["中间"]],["prep.",["在...中间"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky",4342,2,0,[["Algeria is in the midst of an economic crisis.","阿尔及利亚正处于经济危机中。"]]],"midsummer":[[["n.",["仲夏","夏至期"]],["adj.",["仲夏的"]]],null,12720,1,0,"s:midsummers",[["The climate of this t