y consists of about a hundred billion stars.","银河系大约由一千亿颗恒星组成。"]]],"mill":[[["v.",["碾磨","磨细","搅拌","使乱转","乱转"]],["n.",["压榨机","磨坊","制造厂"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky toefl gre",4439,3,0,"s:mills/i:milling/p:milled",[["Officials from government and industry are also starting to recognize the potential of the Methane Capture Project. The U.S. Department of Agriculture is funding experimental on-farm sites in Mississippi and several other states. Some large poultry processors are launching renewable energy divisions to power their feed mills. And a fuel company is investigating the possibility of pumping chicken-waste methane instead of natural gas through its pipeline, and to use it to power some of the generators along the way.","政府官員與業界人士也開始意識到「甲烷捕捉計畫」的潛力。美國農業部正在密西西比州及其他數個州資助農場內的實驗場址。部分大…"]]],"millennia":[[["",["一千年","千年周年纪念日","千年庆典","千年期","(喻)太平盛世"]]],"toefl",0,0,0,[["Indigenous Australians have eaten kangaroos for millennia.","澳大利亚土著已经吃了上千年袋鼠。"]]],"millennium":[[["n.",["千禧年","一千年"]]],"toefl ielts gre",5666,1,0,"s:millenniums",[["We've already prepared for the millennium bug.","我們已經準備好應付千年蟲。"]]],"millet":[[["n.",["稷","粟","黍"]],["",["小米"]]],null,17910,1,0,"s:millets"],"milligram":[[["n.",["毫克"]]],null,0,1,1,"s:milligrams"],"millimeter":[[["n.",["毫米"]]],"ky toefl",12635,0,0],"millimetre":[[["n.",["毫米"]],["",["公厘"]]],"cet4 cet6",0,1,1,"s:millimetres"],"million":[[["n.",["百万","无数"],["the number that is represented as a one followed by 6 zeros"]],["num.",["百万"]]],"gk ielts",222,5,0,[["Four hundred million people speak English as their first language.","四億人以英語作為他們的第一語言。"]]],"millionaire":[[["n.",["百万富翁","大富豪","大资本家","巨富"]]],"gk cet6 ky toefl",6769,2,0,"s:millionaires",[["He was a millionaire a long time ago.","很久以前，他是一個百萬富翁。"]]],"millionth":[[["adj.",["第一百万的","百万分之一的"]],["n.",["第一百万","百万分之一"]]],null,23696,4,0,"s:millionths",[["It was calculated that hundreds of workers would have to work a hundred hours to make a mistake as enormous as that which a computer can make in a millionth of a second.","据统计，数百名员工不得不工作上百个小时出现的失误与计算机在百万分之一秒的时间内才会犯的错同样巨大。"]]],"millisecond":[[["n.",["毫秒"]]],null,17013,0,0,"s:milliseconds",[["According to one study, Amazon's sales go down by 1% for every 100-millisecond lag in its loading times.","有研究称，打开速度每慢100毫秒，Amazon 的销售额就下降1%。"]]],"mime":[[["n.",["哑剧","小丑","滑稽戏"]],["v.",["摸拟表演"]],["",["多用途互连网邮件扩展"]]],"toefl gre",20294,1,0,"i:miming/p:mimed/3:mimes",[["This group of musicians from the Andes mountain region of Chile and Peru calls itself Wayno. They play the traditional music of the Andes, using age-old instruments like wooden flutes, guitars, and bells. A variety of musicians, dancers and mimes regularly perform in the subways, playing for tips that help them earn a living while practicing their art.","這群來自智利和秘魯安第斯山脈地區的音樂家自稱為「瓦伊諾」。他們演奏安地斯山脈的傳統音樂，使用古老的樂器，例如木笛、吉他…"]]],"mimetic":[[["adj.",["模仿的","摹拟的","好模仿的","类似的","模拟的"]]],"toefl",18655,0,0],"mimic":[[["n.",["效颦者","模仿者","小丑","仿制品"]],["adj.",["模仿的","摹拟的"]],["v.",["模仿","摹拟"]]],"toefl ielts gre",6833,1,0,"3:mimics/i:mimicking/p:mimicked",[["A parrot can mimic a person's voice.","鸚鵡會模仿人的聲音。"]]],"mimicry":[[["n.",["模仿","拟态(生物)","模拟"]]],"toefl",22100,0,0,"s:mimicries"],"min":[[["",["部长（Minister）","部（Ministry）"]]],null,26520,2,0,"s:mins"],"minaret":[[["n.",["光塔"]]],"gre",22657,0,0,"s:minarets"],"minatory":[[["adj.",["威胁的"]]],"gre",0,0,0],"mince":[[["v.",["切碎","矫揉做作地说","碎步走","装腔作势"]],["n.",["切碎物"]]],"toefl gre",8153,1,0,"i:mincing/d:minced/s:minces",[["Not to mince words, he got fired.","老实说，他被炒了。"]]],"mind":[[["n.",["思想","愿望","智力","记忆","心理"],["that which is responsible for one's thoughts and feelings; the seat o…"]],["v.",["介意","注意","留心","留意","专心于"]]],"zk gk ielts",469,3,1,"s:minds/d:minded/i:minding",[["With a firm goal in mind, you will do well.","有了坚定的目标，你会做得很好。"]]],"minder":[[["n.",["看守者","照顾者"]]],null,24909,1,0,"s:minders"],"mindful":[[["adj.",["深切注意的","留神的","留心的"]]],null,10818,1,0,[["Be mindful of your actions when in a relationship.What may seem playful to you could really be harmful to your partner.","请小心地呵护两人之间的感情。也许当你认为只是一个玩笑时，却真真切切地伤了对方的心。"]]],"mindless":[[["adj.",["没头脑的","不小心的","不留神的"]]],null,13058,1,0],"mine":[[["v.",["挖掘","开采","在...布雷","破坏","开矿"]],["n.",["矿","矿藏","地雷"]],["pron.",["我的"]]],"gk toefl ielts",2236,2,1,"s:mines/i:mining/d:mined",[["I met an old friend of mine the other day.","我那天碰到了我其中的一个老朋友。"]]],"minefield":[[["n.",["布雷区","布雷水域","布雷场"]]],null,17469,1,0,"s:minefields"],"miner":[[["n.",["矿工","开矿机","坑道工兵"]]],"cet4 cet6",5693,3,0,"s:miners"],"mineral":[[["n.",["矿物","无机物","苏打水"]],["adj.",["矿物的","似矿物的"]]],"gk toefl",4583,2,1,"s:minerals",[["Water, forests, and minerals are important natural resources.","水、森林和礦物都是重要的天然資源。"]]],"mingle":[[["v.",["(使)混合"]]],"cet6 ky toefl ielts gre",8350,1,0,"p:mingled/i:mingling/3:mingles"],"mini":[[["n.",["同类中的极小者","微型汽车","超短裙"]],["adj.",["微型的"]]],null,11257,0,0,"s:minis"],"miniature":[[["n.",["缩图","小画像"]],["adj.",["小规模的","纤小的"]]],"cet6 ky toefl gre",6061,2,0,"s:miniatures"],"minibus":[[["n.",["中客车","小型公共汽车"]]],"gk",27815,1,0,[["This minibus holds 25 persons.","这辆迷你巴士能容纳25个人。"]]],"minimal":[[["adj.",["最小的","极微的","最小限度的","最低的"]]],"cet6 toefl ielts",4313,2,0],"minimalist":[[["n.",["极简抽象派艺术家"]]],"toefl",15591,1,0,"s:minimalists"],"minimally":[[["adv.",["最低限度地","最低程度地"]]],null,13368,0,0],"minimize":[[["v.",["将...减到最少","最小化"]]],"cet6 ky toefl gre",3941,2,0,"i:minimizing/d:minimized/3:minimizes",[["One can easily characterize a majority of the energy and power subcommittee members as nincompoops — scientific illiterates who spread misinformation crafted by oil and coal companies in order to minimize the significance of global climate change.","人們很容易將能源和電力小組委員會的大多數成員描述為笨蛋。他們散佈石油和煤炭公司炮製的虛假信息，以最大限度地減少全球氣候…"]]],"minimum":[[["adj.",["最小的","最低的"]],["n.",["最小值"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts",3633,3,1,"s:minima",[["The minimum wage in Okinawa is 642 yen per hour.","冲绳的最低时薪是每小时642日元。"]]],"minion":[[["n.",["奴才","宠臣"]]],"gre",20009,0,0,"s:minions"],"miniseries":[[["n.",["电视连续短剧"]]],null,13071,0,0],"miniskirt":[[["n.",["超短裙"]]],"gk",20289,0,0,"s:miniskirts",[["My mother didn't let me wear a miniskirt.","我妈不让我穿迷你裙。"]]],"minister":[[["n.",["部长","牧师","公使"],["a person appointed to a high office in the government"]],["v.",["服侍","救助","主持宗教仪式"],["attend to the wants and needs of others"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky ielts",1910,5,1,"s:ministers/i:ministering/p:ministered",[["This is the house in which the prime minister lives.","这是总理住的房子。"]]],"ministerial":[[["adj.",["部长的","内阁的","执政的","部的","公使的"]]],null,16223,0,0],"ministry":[[["n.",["部","内阁","服务"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky toefl",4242,4,1,"s:ministries",[["In its \"Eleven Five Plan\" (2006 to 2010), the Ministry of Industry and Information Technology pledged to implement phone connections in every village and Internet connections in every town.","信息产业部在其“十一五规划”（二零零六年至二零一零年）中立誓要实现村村通电话，乡乡能上网。"]]],"minivan":[[["n.",["小型货车"]]],null,9671,0,0,"s:minivans",[["Sami has a minivan.","萨米有一辆小面包车。"]]],"mink":[[["n.",["貂","貂皮衣"]]],null,16431,1,0,"s:minks"],"minnow":[[["n.",["鲤科淡水小鱼"]]],"gre",14753,0,0,"s:minnows"],"minor":[[["adj.",["较小的","二流的","未成年的"]],["n.",["未成年人","副修科目"]],["v.",["副修"]],["",["次要"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky",2610,3,1,"s:minors",[["He played a minor part in the play.","他在劇中演了一個小角色。"]]],"minority":[[["n.",["少数","未成年","少数民族"],["a group of people who differ racially or politically from a larger gr…"]],["adj.",["少数的","属于少数派的"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts",1633,4,1,"s:minorities",[["April is the national minority health month.","四月是全國弱勢團體醫療月。"]]],"minstrel":[[["n.",["吟游诗人"]]],null,19440,1,0,"s:minstrels"],"mint":[[["n.",["薄荷","造币厂","巨额"]],["v.",["铸造","铸币","制造"]]],"cet6 toefl ielts gre",8674,2,0,"s:mints/p:minted/i:minting",[["On the 14th of April of 2015, I walk to the Richmond Public Market, I first climbing the stairs outside. Inside, the wide atrium-like building is like a garden in a jungle surrounding, I imagine. Already quite hungry, I trot to Captain Wa, the food vendor, to get noodles with squid, fish, and tofu, as well as hot tea. As I eat, a handsome First Nations man in a purple T-shirt walks by. Then a handsome, stocky Jewish fellow walks by. A few minutes later, I begin to thirst, so I get a cold Mint Bubble Green Tea at the vendor QQ Bubble Tea and Coffee. I sit by the stairs to sip. A threesome family sits eating nearby, the man being black, the woman being Oriental, and the child being a hybrid. Addicted to Bubble Tea, I get another one, this time at Peanut's. It is a cold Green Apple Bubble Green Tea. It is delicious. I take the escalator down. On my way to the washroom, I notice a big aquarium full of probably giant red Alaskan king crabs with barnacles on their legs. They remind me of extraterrestrials, somehow. At the bookstore, I buy a heavily illustrated green botany book in sinograms. I left it on top of a box a month ago and it is still there. It is $14. I take the escalator up. Addicted to Bubble Tea, I spend my remaining coins on a cold Lychee Bubble Green Tea. It is delicious with even bits of white lychee flesh.","2015 年 4 月 14 日，我步行前往列治文公共市場，先是爬上了外面的階梯。市場內部寬敞的中庭式建築，讓我感覺彷彿…"]]],"minuet":[[["n.",["小步舞","小步舞曲"]]],"gre",30709,0,0,"s:minuets"],"minus":[[["adj.",["减的","负的","阴性的"]],["n.",["负号","不足"]],["prep.",["减","缺"]],["",["负差"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky ielts",8628,2,0,"s:minuses",[["How many is nine minus six?","九減六等於多少？"]]],"minuscule":[[["n.",["小书写体","小写字"]],["adj.",["用小书写体的","小写字的"]]],"toefl gre",13257,0,0,"s:minuscules"],"minute":[[["n.",["分","分钟","片刻","备忘录","笔记"],["a unit of time equal to 60 seconds or 1/60th of an hour"]],["v.",["记录","摘录","测定时间"]],["adj.",["微小的","详细的"]]],"zk gk toefl ielts",308,1,1,"s:minutes",[["After ten minutes, they passed on to a new topic.","10分钟后，他们换了个新话题。"]]],"minutely":[[["adv.",["详细地","精密地"]]],"toefl",24836,0,0],"minutia":[[["n.",["细节","琐事"]]],"gre",18681,0,0,"s:minutiae"],"miracle":[[["n.",["奇迹","奇事"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts gre",3279,2,0,"s:miracles",[["I can hope for a miracle, can't I?","我能等奇跡發生，是不是？"]]],"miraculous":[[["adj.",["奇迹的","不可思议的"]]],"to