r a new letter opener. Many have sons that require a short bedside story or daughters with dolls that must be clad in clothing of utmost fashionability; all this, the teacher makes the pupils make for him.","若老師要籌劃一趟假期旅行或類似需要比價、核算費用的事，他便會借助學生的本領。有時，妻子想要一個新果盤，或丈夫想要一把新…"]]],"openly":[[["adv.",["公开地","坦率地","直率地","公然地"]]],null,4491,2,1,[["Secret gifts are openly rewarded.","秘密的禮物公開的獎勵。"]]],"openness":[[["n.",["公开","宽阔","率真"]]],null,7321,0,0],"opera":[[["n.",["歌剧"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky toefl",3851,3,0,"s:operas",[["Maria Callas was a famous opera singer.","Maria Callas 以前是一位著名歌剧演员。"]]],"operate":[[["v.",["操作","运转","动手术","活动"],["direct or control; projects, businesses, etc."]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky toefl",1309,5,1,"i:operating/d:operated/3:operates",[["Linux is a free operating system; you should try it.","Linux是一个免费的操作系统。你应该去试用一下。"]]],"operatic":[[["adj.",["歌剧的","歌剧风格的"]]],null,16967,0,0,"s:operatics"],"operation":[[["n.",["操作","动作","手术","运算","作用"],["the state of being in effect or being operative"]]],"zk gk cet4 cet6 ky",826,5,1,"s:operations",[["My father has been in good shape since his operation.","自从手术后，我父亲一直处于良好的状态。"]]],"operational":[[["",["操作上的","业务上的","可起作用的"]],["adj.",["操作的","运作的"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky",6134,2,0],"operationalize":[[["v.",["使用于操作","使开始运转","实施"]]],null,19023,0,0,"d:operationalized/i:operationalizing"],"operative":[[["adj.",["动作的","运转的","有效的","关键的","手术的"]],["n.",["技工","侦探"]]],"gre",10270,2,0,"s:operatives"],"operator":[[["n.",["操作员","行家","经纪人","算子","运算符"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky toefl",3210,3,0,"s:operators",[["Mary was a switchboard operator when she was younger.","瑪麗年輕時是電話接線生。"]]],"operetta":[[["n.",["小歌剧","轻歌剧"]]],"gre",30494,0,0,"s:operettas"],"ophthalmologist":[[["n.",["眼科医师"]],["",["眼科学家"]]],null,19845,0,0,"s:ophthalmologists",[["Zamenhof, the creator of Esperanto, was an ophthalmologist.","世界语的创始人柴门霍夫是一个眼科医生。"]]],"opiate":[[["n.",["鸦片制剂","镇静剂"]],["adj.",["含鸦片的","催眠的"]],["v.",["使麻醉","使缓和"]]],"gre",18995,0,0,"s:opiates",[["Religion is the opiate of the masses.","宗教是人民的鸦片。"]]],"opine":[[["v.",["想","以为"]]],"gre",16834,0,0,"p:opined/3:opines/i:opining",[["It is now the 1st of November of 2014. I opine that Lulu Islanders just do not understand how important Halloween is. Halloween allows us to face the theme of death with humour and feasting. It celebrates the colours orange, black, and purple. Halloween springs from very ancient traditions, both Xtian and pagan. An encyclopedia could tell one about its mysterious beginnings.","現在是 2014 年 11 月 1 日。我覺得盧盧島的居民根本不懂萬聖節有多重要。萬聖節讓我們用幽默和盛宴來面對死亡的…"]]],"opinion":[[["n.",["意见","评价","主张"],["a personal belief or judgment that is not founded on proof or certain…"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts",1124,4,1,"s:opinions",[["You may be right, but I am against your opinion.","你可能是对的，但我和你意见相反。"]]],"opinionated":[[["adj.",["固执己见的","武断的"]]],"gre",27060,0,0],"opium":[[["n.",["鸦片","阿片"]]],"cet6",11885,1,0,[["Religion is the opium of the people.","宗教是人民的鸦片。"]]],"opponent":[[["n.",["对手","敌手","反对者"]],["adj.",["敌对的","反对的","对面的"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts gre",2181,3,1,"s:opponents",[["The home team always have an advantage over their opponents.","主场队总是比对手有优势。"]]],"opportune":[[["adj.",["恰好的","时机适宜的","适当的"]]],"gre",22301,0,0],"opportunist":[[["n.",["机会主义者","投机取巧者"]]],null,20072,1,0,"s:opportunists"],"opportunistic":[[["adj.",["机会主义的","投机取巧的"]]],null,14897,1,0],"opportunity":[[["n.",["机会","时机"],["a possibility due to a favorable combination of circumstances"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts",625,4,1,"s:opportunities",[["I must take the opportunity to improve my language ability.","我要藉機提升我的語言能力。"]]],"oppose":[[["v.",["反对","以...对抗","抗争"],["be against; express opposition to"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts gre",1945,3,1,"d:opposed/i:opposing/3:opposes",[["Everyone opposed it, but they got married all the same.","他們不理眾人的反對結了婚。"]]],"opposite":[[["adj.",["相对的","相反的","对面的"]],["prep.",["对面"]],["n.",["对立面"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts",2222,3,1,"s:opposites",[["You say one thing and then act just the opposite.","你说一套做一套。"]]],"opposition":[[["n.",["反对","敌对","相反","在野党"],["the relation between opposed entities"]],["",["对生","对向","反抗","反对症"]]],"toefl",1876,4,1,"s:oppositions",[["Our feckless opposition party didn't do enough to stop him.","我们软弱的反对派不足以阻止他。"]]],"oppositional":[[["adj.",["反对的","对抗的"]]],null,16521,0,0],"oppress":[[["v.",["压迫","压抑","使烦恼"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky ielts gre",13013,0,0,"d:oppressed/i:oppressing/3:oppresses",[["The government of this country oppresses its people.","这个国家的政府压迫人民。"]]],"oppressed":[[["adj.",["受压制的","受压迫的"]]],null,12097,0,0],"oppression":[[["n.",["压抑","沉闷","压迫手段","压迫"]]],null,6836,0,0,"s:oppressions"],"oppressive":[[["adj.",["压制性的","压迫的","沉重的"]]],null,9660,1,0],"oppressor":[[["n.",["压迫者","压制者","强迫者"]]],null,17937,0,0,"s:oppressors"],"opprobrious":[[["adj.",["嘴不干净的","无礼的","粗野的","辱骂的","该骂的"]]],"gre",0,0,0],"opt":[[["v.",["选择"]]],"ky ielts",4704,3,0,"i:opting/d:opted/3:opts"],"opt-out":[[["n.",["自愿退出","不参加"]]],null,0,1,0,"s:opt-outs"],"optic":[[["adj.",["眼睛的","视觉的","光学的"]],["n.",["镜片"]]],"ielts",14580,1,0],"optical":[[["adj.",["眼睛的","视觉的","光学的","光学上的"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts",5497,1,0,"s:opticals"],"optics":[[["n.",["光学"]]],"cet4",9313,1,0],"optimal":[[["adj.",["最佳的","最理想的"]],["",["最优的"]]],"cet6 toefl",7002,0,0],"optimism":[[["n.",["乐观主义","乐观","乐天"]]],"cet6 ielts gre",5401,2,0,[["Optimism is like the lamp of hope. Pessimism [or negativity] is like a drug of sorrow.","樂觀如明燈,照亮希望的前程. 消極如毒品,腐蝕健康的心靈."]]],"optimist":[[["n.",["乐观者","乐观主义者"]]],"toefl gre",11811,0,0,"s:optimists",[["I am by turns an optimist and a pessimist.","我时而乐观，时而悲观。"]]],"optimistic":[[["adj.",["乐观的","乐观主义的","乐天的"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky toefl",4141,1,0,[["I am not as optimistic as you are.","我没有你那么乐观。"]]],"optimization":[[["n.",["最佳化","最优化"]],["",["优化"]]],"gre",16923,0,0],"optimize":[[["v.",["使完美","使完善","充分利用","乐观地对待","优化"]]],"ky",11612,0,0,"d:optimized/i:optimizing/3:optimizes",[["If human life is convex, we can optimize it.","如果人生是凸的，那我们可以优化它。"]]],"optimum":[[["n.",["最适条件","最佳效果"]],[