,"反战论者","不抵抗主义者"]]],"gre",17281,1,0,"s:pacifists",[["What I’m getting at is that Zamenhof not only built a linguistic object, but that behind that was an idea — an idea of brotherhood, a pacifist idea. That strength of an ideal — for which Esperantists were even persecuted under Nazism and Stalinism — is still conserved by the community of Esperantists. One cannot say that it has failed, but one thing needs to be said: the reason why any language is successful is always indefinable.","我想说的是，柴门霍夫不仅构建了一个语言学对象，而且在这之后还有一个理念——一个兄弟情谊的理念，一个和平主义的理念。这种…"]]],"pacify":[[["v.",["使平静","安慰","绥靖","使服从"]]],"ielts gre",18896,1,0,"d:pacified/i:pacifying/3:pacifies"],"pack":[[["v.",["包装","捆扎","塞满","压紧","挑选"]],["n.",["包裹","一伙","一副","背包","包装"]],["",["压缩"]]],"gk cet4 ky toefl gre",2273,4,1,"d:packed/s:packs/i:packing",[["Tom seems to have packed everything but the kitchen sink.","Tom把除了厨房水槽之外的所有东西都打包了。"]]],"package":[[["n.",["包裹","套装软件","包","包装用物","程序包"],["a collection of things wrapped or boxed together"]],["v.",["包装","打包"]],["adj.",["一揽子的"]]],"zk gk cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts",1685,4,1,"s:packages/d:packaged/i:packaging",[["She went to the post office to send the package.","她去了邮局寄包裹。"]]],"packaging":[[["n.",["包装","包装业","包装术"]],["",["组装","封装"]]],"toefl",7654,2,1,[["We must make the utmost effort to reduce the use of plastic packaging, and also to recycle all waste plastic.","我们应该尽我们最大的努力减少塑料包装的使用，并回收所有的塑料废物。"]]],"packer":[[["n.",["包装工人","罐头食品工人","打包机","搬家工人","批发商"]]],"toefl",21192,0,0,"s:packers"],"packet":[[["n.",["小包","一批信件","大量","信息包"]],["",["分组","分组报文","数据分组"]],["v.",["打包","装进小包"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky",6240,2,1,"s:packets",[["I bought two packets of pistachios.","买了两包开心果。"]]],"pact":[[["n.",["契约","协定","条约"]],["",["合同"]]],"ky toefl gre",6682,3,0,"s:pacts",[["They still attacked us, despite clearly agreeing to sign the non-aggression pact.","明明签订了互不侵犯条约，竟然还来攻击我们。"]]],"pad":[[["n.",["填补","衬垫","印色盒","路"]],["v.",["填补","走","夸大","步行"]],["",["焊接点","包装配/拆卸"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky ielts",3664,2,0,"s:pa