ho is in danger of becoming paralysed. You don't know each other. No one will ever know how nobly you acted by giving away all the money for a stranger's surgery, or what base choice you made to take the money confining that person to a wheelchair for the rest of their life. What would you do? Sharing the money is not an option.","在你面前有一百万美金。你可以自己留下或帮一个你不认识的快全身瘫痪的人做手术。他不认识你，你也不认识他。当然，无论你慷慨…"]]],"paralysis":[[["n.",["麻痹","停顿","瘫痪"]]],"cet6 toefl ielts",9996,1,0,"s:paralyses",[["His paralysis is progressing, and soon he won't be able to get out of bed.","他的瘫痪正在恶化，不久他就不能下床了。"]]],"paralyze":[[["v.",["使瘫痪","使麻痹"]]],"cet6 ky toefl gre",7146,0,0,"d:paralyzed/3:paralyzes/i:paralyzing",[["The general strike paralyzed the whole country.","全面罷工癱瘓了整個國家。"]]],"paramedic":[[["n.",["伞兵军医","伞降急救人员"]]],null,10384,0,0,"s:paramedics",[["Paramedics are on the scene.","醫護人員已抵達事發現場。"]]],"parameter":[[["n.",["参变数","参变量","参数","参量"]]],"cet6 ky toefl gre",5398,1,0,"s:parameters",[["This function takes two parameters, the first one is the title of the window, the second one will be the title of the icon.","这个函数有两个参数，第一个是窗体的标题，另一个是图标的标题。"]]],"paramilitary":[[["adj.",["辅助军事的"]]],null,11956,1,0,"s:paramilitaries"],"paramount":[[["adj.",["最重要的","最高的","至上的"]],["n.",["首长","最高当局"]]],"toefl ielts gre",9287,1,0],"paranoia":[[["n.",["偏执狂","多疑症","妄想狂"]]],"ielts gre",10527,1,0,"s:paranoias"],"paranoid":[[["adj.",["(似)患妄想狂的","(似)患偏执狂的"]],["n.",["患妄想狂的人"]]],"gre",8652,1,0,"s:paranoids",[["Tom is getting paranoid.","汤姆越来越多疑了。"]]],"paraphernalia":[[["n.",["随身用具"]]],"ielts",15134,1,0],"paraphrase":[[["v.",["改写","解述","释义","意译"]],["n.",["释义","解述","改写"]]],"toefl ielts gre",12845,0,0,"d:paraphrased/s:paraphrases/i:paraphrasing"],"parapsychology":[[["n.",["心灵学","通灵学","心灵心理学(一门唯心的学科)"]]],"toefl",38562,0,0],"parasite":[[["n.",["寄生生物","寄生虫","食客"]],["",["寄生物","寄生胎"]]],"ky toefl ielts gre",8481,1,0,"s:parasites",[["Tom is a parasite.","湯姆是個寄生蟲。"]]],"parasitic":[[["adj.",["寄生的","由寄生虫引起的"]]],"toefl",16114,0,0],"paratroope