"槌","杵"]],["v.",["用槌磨","用杵捣"]]],"gre",25914,0,0,"s:pestles/i:pestling/p:pestled"],"pesto":[[["n.",["<美>(浇在面条或通心粉等上的)香蒜沙司","香蒜酱"]]],null,13186,0,0,[["In the morning of the 27th of February of 2022, on my way out of my Lulu Island house, I saw my neighbours the redhead Rochelle of Russian-Mennonite ancestry and the grey-haired moustached Al from the Anglophone section of Montreal; he was from many generations of Canadians. He said that he did not know French, when he lived in Montreal. I ate a slice of pesto cheese pizza at the pizzeria. The vendor was from Mumbai. Through the window, I could see a young brown-blond-haired man in a dark-grey hooded jacket and blue shorts, which made him look like a \"big boy.\" At the cafe, there was an under-age-30 crowd of ten outside, of whom one looked like a handsome Jew. Inside was a table of five or six over-age-30 people, of whom one was a handsome tomboy in a dark-green jacket and army-green pants. I drank my iced black tea. Heading out of the cafe, I saw the \"big boy\" smoking in the wooded park. I took the long route home, through the grassy school field littered with goose poop, the northern snowcapped mountains obscured by clouds, an Animistic-Buddhistic view seemingly of a different planet. Near my house, parked in a truck were Olivia and Daniel. Olivia was studying Biochemistry. In the back seat of the truck was a fully black German Shepherd.","2022 年 2 月 27 日早上，我正要離開盧盧島的家，卻碰見了鄰居——紅頭髮的俄羅斯門諾派血統的羅謝爾，以及來自蒙…"]]],"pet":[[["v.",["宠爱","溺爱","抚摸","拥抱","爱抚"]],["n.",["宠物","受宠爱的人","宠坏的孩子","不悦","生气"]],["adj.",["宠爱的","表示亲昵的","养着观赏的","特别珍爱的","格外的"]]],"zk gk cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts",3278,3,1,"s:pets/i:petting/p:petted",[["The American government has always regarded England as America's house pet.","美国政府一直视英国为美国的宠物。"]]],"petal":[[["n.",["花瓣"]]],"toefl ielts gre",8803,1,0,"s:petals/i:petalling/p:petalled",[["The bathtub was filled with hot water and flower petals.","浴缸裡滿是熱水和花瓣。"]]],"peter":[[["v.",["逐渐消失","逐渐减少"]]],null,19939,1,0,"3:peters/p:petered",[["We wish to invite Peter to Japan in the near future.","我们希望在不久的将来邀请彼得去日本。"]]],"petite":[[["adj.",["小的","次要的","小个子的","娇小玲珑的","娇小的"]]],null,11652,1,0,"s:petites"],"petition":[[["n.",["请愿","诉状","陈情书","申请","祈求"]],["v.",["正式请求","恳求","请愿"]]],"cet6 ky toefl ielts gre",5959,2,0,"s:petitions/p:petitioned/i:petitioning"],"petitioner":[[["n.",["请愿人","诉愿人","(离婚案)原告","上诉人"]]],"gre",17248,0,0,"s:petitioners"],"petrifaction":[[["n.",["使变成石头","石化","化石","僵化","吓呆"]]],"toefl",0,0,0],"petrified":[[["adj.",["惊呆的","目瞪口呆的"]]],null,15020,0,0,[["I'm too petrified to speak.","我吓得说不出话来。"]]],"petrify":[[["v.",["(非正式)使惊呆","使吓得要死","使发呆","vi. 使石化","使成为化石"]]],"toefl gre",38922,0,0,"p:petrified/3:petrifies/i:petrifying",[["I'm too petrified to speak.","我吓得说不出话来。"]]],"petrochemical":[[["adj.",["石化的","石化制品的","岩石化学的"]],["n.",["石化产品"]]],null,19798,1,0,"s:petrochemicals"],"petroglyph":[[["n.",["岩石雕刻","岩画"]]],"gre",22620,0,0,"s:petroglyphs"],"petrol":[[["n.",["汽油","挥发油","石油"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky ielts",22027,2,1,"s:petrols",[["More and more environmentalists advocate and use environmentally friendly unleaded petrol in cars.","越来越多的环保者开始宣传和使用以环保的无铅汽油为燃料的汽车。"]]],"petroleum":[[["n.",["石油"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts gre",8098,2,0],"petrology":[[["n.",["岩石学"]]],"gre",0,0,0],"pettish":[[["adj.",["易怒的","闹情绪的","怒气冲冲的"]]],"gre",0,0,0],"petty":[[["adj.",["琐碎的","小规模的","小气的","委琐的","小额的"]]],"cet6 ky ielts gre",6435,2,0,"r:pettier/s:pettys/t:pettiest"],"petulance":[[["n.",["易怒","坏脾气","使性子"]]],"gre",32147,0,0,"s:petulances"],"petulant":[[["adj.",["任性的","暴躁的","易生气的","难以取悦的"]]],"gre",22374,0,0],"pew":[[["n.",["教堂长椅","会众","座位"]],["v.",["为(教堂)安装座位","把...围在一起"]]],null,10498,1,0,"s:pews"],"pewter":[[["n.",["白蜡","青灰色"]]],null,19045,1,0,"p:pewtered"],"pg":[[["",["部分不适合儿童观看的(电影)","前列腺素","磷脂酰甘油"]]],null,0,1,0],"ph":[[["",["氢离子指数","药典","苯基"]]],null,0,1,0,"s:phs",[["I'm in Boston going for my Ph.D. right now.","我正在在波士顿读博士。"]]],"phalanx":[[["n.",["方阵","密集队列","密集的人群(或兽群)","指骨","趾骨"]]],null,18541,0,0,"s:phalanxes"