. You can take your child there.","这里有间供儿童玩耍的房间。你可以把你的小孩带到那里。"]]],"playwright":[[["n.",["剧作家"]]],"toefl",7605,2,0,"s:playwrights/i:playwrighting"],"plaza":[[["n.",["广场","市场","购物区"]]],"toefl gre",7095,1,0,"s:plazas",[["The rioters were forcibly removed from the plaza.","广场的暴徒被强制驱离。"]]],"plc":[[["",["可编程逻辑控制器"]]],null,40463,2,0,"s:plcs"],"ple":[[["",["个性化学习环境（Personal Learning Environment）"]]],null,0,2,0,"p:pled/s:ples"],"plea":[[["n.",["恳求","辩解","抗辩","诉讼","请愿"]]],"cet6 ky toefl ielts",4894,2,0,"s:pleas"],"plead":[[["v.",["辩护","恳求","为...辩护","提出...借口","托称"]]],"cet6 ky toefl ielts gre",3525,2,0,"p:pleaded/i:pleading/3:pleads"],"pleasant":[[["adj.",["愉快的","可爱的","活泼的","亲切的"]]],"zk gk cet4 cet6 ky ielts",3772,3,1,"r:pleasanter/t:pleasantest",[["It is very pleasant to cross the ocean by ship.","乘船过海非常舒服。"]]],"pleasantly":[[["adv.",["和蔼地","亲切地","友好地","愉快地"]]],null,10450,0,1,[["The weather is quite pleasantly cool.","天气挺凉爽。"]]],"please":[[["v.",["使高兴","合...的心意","取悦","使人满意","讨好"],["give pleasure to or be pleasing to"]],["adv.",["请"]]],"zk gk",1167,4,1,"p:pleased/3:pleases/i:pleasing",[["If you have a question, please raise your right hand.","如果有问题，请举起你的右手。"]]],"pleasurable":[[["adj.",["快乐的","愉快的","舒适的","心情舒畅的"]]],null,14379,1,0],"pleasure":[[["n.",["快乐","愉快","令人高兴的事","娱乐","希望"],["a fundamental feeling that is hard to define but that people desire t…"]],["v.",["(使)高兴"]]],"zk gk toefl ielts",1882,3,1,"s:pleasures/i:pleasuring",[["It has always been a pleasure to work with you.","跟你共事总是很愉快。"]]],"pleat":[[["n.",["褶","褶状物"]],["v.",["打褶","把...编成辫"]]],"gre",21373,1,0,"s:pleats/i:pleating/d:pleated",[["From between the pleats of her black skirt, the nun brought out scissors and deftly cut coloured paper into long, narrow strips, which we could then braid into a paper rug.","修女從黑色裙子的褶皺間掏出剪刀，熟練地將彩色紙剪成長而窄的紙條，讓我們可以把這些紙條編成紙地毯。"]]],"plebeian":[[["n.",["平民","庶民","大众","平庸的人"]],["adj.",["平民的","一般的","普通的","粗俗的"]]],"gre",33393,0,0,"s:plebeians"],"plebiscite":[[["n.",["公民投票","平民表决"]]],null,23475,