e imagery, and a really interesting area is southwestern England, where there are quaint towns and hamlets.","在倫敦，我住的飯店靠近巴比肯藝術中心。一次難忘的經驗是用報紙包著，吃美味的炸魚薯條，這在北美人家裡是無法複製的。我最喜…"]]],"quake":[[["v.",["颤抖","地震"]],["n.",["颤抖","地震"]]],"gk",8561,1,0,"i:quaking/s:quakes/p:quaked"],"quaker":[[["n.",["贵格会教徒"]]],null,15379,0,0,"s:quakers"],"qualification":[[["n.",["资格","条件","限制"]],["",["限定"]]],"gk cet6 ky toefl ielts",6828,2,1,"s:qualifications"],"qualifier":[[["n.",["取得资格的人","限定语"]],["",["限定词"]]],null,15614,2,0,"s:qualifiers"],"qualify":[[["v.",["取得资格","有资格","使有资格","使合格","限定"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts",3049,3,1,"d:qualified/3:qualifies/i:qualifying",[["Guatemala was once qualified as a banana republic.","瓜地馬拉曾經被稱作香蕉共和國。"]]],"qualitative":[[["adj.",["性质的","质的","定性的"]]],"cet6 ky ielts",7101,1,0],"qualitatively":[[["adv.",["质量上"]]],null,17890,0,0],"quality":[[["n.",["品质","特性","才能","质量"],["an essential and distinguishing attribute of something or someone"]],["adj.",["优质的"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts",764,4,1,"s:qualities",[["The initiative measurably improved quality of life for the villagers.","計劃使村民的生活改善了不少。"]]],"qualm":[[["n.",["晕眩","不安","疑虑","内疚"]]],"gre",14827,1,0,"s:qualms",[["He had no qualms in doing so.","他这么做，没有任何不安。"]]],"quandary":[[["n.",["困惑","迷惑","为难"]]],"toefl gre",15583,0,0,"s:quandaries",[["When both girls told John they had feelings for him, he was in a quandary as to which girl he should be with.","当两个女生都跟约翰宣称她们对他有感觉时，他不知道该跟哪个谈恋爱了。"]]],"quantify":[[["v.",["定量","用数量表示","测量"]]],"cet6 ky",9701,1,0,"d:quantified/i:quantifying/3:quantifies"],"quantitative":[[["adj.",["数量的","定量的"]]],"cet6 ky toefl ielts",7662,1,0],"quantity":[[["n.",["量","数量","总量"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky toefl",4057,3,1,"s:quantities",[["We're amazed by the rapid growth in import quantities.","进口数量的急速增长让我们感到惊讶。"]]],"quantum":[[["n.",["量","量子"]]],"gre",5616,2,0],"quarantine":[[["n.",["隔离","封锁交通","检疫期"]],["v.",["隔离","排斥"]]],"gre",14311,1,0,"d:quarantined/s:quarantines/i:quarantining",[["This area has bee