我做完我的功课后，就读这本书。"]]],"readable":[[["adj.",["值得一读的","易读的","读起来津津有味的"]],["",["可读的"]]],null,17246,1,0],"reader":[[["n.",["读者","读物","文选","校对人","讲师"],["a person who enjoys reading"]],["",["阅读程序","阅读器"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky",1268,4,1,"s:readers",[["These books are not fit for young readers.","这本书不是给年轻读者看的。"]]],"readership":[[["n.",["读者","读者人数"]]],null,14526,1,0,"s:readerships"],"readily":[[["adv.",["迅速地","轻易地","乐意地"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts gre",4013,2,0,[["Although Hiroko dislikes cigarette smoke, she readily goes out drinking with friends.","虽然弘子不喜欢香烟的烟雾，她却乐意和朋友出去喝酒。"]]],"readiness":[[["n.",["预备","准备","敏捷"]]],null,7489,1,0,"s:readinesses"],"readjust":[[["v.",["重新调整","再调整","再整理"]]],"toefl",17822,0,0,"p:readjusted/i:readjusting/3:readjusts",[["In consequence of a new agreement between two competitors, we need to readjust our strategies.","由于两个竞争对手的一项新协议，我们需要重新调整战略。"]]],"readout":[[["n.",["宣读","读出"]]],null,16427,0,0,"s:readouts"],"ready":[[["adj.",["准备好的","备用的","可以使用的"],["completely prepared or in condition for immediate action or use or pr…"]],["n.",["预备好的状态","现款"],["poised for action"]],["adv.",["预先","迅速"]],["v.",["使准备好"]]],"zk gk toefl gre",758,4,1,"s:readies/i:readying/r:readier/d:readied",[["We arrived to find a huge meal ready for us.","我們到達後發現一頓大餐已經為我們準備好了。"]]],"ready-made":[[["adj.",["现成的","做好的"]]],null,0,1,0,"s:ready-mades"],"reaffirm":[[["v.",["重申","再确认"]]],null,9162,1,0,"p:reaffirmed/i:reaffirming/3:reaffirms",[["This is our chance to answer that call. This is our moment. This is our time, to put our people back to work and open doors of opportunity for our kids; to restore prosperity and promote the cause of peace; to reclaim the American dream and reaffirm that fundamental truth, that out of many, we are one; that while we breathe, we hope. And where we are met with cynicism and doubt and those who tell us that we can't, we will respond with that timeless creed that sums up the spirit of a people: Yes, we can.","现在是我们回答这个问题的机会。这是我们的时刻这是我们的时代--让我们的人民重新就业，为我们的后代敞开机会之门，恢复繁荣…"]]],"reagent":[[["n.",["试剂","反应物"]]],"gre",29096,0,0,"s:reagents"],"real":[[["adj.",["真的","真实的","实际的","实在的","不动(产)的"],["being or occurring in fact or actuality; having verified existence; n…"]],["n.",["实数","现实"],["the basic unit of money in Brazil; equal to 100 centavos"]],["adv.",["真正地"]]],"zk gk cet4 cet6 ky",305,5,1,[["I'm not a real fish, I'm just a mere plushy.","我不是一条真的鱼，我只是一个长毛绒玩具。"]]],"realign":[[["v.",["vi. 重新排列","重新组合"]]],"gre",19555,0,0,"i:realigning/d:realigned/s:realigns"],"realignment":[[["n.",["重新排列","改组","重新组合"]],["",["重新调整"]]],null,15855,0,0,"s:realignments"],"realise":[[["v.",["实现","认识到","体会到","了解","认清"]]],"zk gk ky",0,0,0,"p:realised/i:realising/3:realises",[["Eh? We said we'd go to the park? I didn't realise.","啊？我们说过要去公园吗？我没有印象。"]]],"realism":[[["n.",["写实主义","现实","实在论"]],["",["现实主义"]]],"toefl",7175,1,0,"s:realisms"],"realist":[[["n.",["现实主义者","写实主义者","实在论者"]]],null,9945,1,0,"s:realists"],"realistic":[[["adj.",["现实的","逼真的","现实主义的","实在论的"]]],"cet6 ky",3993,2,1,[["Let's be realistic.","現實點吧。"]]],"realistically":[[["adv.",["写实地","逼真地","现实地"]]],null,11137,1,0],"reality":[[["n.",["实在","事实","实体","逼真"],["the state of being actual or real"]],["",["现实","实在存在的事物","实在性"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky",1032,4,1,"s:realities",[["It is sometimes hard to choose between dreams and reality.","梦想和现实有时真的很难取舍。"]]],"realization":[[["n.",["实现","领悟","实得","现实化"]]],"cet6 toefl",5579,0,0,"s:realizations"],"realize":[[["v.",["了解","实现","使显得逼真","变卖"],["make real or concrete; give reality or substance to"]]],"cet4 cet6 toefl",616,4,1,"p:realized/i:realizing/3:realizes",[["It was not until then that I realized my mistake.","到了那時，我才發現自己錯了。"]]],"really":[[["adv.",["实际上","真实地","实在"]]],"zk",143,5,1,[["My younger brother really likes to take photos of mountains.","我弟弟很喜欢拍山的照片。"]]],"realm":[[["n.",["王国","领土","领域"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts gre",3911,2,0,"s:realms"],"realtor":[[["n.",["房地产经纪人"]]],null,18825,0,0,"s:realtors",[["Tom is a realtor.","湯姆是中介。"]]],"ream":[[["v.",["扩(孔)","