A glass of cold water is very refreshing in hot weather.","一杯冷水在暑热的天气里十分提神。"]]],"refreshing":[[["adj.",["使清爽的","有精神的","爽快的"]]],"toefl ielts",8722,2,0,[["A glass of cold water is very refreshing in hot weather.","一杯冷水在暑热的天气里十分提神。"]]],"refreshment":[[["n.",["点心","起提神作用的事物","精神爽快"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts",14418,1,0,"s:refreshments",[["We will continue the meeting after some light refreshments.","茶点过后我们接着开会。"]]],"refrigerant":[[["adj.",["冷冻的","冷却的","清凉的"]],["n.",["清凉剂","冷却剂","冷冻剂"]],["",["致冷剂"]]],"toefl",23229,0,0,"s:refrigerants"],"refrigerate":[[["v.",["使冷却","使清凉","冷藏"]],["",["冷冻"]]],"toefl",8533,1,0,"p:refrigerated/i:refrigerating/3:refrigerates"],"refrigeration":[[["n.",["冷却","冷藏","冷冻"]],["",["致冷"]]],"toefl",15892,0,0],"refrigerator":[[["n.",["电冰箱","冷藏库"]],["",["冷冻机","致冷器"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 toefl",4133,1,1,"s:refrigerators",[["There's a bottle of white wine in the refrigerator.","冰箱裡有一瓶白葡萄酒。"]]],"refuel":[[["v.",["补给燃料"]]],null,15247,1,0,"i:refuelling/p:refuelled/3:refuels"],"refuge":[[["n.",["避难所","安全地带","避难","庇护"]],["v.",["躲避","给予...庇护"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky toefl",4616,2,0,"s:refuges",[["We took refuge from the storm in a nearby barn.","为躲避风暴，我们躲到了附近的一个谷仓内。"]]],"refugee":[[["n.",["难民","流亡者","避难者"]]],"cet6 ky ielts gre",2599,4,0,"s:refugees",[["Refugees poured in from all over the country.","难民从整个国家涌来。"]]],"refulgent":[[["adj.",["辉煌的","灿烂的"]]],"gre",0,0,0],"refund":[[["v.",["付还","偿还借款","归还","偿还"]],["n.",["偿还"]]],"ky toefl ielts",10901,2,0,"s:refunds/d:refunded/i:refunding",[["Can I get a refund for this train ticket?","這張火車票能報銷嗎？"]]],"refurbish":[[["v.",["再磨光","刷新"]]],"toefl gre",15086,1,0,"d:refurbished/i:refurbishing/3:refurbishes",[["I might consider buying a refurbished phone.","我可能也會購買整修品。"]]],"refusal":[[["n.",["拒绝","推却","优先决定权","谢绝","取舍权"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky ielts",5933,2,1,"s:refusals",[["I interpreted her silence as a refusal.","我認為她的沉默就是表示拒絕。"]]],"refuse":[[["v.",["拒绝","谢绝"],["show unwillingness towards"]],["adj.",["扔掉的","无用的"]],["n.",["废物"]]],"zk gk cet4