urtyard residences.","在北京，胡同是由四合院的传统居所排形成。"]]],"residency":[[["n.",["住处","管辖区"]]],null,9370,1,0,"s:residencies"],"resident":[[["n.",["居民","常驻程序","居住者","留鸟"],["someone who lives at a particular place for a prolonged period or who…"]],["adj.",["居留的","定居的"],["living in a particular place"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky toefl gre",1254,4,1,"s:residents",[["More than half the residents are opposed to the plan.","有過半數的居民反對這個計劃。"]]],"residential":[[["",["有关居住的","房产的:居所的","适于居住的"]],["adj.",["住宅的","与居住有关的"]]],"cet6 toefl",3828,2,0,[["Please write down your residential address and home number.","请写下住址和家庭电话。"]]],"residual":[[["n.",["残渣","剩余","余数"]],["adj.",["残渣的","剩余的"]]],"cet6 toefl gre",7792,1,0,"s:residuals"],"residue":[[["n.",["残渣","剩余","余数","残基","残液"]]],"toefl gre",7576,1,0,"s:residues"],"resign":[[["v.",["辞职","放弃","使顺从","屈从"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky ielts",3390,3,0,"p:resigned/i:resigning/3:resigns",[["It is rumoured that the Prime Minister will resign next month.","据传总统下个月要辞职了。"]]],"resignation":[[["n.",["辞职","辞呈","听从"]]],"cet4 cet6 ielts gre",5762,3,0,"s:resignations",[["What shocked us greatly was his sudden resignation.","让我们非常惊讶的是，他突然辞职了。"]]],"resilience":[[["",["回弹","弹性","弹回性","回能","弹能"]],["n.",["弹回","有弹力","恢复力"]]],"ielts gre",10578,0,0],"resilient":[[["adj.",["弹回的","有弹力的"]],["",["回弹的","回能的"]]],"gre",10634,1,0],"resin":[[["n.",["树脂"]],["v.",["涂树脂于"]]],"toefl gre",12072,1,0,"s:resins"],"resist":[[["v.",["抵抗","耐得住","抵制","反抗"]],["n.",["防染材料"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky toefl",2470,3,1,"d:resisted/i:resisting/3:resists",[["No man can resist the lure of a woman.","没有男人能够抵挡女人的诱惑。"]]],"resistance":[[["n.",["抵抗力","反抗","耐力","阻力","电阻"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts",2226,3,1,"s:resistances",[["Years of resistance to misfortune ended when the settlers' village was overcome by the savages and their hopes and lives came to the bitter end.","当移居者的村庄被野蛮人征服后，他们的希望和生活到了痛苦的尽头，数年对灾祸的抵抗结束了。"]]],"resistant":[[["adj.",["抵抗的","反抗的","耐...的"]],["n.",["抵抗者","反抗者"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts",6664,2,0],"resolute":[[["a