 fog made it hard to see the road.","濃霧使道路很難看清。"]]],"roadblock":[[["n.",["障碍","障碍物"]]],null,11361,1,0,"s:roadblocks"],"roadshow":[[["n.",["（由广播电台、杂志或公司组织的）路演","巡回演出","巡回宣传（或竞选）团队"]]],null,28638,1,0,"s:roadshows"],"roadside":[[["n.",["路旁","路边"]],["adj.",["路边的"]]],null,7439,1,0,"s:roadsides"],"roadway":[[["n.",["车道","道路","轨道","路面","快车道"]]],null,10685,0,0,"s:roadways"],"roam":[[["v.",["漫游","闲逛","徜徉"]],["n.",["漫步","漫游"]]],"cet6 toefl ielts",6175,1,0,"i:roaming/p:roamed/3:roams"],"roar":[[["v.",["吼","大声说出","叫喊","喧闹","呼喊"]],["n.",["吼","咆哮","轰鸣"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts",5275,2,0,"p:roared/i:roaring/3:roars",[["We heard tigers roaring in the distance.","我們聽到遠處老虎的怒吼。"]]],"roast":[[["v.",["烤","炙","烘焙","嘲笑"]],["n.",["烤肉","烘烤","嘲笑"]],["adj.",["烘烤的","烤过的"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts",7679,2,0,"i:roasting/d:roasted/s:roasts/r:roaster",[["At Christmas, one eats roast goose, red cabbage, and wheat buns.","聖誕節時，人們會吃烤鵝、紅甘藍和小麥麵包。"]]],"rob":[[["v.",["抢夺","抢掠","剥夺"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky",5071,2,1,"d:robbed/i:robbing/3:robs",[["Last night my house was robbed while I was still awake.","昨晚我还没有睡觉家里就被小偷光顾了"]]],"robber":[[["n.",["强盗","盗贼"]]],"cet4 cet6 ielts",9557,1,0,"s:robbers",[["Today, robbers robbed another bank in broad daylight.","今天强盗大白天的就抢了另一家银行。"]]],"robbery":[[["",["强盗","抢劫","劫掠"]],["n.",["抢掠","抢夺"]]],"cet4 cet6",6012,0,0,"s:robberies",[["Bank robbery will cost you ten years in prison.","搶劫銀行的後果就是在監獄裏蹲十年。"]]],"robe":[[["n.",["宽松长袍","礼服","披肩","覆盖物"]],["v.",["(给)穿长袍"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky gre",5241,1,0,"s:robes/p:robed/i:robing",[["I use Yan garments as my plain robe, and turn Liqiu into ruins.","以兗衣為褋兮，以黎邱為墟。"]]],"robin":[[["n.",["旅鸫"]],["",["刺槐毒素"]]],null,15954,0,0,"s:robins",[["The robin is looking for worms.","知更鸟正在找虫子。"]]],"robot":[[["n.",["机械人","自动机械","机械般工作的人"]],["",["机器人","自动机"]]],"zk gk cet4 cet6 ky",4523,1,0,"s:robots",[["How could I be a robot? Robots don't dream.","我怎么可能是机器人呢？机器人不会做梦。"]]],"robotic":[[["adj.",["自动的","机器人的","像机器人的"]]],null,10115,0,0,"s:robotics"],"robust"