en able to get a good man.","世界上沒有一個壞男人會有一個好女人;同樣的,也沒有一個壞女人會有一個好男 人。"]]],"simile":[[["n.",["明喻","明喻说法"]]],"gre",19562,0,0,"s:similes"],"simmer":[[["v.",["煨","炖","内心充满"]],["n.",["即将沸腾的状态","即将发作"]]],null,5998,2,0,"p:simmered/3:simmers/i:simmering",[["Two women wielding giant spatulas continuously stir a brimming wok of shredded beef simmering in curry sauce.","兩名女子揮舞著巨大的鍋鏟，不停地翻炒著盛滿咖哩醬汁的牛肉絲。"]]],"simper":[[["v.",["假笑","傻笑","痴笑","假笑着说"]],["n.",["假笑","傻笑","痴笑"]]],"gre",42779,0,0,"p:simpered/i:simpering/3:simpers"],"simple":[[["adj.",["简单的","普通的","朴素的","单纯的","绝对的"],["having few parts; not complex or complicated or involved"]],["n.",["出身低微者","傻子"],["any herbaceous plant having medicinal properties"]]],"zk gk ielts",763,4,1,"t:simplest/r:simpler",[["Do you want to know my secret? It's very simple...","你想不想知道我的秘密？它很简单……"]]],"simpleton":[[["n.",["笨蛋","傻子"]]],"gre",28804,0,0,"s:simpletons"],"simplicity":[[["n.",["单纯","简朴","朴素","坦率","天真"]],["",["简明性"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky toefl",7007,1,0,"s:simplicities",[["The truth and simplicity of nature is always the most important foundation of noteworthy art.","大自然的真实和质朴往往是值得注意的艺术中最重要的基石。"]]],"simplification":[[["n.",["单一化","单纯化","简单化"]]],null,18552,0,0,"s:simplifications",[["In China, there is a large number of characters, so the goal of the character simplification was to replace the complex traditional characters with easy to remember simplified characters and increase the literacy rate.","中國的漢字數量繁多，推行漢字簡化的目的，是把結構複雜的繁體字轉換成易學易記的簡體字，從而提高國民的識字水平。"]]],"simplify":[[["v.",["单一化","简单化"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky ielts",8483,1,0,"d:simplified/3:simplifies/i:simplifying",[["If I search for \"什么\" using Simplified Chinese, I expect to also see \"甚麼\" in the results.","如果我用简体中文输入“什么”，我希望找到的结果里也有“甚麼”。"]]],"simplistic":[[["adj.",["过分简单化的"]]],null,10678,1,0],"simply":[[["adv.",["简单地","只是","简直","简朴地","坦白地"]]],"gk",583,4,1,[["The whole place was simply blotted out with the snow.","整個地方完全地被雪遮蓋住了。"]]],"simulate":[[["",["伪装的","模拟的","假装的","冒充"]],["v.",["模拟","假装","模仿"]]],"cet6 ky toefl ielts gre",7892,1,0,"i:simulating/d:simulated/3:simulates"],"simulation":[[["n.",["模拟","假冒物","模仿"]]],null,5678,1,0,"s:simulations",[["Build your own championship team in a new football management simulation game, launching in early November.","全新足球經理模擬遊戲將於 11 月初推出，邀你打造屬於自己的冠軍球隊。"]]],"simulator":[[["n.",["模拟器","假装者"]]],null,12924,0,0,"s:simulators"],"simultaneous":[[["adj.",["同时的","同时发生的"]]],"cet6 ky toefl ielts gre",8695,2,0],"simultaneously":[[["adv.",["同时发生","一齐","同时","同时存在"]]],"cet6 toefl",3662,0,0],"sin":[[["n.",["罪","犯罪","过失","失礼"]],["v.",["犯"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky toefl",3285,2,0,"s:sins/d:sinned/i:sinning",[["Is it always a sin to tell a lie?","说谎总是一种罪吗？"]]],"since":[[["conj.",["既然","自...以后","自...以来"],["Seeing that; because; considering; -- formerly followed"]],["prep.",["自...以后","自...以来"],["From the time of; in or during the time subsequent to"]],["adv.",["自那时以后"],["From a definite past time until now; as, he went a month"]]],"zk gk",260,5,1,[["My father has been in good shape since his operation.","自从手术后，我父亲一直处于良好的状态。"]]],"sincere":[[["adj.",["诚实的","正直的","真挚的","纯净的"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky ielts gre",6875,2,1,"t:sincerest/r:sincerer",[["Please accept my sincere congratulations on your success today.","請接受我對您今天的成功最誠摯的祝賀。"]]],"sincerely":[[["adv.",["真诚地"]]],"gk",10201,1,1,[["I won’t forgive you unless you apologise sincerely.","我不会原谅你，除非你真诚地道歉。"]]],"sincerity":[[["n.",["诚实","真实","诚心诚意"]]],"cet6",10928,0,0,"s:sincerities",[["But having someone is already good in and of itself, and if they treat you with sincerity and love you from the bottom of their heart, then you really can entrust your life to them.","但是如果有一個人本身已經很好了，對你又是真心真意，真心愛你，那麼你真的可以把一生托付給他。"]]],"sinecure":[[["n.",["闲职"]],["",["领干俸的职位"]]],"gre",38595,0,0,"s:sinecures"],"sinew":[[["n.",["肌肉","精力","体力","力量的源泉","腱"]],["v.",["赋予力量","加强"]]],"gre",23614,0,0,"s:sinews/p:sinewed"],"sinful":[[["adj.",["有罪的","罪孽深重的"]],["",["有罪","充满罪恶的"]]],null,13589,0,0],"sing":[[["v.",["唱","唱歌","演唱","鸣","啼"],["deliver by singing"]],["n.",["嗖嗖声"]]],"zk gk",1013,4,1,"i:singing/p:sang/d:sung/3:sings",[["We all felt embarrassed to sing a song in public.","观众面前唱歌让我们大家都感到尴尬。"]]],"singe":[[["v.",["烧焦","烤焦"]]],"toefl gre",21246,0,0,"p:singed/i:singeing/3:singes"],"singer":[[["n.",["歌手"]]],"gk cet4 cet6",2823,3,1,"s:singers",[["She's famous as a singer but not as a poet.","她是一個有名的歌手，但卻沒有多少人知道她也有寫詩。"]]],"singer-songwriter":[[["n.",["写词并演唱的歌手"]]],null,0,1,0,"s:singer-songwriters"],"single":[[["adj.",["单身的","单程的","单一的","个别的","孤独的"],["used of flowers having usually only one row or whorl of petals"]],["n.",["一个","单打","单程票"],["a base hit on which the batter stops safely at first base"]],["v.",["选出","击出一垒打"],["hit a single"]],["",["单精度型"]]],"zk gk ielts",632,5,1,"s:singles/d:singled/i:singling",[["Not a single cloud could be seen in the sky.","天上萬里無雲。"]]],"single-handed":[[["adj.",["单独的","单人完成的","单枪匹马的","独立的","独手的"]],["adv.",["独立地","单人完成地"]]],null,0,1,0],"single-minded":[[["adj.",["诚实的","诚心的","专心的"]]],null,0,1,0,[["She works with single-minded determination.","她一心一意地工作。"]]],"singular":[[["adj.",["异常的","单一的"]],["n.",["单数"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky ielts",9212,1,0,"s:singulars",[["And all those watching tonight from beyond our shores, from parliaments and palaces, to those who are huddled around radios in the forgotten corners of the world, our stories are singular, but our destiny is shared, and a new dawn of American leadership is at hand.","对于那些彻夜关注美国大选的海外人士，从国会到皇宫，以及在被遗忘的角落里挤在收音机旁的人们，我们的经历虽然各有不同，但是…"]]],"singularity":[[["n.",["奇异","突出","稀有"]],["",["奇点"]]],"gre",16837,0,0,"s:singularities"],"singularly":[[["adv.",["少见地","不可思议地","异常地"]]],null,17633,0,0],"sinister":[[["adj.",["不吉利的","凶恶的","左边的"]],["",["左的"]]],"toefl gre",9576,2,0,"s:sinisters"],"sink":[[["v.",["下沉","沉没","下陷","减弱","衰退"]],["n.",["藏垢的场所","沟渠","污水槽"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts",2809,3,1,"p:sank/d:sunk/i:sinking/s:sinks",[["Tom seems to have packed everything but the kitchen sink.","Tom把除了厨房水槽之外的所有东西都打包了。"]]],"sinner":[[["n.",["罪人","不知礼仪的人