,0,0,[["Looks like these so-called painters can't paint anything.","看來這些所謂的畫家啥也不會畫。"]]],"so-so":[[["adj.",["平常的","还过得去的","马马虎虎的","一般的"]],["adv.",["平常地","还过得去地","马马虎虎地","一般地"]]],null,0,1,0,[["My mother from Malaysia thinks that those three horses are so-so.","我从马来西亚来的妈妈觉得那三匹马马马虎虎。"]]],"soak":[[["v.",["使上下湿透","浸","吸入","吸收","浸洗掉"]],["n.",["浸","湿透","大雨"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky ielts gre",4835,2,0,"i:soaking/d:soaked/3:soaks",[["I got soaked by the rain on the way home.","我回家路上被雨淋得濕透了。"]]],"soap":[[["n.",["肥皂","阿谀"]],["v.",["以肥皂洗","阿谀"]],["",["评语"]]],"zk gk cet4 cet6 ky toefl",4344,2,1,"s:soaps/i:soaping/p:soaped",[["Our love affair was as short-lived as a soap bubble.","我们的爱情就像肥皂泡一样脆弱。"]]],"soapy":[[["adj.",["涂着肥皂的","谄媚的","圆滑的"]]],null,18349,0,0],"soar":[[["v.",["往上飞舞","高耸","翱翔"]],["n.",["高扬","翱翔"]]],"cet6 ky ielts gre",4707,2,0,"p:soared/i:soaring/3:soars",[["The value of the yen has soared.","日元的價值大幅上升。"]]],"sob":[[["v.",["啜泣","呜咽","哭诉","哭得使"]],["n.",["啜泣","呜咽"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky",7230,1,0,"i:sobbing/p:sobbed/s:sobs",[["The girl was sobbing in the corner of the schoolroom.","女孩在教室的角落啜泣。"]]],"sober":[[["adj.",["未醉的","稳重的","节制的","严肃的","不夸大的"]],["v.",["使醒酒","使严肃","从醉里醒来","变严肃"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts gre",7423,2,0,"p:sobered/3:sobers/i:sobering",[["I was as sober as a judge.","我当时非常清醒。"]]],"sobriety":[[["n.",["节制饮酒","戒酒","节制","一本正经","庄重"]]],"gre",16615,0,0],"soccer":[[["n.",["英式足球"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky",3353,3,0,[["The soccer game will be played, even if it rains.","就算下雨，足球比賽也會如期進行。"]]],"sociable":[[["adj.",["好交际的","社交的","过社会生活的"]],["n.",["联谊会"]]],"ky toefl ielts gre",20210,1,0,[["I attended the party just to be sociable.","我去那個派對純粹是為了交際。"]]],"social":[[["adj.",["社会的","群居的","社交的"],["relating to human society and its members"]],["n.",["联欢会"]]],"zk gk cet4 cet6 ky ielts",319,5,1,[["Germany adopted a social security system in the 1880's.","德国在1880年代采取了一种社会保障制度。"]]],"socialism":[[["n.",["社会主义","社会主义运动"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky",7238,2,0,"s:socialisms"],"socialist":[[["n.",["社会主义者",