ing to redo the hem of my pants.","裁縫師要幫我重新修褲腳。"]]],"tailor-made":[[["adj.",["裁缝做的","特制的"]]],null,0,1,0],"taint":[[["v.",["污染","使腐败","沾染","腐蚀"]],["n.",["污点","耻辱","感染"]]],"toefl",11293,1,0,"d:tainted/3:taints/i:tainting"],"taiwanese":[[["adj.",["台湾人的","台湾的"]]],null,11061,0,0,[["The Taiwanese dollar appreciated, causing Taiwanese exports to slump.","台幣上漲，造成台灣的出口貿易萎靡不振。"]]],"take":[[["v.",["拿","取","抓","带领","获得"],["carry out"]],["n.",["拿","取","收成","奏效"],["the act of photographing a scene or part of a scene without interrupt…"]]],"zk gk ielts",63,1,1,"p:took/d:taken/i:taking/3:takes",[["She won't take an airplane for fear of a crash.","她不会乘飞机因为害怕坠机。"]]],"takeoff":[[["n.",["起飞"]]],null,10467,0,0,"s:takeoffs"],"takeover":[[["n.",["接管","接收"]]],null,7170,3,0,"s:takeovers",[["We, ACME Ltd., hereby announce that we will resist with all our strength this hostile takeover.","我們ACME有限公司，特此宣布，我們將盡我們的力量抵制這種惡意收購。"]]],"taker":[[["n.",["取者","捕者","接受者","收取者"]],["",["受者","收票人","接受打赌的人"]]],null,11830,1,0,"s:takers"],"tale":[[["n.",["故事","谎言","谣言","陈述","叙述"]]],"zk gk cet4 cet6 ky toefl",2239,3,0,"s:tales",[["The author translated the fairy tale into our mother tongue.","作者將童話翻譯成了我們的母語。"]]],"talent":[[["n.",["天才","才能","有才干的人","天资"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky toefl",2030,4,0,"s:talents",[["We believe he will succeed, for he has talent.","他是個有才能的人，我們相信他會成功。"]]],"talented":[[["adj.",["天资高的","有才能的"]]],"toefl ielts",4080,0,0,[["Mary discovered that Tom was secretly a talented singer.","瑪莉發現湯姆其實是一位很有才華的歌手。"]]],"taliban":[[["",["塔利班"]]],null,6947,0,0],"talisman":[[["n.",["护身符","驱邪物","法宝"]]],"gre",19492,0,0,"s:talismans"],"talk":[[["v.",["讲话","演讲","说话","谈话","交流"]],["n.",["谈话","交谈","会谈","讲话","演讲"],["an exchange of ideas via conversation"]],["",["对话类","聊天"]]],"zk gk",168,5,1,"i:talking/s:talks/p:talked",[["The dictionary he talked about isn't available in the library.","他说的词典图书馆没有."]]],"talkative":[[["adj.",["喜欢说话的","饶舌的","多嘴的"]]],null,17672,0,0,[["He is as talkative as ever.","他和以前一樣話多。"]]],"talker":[[["n.