ked in literary grace; Emperor Taizong of Tang and Emperor Taizu of Song, though commendable in their elegance, still fall slightly short in their brilliance. The proud conqueror, Genghis Khan, knew only how to bend the bow and shoot great eagles. All of them are now bygone, and if you want to count the truly remarkable figures, look to the present age.","惜秦皇汉武，略输文采；唐宗宋祖，稍逊风骚。一代天骄，成吉思汗，只识弯弓射大雕。俱往矣，数风流人物，还看今朝。"]]],"tangential":[[["adj.",["切线的","相切的","正切的","离题的","扯远的"]]],"gre",25263,0,0],"tangerine":[[["n.",["柑橘"]]],null,19431,0,0,"s:tangerines",[["I like grapefruit and tangerines.","我喜歡柚子和橘子。"]]],"tangible":[[["adj.",["可触摸的","有实体的","非相像的","有形的","明确的"]],["n.",["可触知的东西","有形资产"]]],"toefl ielts gre",7176,1,0,"s:tangibles"],"tangle":[[["n.",["缠结","纠结的一团","困惑","纠纷","混乱"]],["v.",["使缠结","缠住","缠结","乱作一团"]]],"cet6 ky toefl ielts gre",9440,2,0,"s:tangles/p:tangled/i:tangling"],"tango":[[["n.",["探戈舞","探戈舞曲"]],["v.",["跳探戈舞"]]],"gre",12132,1,0,"s:tangos/i:tangoing/p:tangoed/3:tangoes"],"tangy":[[["adj.",["有强烈盐味的","气味刺鼻的","有刺激性的"]]],"gre",16595,1,0],"tank":[[["n.",["槽","箱","柜","罐","池塘"],["an enclosed armored military vehicle; has a cannon and moves on cater…"]],["v.",["储于箱中"],["store in a tank by causing (something) to flow into it"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky toefl",1874,3,1,"s:tanks/i:tanking/p:tanked",[["The fuel tank in the car is full.","汽車油箱是滿的。"]]],"tanker":[[["n.",["坦克手","油船","空中加油飞机","运油飞机","油槽/水槽汽车"]],["",["槽车","油槽船"]]],"gk cet6 ky",9275,2,0,"s:tankers/d:tankered",[["A huge tanker just pulled out from the dock.","一艘巨大的液货船刚刚启航。"]]],"tantalize":[[["v.",["逗弄","使干着急"]]],"toefl gre",15919,1,0,"i:tantalizing/3:tantalizes/p:tantalized"],"tantamount":[[["adj.",["同等的","相等的","相当于...的","相当的"]]],"gre",15128,1,0,[["Victory attained by violence is tantamount to a defeat, for it is momentary.","靠武力取勝，猶如落敗，因為這樣的勝利不會長久。"]]],"tantrum":[[["n.",["发脾气","发怒","暴怒"]]],"gre",12534,1,0,"s:tantrums"],"tap":[[["v.",["轻打","轻敲","敲打出","选择","装上嘴子"]],["n.",["轻打","水龙头"]],["",["接头"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts"