nce using a telescope.","我們可以用望遠鏡來觀察遠方的事物。"]]],"telescopic":[[["adj.",["望远镜的","用望远镜看到的","套管式的","伸缩的"]],["",["望远的"]]],null,19136,0,0],"televise":[[["v.",["用电视播放","播映"]]],"toefl",16618,2,0,"d:televised/i:televising/3:televises",[["Let's go to the stadium, because today's match will not be televised.","一起去體育館吧，因爲今天的比賽沒有電視轉播。"]]],"television":[[["n.",["电视"],["broadcasting visual images of stationary or moving objects"]]],"zk gk ielts",794,4,1,"s:televisions",[["If you want to be free, destroy your television set.","你想成为自由就摧毁你的电视。"]]],"telex":[[["n.",["用户直通电报","电传打字机"]],["",["电传","用户电报"]]],"cet6 ielts",33037,1,0,"s:telexes/p:telexed/i:telexing"],"tell":[[["v.",["告诉","说","吩咐","断定","知道"],["let something be known"]]],"zk gk",103,5,1,"p:told/i:telling/3:tells",[["The doctor told her that she should take a rest.","医生告诉她要静养。"]]],"teller":[[["n.",["叙述者","讲故事者","出纳员"]]],null,10852,1,0,"s:tellers",[["A fortune teller once told Christopher Columbus that he would become a famous man. Columbus, in turn, got angry and demanded his money back - claiming that even a child could state something so obvious.","從前有個占卜師告訴哥倫布他將來會成名。哥倫布聽到了，就生氣地要求退錢：「這麼簡單的事實，就連三歲小孩也懂！」"]]],"telltale":[[["n.",["搬弄是非者","迹象","指示器"]],["adj.",["搬弄是非的","泄露秘密的","报警的"]]],null,13046,0,0,"s:telltales"],"telly":[[["n.",["电视"]]],null,25229,1,0,"s:tellies",[["Could you turn the telly down a bit?","把電視聲音關小點好嗎？"]]],"temerity":[[["n.",["鲁莽","蛮勇"]]],"gre",26148,0,0],"temp":[[["n.",["临时雇员"]]],"gre",11941,0,0,"s:temps/i:temping/d:temped"],"temper":[[["n.",["(钢等的)硬度","脾气","心情","中和剂","倾向"]],["v.",["使回火","锻炼","调和","使缓和","回火"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts gre",6436,2,0,"d:tempered/s:tempers/i:tempering",[["His quick temper will get him in trouble one day.","他脾氣這麼壞，早晚會惹麻煩。"]]],"temperament":[[["n.",["气质","性格","性情","禀赋"]]],"cet6 ky toefl ielts",8423,1,0,"s:temperaments"],"temperamental":[[["adj.",["气质的","性格的","易兴奋的"]]],"ky",18395,0,0],"temperance":[[["n.",["节欲","戒酒","禁酒","节制","节制(饮食等)"]]],"toefl",21464,0,0],"temperate":[[["adj.",["温和的"