alia go shopping. They buy something for themselves.","瑪麗亞和納塔利婭去購物。他們為自己買些東西。"]]],"then":[[["adv.",["然后","当时"]],["conj.",["然后","当时"]],["n.",["那时"],["that time; that moment"]]],"zk gk",77,5,1,[["You say one thing and then act just the opposite.","你说一套做一套。"]]],"theocracy":[[["n.",["神权政治","神权国"]]],"gre",20909,0,0,"s:theocracies"],"theologian":[[["n.",["神学者"]]],null,6820,1,0,"s:theologians"],"theological":[[["adj.",["神学上的"]]],"ky",4732,0,0],"theologically":[[["adv.",["神学地","神学上地"]]],null,18266,0,0],"theology":[[["n.",["神学"]]],null,3833,1,0,"s:theologies"],"theorem":[[["n.",["定理","原理"]]],"cet6",17159,0,0,"s:theorems",[["The integral and the antiderivative are defined in two different ways, and the Fundamental Theorem of Calculus states the relationship between them.","積分與反導函數是以兩種不同的方式定義的，而微積分基本定理闡述了兩者之間的關係。"]]],"theoretical":[[["adj.",["理论的","理论上的","假设的","推理的"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts gre",3781,2,0,[["The Greeks invented a theoretical model of geometry.","希臘人建立了幾何學的理論模型。"]]],"theoretically":[[["adv.",["理论上","理论地"]]],null,8003,0,0],"theorist":[[["n.",["理论家","理论工作者"]]],null,6290,1,0,"s:theorists"],"theorize":[[["v.",["建立理论","讲理论","推理"]]],null,10652,1,0,"i:theorizing/d:theorized/3:theorizes"],"theory":[[["n.",["理论","学说","原理","意见","推测"],["a well-substantiated explanation of some aspect of the natural world;…"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky ielts",918,4,1,"s:theories",[["We could apply the theory of punctuated equilibrium to languages.","我们可以把间断平衡理论应用到语言上。"]]],"therapeutic":[[["adj.",["治疗的","有益于健康的","治疗学的"]]],"toefl gre",6743,1,0],"therapist":[[["n.",["治疗学家"]]],"ielts",3916,2,0,"s:therapists",[["She works as a massage therapist.","她是按摩师。"]]],"therapy":[[["n.",["治疗","疗法"]]],"cet6 ky toefl ielts",2142,3,0,"s:therapies",[["Demand for occupational therapy has surged in recent years.","这几年对作业疗法的需求在迅速增长。"]]],"there":[[["adv.",["在那里"]]],"zk gk",53,5,1,[["The man reading a paper over there is my uncle.","在那儿看报纸的男人是我叔叔。"]]],"thereafter":[[["adv.",["其后","从那时以后"]]],"cet6 ky toefl",6497,2,0,[["Thereafter we heard no more from him.","从那时以后，我们再也没听到他的任何音讯。"]]],"thereby":[[["adv.",["因此"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts",3891,2,0,[["When Heaven is about to bestow a great responsibility on a person, it must first distress their mind, exhaust their muscles and bones, starve their body, and deprive them of resources, making their actions go against their will. This is done to stimulate their heart and temper their character, thereby increasing what they are capable of.","故天将降大任于是人也，必先苦其心志，劳其筋骨，饿其体肤，空乏其身，行拂乱其所为，所以动心忍性，曾益其所不能。"]]],"therefore":[[["adv.",["因此","所以"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky toefl",1161,4,1,[["They have a growing population; therefore they need more and more food.","那國家的人口正在增長，所以他們需要的食物量也愈來愈大。"]]],"therein":[[["adv.",["在其中","在那里","在那一点上"]]],"cet6",12928,1,0,[["Therein lies the problem.","那就是问题所在了。"]]],"thereof":[[["adv.",["在其中","关于...","由此","由是","属于它的"]]],"cet6",12522,0,0],"thermal":[[["adj.",["热的","热量的","温泉的"]],["n.",["上升温暖气流"]]],"cet6 ky toefl ielts gre",7148,1,0,"s:thermals/i:thermalling",[["The atomic reactor generates enormous amounts of thermal energy.","原子反应堆发出大量的热能。"]]],"thermodynamics":[[["n.",["热力学"]]],"toefl",24038,0,0],"thermometer":[[["n.",["温度计","体温计"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts",9651,1,0,"s:thermometers",[["The nurse took his temperature with a thermometer.","護士用溫度計量了量他的體溫。"]]],"thermos":[[["n.",["热水瓶"]]],"gk",17096,0,0,[["Obviously, we don't know if those thermos flasks are their own.","当然，那些热水瓶是不是他们自己的就不得而知了。"]]],"thermostat":[[["n.",["自动调温器","温度自动启闭装置"]],["",["恒温器","恒温箱"]]],null,15617,0,0,"s:thermostats/d:thermostatted"],"thesaurus":[[["n.",["专类辞典","宝库","知识宝库","叙词表","主题词表"]],["",["同义词","同义词典"]]],"ielts",22411,0,0,[["Where's the thesaurus?","同義詞典在哪裡？"]]],"these":[[["pron.",["这些"],["The plural of this. See This."]]],"zk gk",82,5,0,[["I want a box in which to keep these toys.","我想要个能装这些玩具的盒子。"]]],"thesis":[[["n.",["论题","论文"]]],"cet6 ky toefl ielts gre",5974,2,0,"s:theses",[["I'll need at least three days to translate that thesis.","要翻译那篇论文，我最