 thanks.","我們畢業的時候送了一個桌上時鐘給他作為謝禮。"]]],"tokyo":[[["n.",["东京"]]],"gk",0,0,0,[["The other day something horrible happened in a Tokyo suburb.","前幾天，東京郊外發生了件可怕的事情。"]]],"tolerable":[[["adj.",["可容忍的","可以的"]]],"toefl ielts",15726,1,0,[["Your actions are tolerable, as a kid.","作为一个孩子，你的表现还说得过去"]]],"tolerance":[[["n.",["宽容","忍受","容忍","容许量","公差"]],["",["允许误差"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts gre",4670,2,0,"s:tolerances",[["By reading books and discussing concepts, a person can gain wisdom and tolerance of differing ideas.","藉由讀書和討論概念, 一個人能獲得智慧並包容不同的想法。"]]],"tolerant":[[["adj.",["宽容的","容忍的","(对冷、热)能耐的"]],["",["能耐受的"]]],"cet6 ky toefl",9167,0,0,[["It is said that Dutch are tolerant.","人們常說荷蘭人很寬容。"]]],"tolerate":[[["v.",["宽容","容许","有耐力"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky toefl",4319,2,0,"d:tolerated/i:tolerating/3:tolerates",[["I can't tolerate this noise any longer.","我不能再忍受這個噪音了。"]]],"toleration":[[["n.",["宽容","默认","信仰自由"]],["",["耐量","耐受性","耐力"]]],null,19290,0,0],"toll":[[["v.",["征收","敲钟","鸣钟","勾引","引诱"]],["n.",["通行费","代价","钟声"]]],"ky toefl ielts gre",4599,2,0,"s:tolls/p:tolled/i:tolling",[["We must pay a toll to drive on this road.","我们必得缴通行税才能在这条道路上行驶。"]]],"tomato":[[["n.",["番茄","西红柿"]]],"zk gk cet4 cet6 ky toefl",2400,2,1,"s:tomatoes",[["Strictly speaking, the tomato is not a vegetable. It's a fruit.","嚴格來說，蕃茄不是蔬菜，是水果。"]]],"tomb":[[["n.",["坟墓","死亡"]],["v.",["埋葬"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky",6183,1,0,"s:tombs",[["What is learned in the cradle is carried to the tomb.","搖籃裡學的帶到墳墓。"]]],"tombstone":[[["n.",["墓石","墓碑","墓志铭"]]],"gre",13593,1,0,"s:tombstones"],"tome":[[["n.",["册","卷","大本书"]]],null,15196,1,0,"s:tomes"],"tomography":[[["",["X线体层照相术","X线断层照相术"]],["n.",["X线断层摄影术"]]],null,17767,0,0],"tomorrow":[[["n.",["明天","未来"],["the day after today"]],["adv.",["明天","未来地"]]],"zk gk",1334,4,1,"s:tomorrows",[["Mr. Brown, a friend from Oregon, will visit us tomorrow.","一个从俄勒冈州来的朋友，布朗先生明天会来拜访我们。"]]],"ton":[[["n.",["吨"]]],"zk gk cet4 cet6 ky",0,3,1,"s:tons/i:toning/r:tonner",[["He left me with tons of hard work to do.","他把那么难做的活儿丢给我。"]]],"tonal":[[["adj.",["音调的","色调的"]]],null,15307,0,0,[["Chinese is a tonal language.","漢語是一個聲調語言。"]]],"tone":[[["n.",["音调","音质","语调","语气","色调"],["the quality of a person's voice"]],["v.",["给...定色调","增强","使...的声调和谐","定音调","颜色调和"]],["",["双音频"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky",1995,3,1,"s:tones/d:toned/i:toning",[["Did you pick up on that strange tone in his voice?","你有沒有發現他說話的語氣有點古怪？"]]],"toner":[[["",["增色剂","色粉"]],["n.",["调色剂"]]],null,24767,1,0,"s:toners"],"tongs":[[["n.",["钳子","夹具"]],["",["钳"]]],"gre",15320,0,0,[["Unable to find a spatula, Tom used tongs to flip the pancakes.","湯姆找不到鍋鏟了，只好用夾子為煎餅翻面。"]]],"tongue":[[["v.",["舔","斥责","发...的音","使用舌头","吹管乐器"]],["n.",["舌","语言能力","讲话方式","语言"]]],"zk gk cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts",2871,2,1,"s:tongues/i:tonguing/p:tongued",[["A slip of the tongue often brings about unexpected results.","一時失言常常會帶來意想不到的結果。"]]],"tonic":[[["adj.",["滋补的","声调的","使精神振作的"]],["n.",["补药","(音乐)主调音或基音"]]],"ielts gre",12096,1,0,"s:tonics"],"tonight":[[["n.",["今晚","今夜"],["the present or immediately coming night"]],["adv.",["今晚","今夜"]]],"zk gk",910,4,1,[["We'll get a phone call from him tonight for sure.","今晚我們肯定會接到他的電話。"]]],"tonne":[[["n.",["吨","公吨"]]],null,0,2,1,"s:tonnes",[["We'd like to order 18 tonnes of olive oil.","我们要订18吨橄榄油。"]]],"tonsorial":[[["adj.",["理发师的","理发的"]]],"gre",0,0,0],"too":[[["adv.",["也","非常","太"]]],"zk gk",133,5,1,[["She lets her children have their own way too much.","她太放任她的孩子们了。"]]],"tool":[[["n.",["工具","机床","傀儡"],["an implement used in the practice of a vocation"]],["v.",["用工具加工","使用工具"],["drive"]]],"zk gk cet4 cet6 ky",1291,3,1,"s:tools/i:tooling/p:tooled",[["Do you know how to use these command line tools?","你知道怎样使用这些命令行工具吗？"]]],"toolbox":[[["n.",["工具箱"]]],null,17283,0,0,"s:toolboxes"],"toot":[[["n.",["嘟嘟声","作乐"]],["v.",["吹喇叭","吹奏出"]]],null,22919,1,0,"p:tooted/i:tooting/s:toots"],"tooth":[[["n.",["牙齿","齿状物","爱好"],["hard bonelike structures in the jaws of vertebrates; used for biting …"]],["v.",["装以齿","将...切成齿状","啮合"]]],"zk gk",1854