 as both a source of food and habitat for wild animals.","湿地在生态系统中扮演着净化水源、防止洪水和侵蚀、为野生动物提供食物和栖息地的重要角色。"]]],"whack":[[["v.",["猛击","重打","削减","重击"]],["n.",["重击","重打"]]],null,11376,1,0,"p:whacked/3:whacks/i:whacking"],"whale":[[["v.",["捕鲸","使惨败","猛揍"]],["n.",["鲸"]]],"zk gk cet4 cet6 ky toefl",4232,2,0,"s:whales/i:whaling/p:whaled",[["Whales are said to have lived on land long ago.","據說鯨魚以前是在陸地上生活的。"]]],"wham":[[["n.",["重打声"]],["v.",["重打"]]],null,18683,0,0,"d:whammed/i:whamming/3:whams"],"wharf":[[["v.",["卸在码头上","靠码头","入坞"]],["n.",["码头"]]],"cet6",17288,2,0,"s:wharves/i:wharfing/p:wharfed/3:wharfs",[["A remote Iranian desert city, Ice Age-era caves in Germany and a stone wharf in Brazil built for arriving African slave ships are three new additions to UNESCO's list of World Heritage sites.","伊朗的一座偏遠沙漠城市、德國的冰河時期洞穴、巴西為非洲奴隸船入港所建造的石頭碼頭，這三個新景點被聯合國教科文組織列入世…"]]],"what":[[["int.",["怎么","多么"]],["pron.",["什么"],["a., & adv. As an interrogative pronoun, used in asking"]],["adj.",["什么的"]],["adv.",["到什么程度"]]],"zk gk",34,5,1,[["Not knowing what to do, he asked me for help.","他不知道該怎麼做，於是便找我幫忙。"]]],"what's":[[["",["（尤当 has 为助动词时","what is 或 what has 的常用口语形式）","乌"]]],null,0,4,0,[["Two men are checking on what's wrong with the car.","两个男人在检查汽车出了什么故障。"]]],"whatever":[[["pron.",["无论什么"]]],"zk gk cet4 cet6 ky ielts",776,4,1,[["Whatever results may follow, I will carry out my plan.","無論結果會是怎樣，我也不會改變我的計劃。"]]],"whatsoever":[[["pron.",["无论什么"]]],"cet4 ky",6109,2,0,[["It makes no sense whatsoever.","无论如何说不通。"]]],"wheat":[[["n.",["小麦"]]],"zk gk cet4 cet6 ky toefl",4479,2,0,"s:wheats",[["At Christmas, one eats roast goose, red cabbage, and wheat buns.","聖誕節時，人們會吃烤鵝、紅甘藍和小麥麵包。"]]],"wheedle":[[["v.",["以甜言蜜语诱惑","用甜言蜜语骗","用甜言蜜语哄骗"]]],"toefl gre",27751,0,0,"p:wheedled/3:wheedles/i:wheedling"],"wheel":[[["n.",["轮子","车轮","轮","方向盘","旋转"],["a simple machine consisting of a circular frame with spokes (or a sol…"]],["v.",["使旋转","转动","使转向","旋转","转弯"],["change directions as if revolving on a pivot"]]],"zk gk cet4 cet6 ky ielts",1999,3,1,"s:wheels/p:wheeled/i:wheeling",[["Seems like I'm the third wheel here. I should go.","好像我成电灯泡了。我该走了。"]]],"wheelbarrow":[[["n.",["手推车","独轮车"]]],null,16826,0,0,"s:wheelbarrows/i:wheelbarrowing/p:wheelbarrowed"],"wheelchair":[[["n.",["轮椅"]]],null,4598,2,0,"s:wheelchairs",[["The hallway needs to be wide enough for a wheelchair.","走廊要夠輪椅寬。"]]],"wheeze":[[["v.",["喘气","喘息着说"]],["n.",["喘气声","喘息"]]],null,14426,1,0,"i:wheezing/p:wheezed/s:wheezes"],"whelm":[[["v.",["用...覆盖","压倒","淹没","覆盖"]]],"gre",0,0,0,"p:whelmed/3:whelms/i:whelming"],"whelp":[[["n.",["小狗"]],["v.",["下崽"]]],"gre",41787,0,0,"d:whelped/i:whelping/3:whelps"],"when":[[["adv.",["何时","什么时候"],["At what time; -- used interrogatively."]],["conj.",["当...的时候"]],["pron.",["什么时侯"]],["n.",["时间"]]],"zk gk",57,5,1,[["When I grow up, I want to be a king.","我長大後想當國王。"]]],"whence":[[["adv.",["从何处","出于什么原因","从哪个"]],["n.",["来处","根源"]]],null,17756,1,0],"whenever":[[["adv.",["不论何时","每逢"]],["conj.",["每当"]]],"zk gk cet4 cet6 ky",2314,3,1,[["Whenever the boss is around, he plays at being busy.","老闆在的時候他就裝成一副很熱心的樣子。"]]],"where":[[["adv.",["在哪里"],["At or in what place; hence, in what situation, position"]],["pron.",["哪里"],["& conj. Whether."]],["n.",["地点"],["Place; situation."]]],"zk gk",169,5,1,[["I am going to my room, where I can study.","我要回房间了，在那儿我可以学习。"]]],"whereabouts":[[["n.",["下落","所在之处"]],["adv.",["在何处"]]],null,11164,1,0,[["Tom can't account for his whereabouts on the day that Mary was murdered.","汤姆不能说明玛丽遇害那天自己在哪里。"]]],"whereas":[[["conj.",["然而","鉴于","考虑到","就...而论"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts",2731,3,1,[["Mary is a very promising student, whereas Tom promises much but achieves little.","瑪麗是個很有前途的學生，而湯姆則是光說不練。"]]],"whereby":[[["adv.",["靠什么","如何","为何","靠那个","因此"]]],"cet6 ielts",8497,2,0],"wherein":[[["adv.",["在哪方面","在那方面"]]],null,12003,1,0,[["I tripped in the alleyway in the darkness, as I crashed my knees on the asphalt. There was a wooden board that covered a wire between houses across the alleyway. It was very dark there at night. My eyeglasses fell off my face. Luckily, a Cantonese labourer with a flashlight helped me. My knees just got scraped. I remember another time when I crashed on my knees. It was at Don José Heights in Quezon City in the Philippines. There was a vastness of Martianesque red soil, wherein the \"talahib\" grass grew. Sometimes, workers intentionally set the grass on fire. My brother and I were still playing, even then, outside. We were still prepubescent. Near burning grass, I stumbled on my knees. My grandmother, Lola Bebe, was so angry. A maid washed my legs in the big tiled sink behind the garage.","我在黑暗的巷子中絆倒，膝蓋砸在柏油路上。一塊木板蓋著巷弄的房屋之間的電線。深夜的巷弄非常之暗。我的眼鏡從眼睛上掉了下來…"]]],"whereupon":[[["conj.",["因此","于是"]]],null,17007,1,0],"wherever":[[["adv.",["无论哪里"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky",3710,2,1,[["Tom always carries a camera with him wherever he goes.","汤姆无论到哪里都带着照相机。"]]],"wherewithal":[[["",["必要的方法","必要物"]],["n.",["必要的资金"]]],null,19295,0,0],"whet":[[["v.",["磨","磨快","刺激","促进"]],["n.",["磨","开胃小吃"]]],"gre",19708,0,0,"d:whetted/i:whetting/3:whets",[["That really whets my appetite.","那很開胃。"]]],"whether":[[["conj.",["是否","不论"],["In case; if; -- used to introduce the first or two or"]],["pron.",["两个中的哪一个"],["Which (of two); which one (of two); -- used"]]],"zk gk",321,5,1,[["Whether you succeed or not depends on your own efforts.","你成功与否取决于你自身的努力。"]]],"which":[[["pron.",["哪一个","那一个"],["A relative pronoun, used esp. in referring to an"]]],"zk gk",58,5,1,[["I found the key for which I had been looking.","我找到那把我一直在找的钥匙了。"]]],"whichever":[[["pron.",["无论那一个","任何一个"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky",10672,1,0,[["Whichever route you take, you will get there in time.","不管你选哪条路，你都能按时到那里。"]]],"whiff":[[["v.",["轻轻地吹","喷气","三击不中出局","垂钓","吹送"]],["n.",["一吹","一吸","一阵","一点点","一口烟"]]],"gre",12029,1,0,"s:whiffs/p:whiffed/i:whiffing"],"whig":[[["n.",["辉格党"]]],null,26582,1,0,"s:whigs"],"while":[[["n.",["一会儿","(一段)时间"],["a period of indeterminate length (usually short) marked by some actio…"]],["conj.",["当...的时候","虽然"]],["v.",["消磨"]]],"zk gk",153,4,1,[["I can't leave home, even if only for a while.","我不能离开家，即使是一会儿。"]]],"whilst":[[["conj.",["当...的时候","和...同时","虽然","只要","然而"]]],"cet4 cet6 ielts",18717,3,1,[["Whilst at university, Xiaowang held the post of class monitor.","上大學的时候，小王擔任過班長。"]]],"whim":[[["n.",["一时的兴致","冲动","怪念头","绞盘"]]],"toefl gre",10044,1,0,"s:whims"],"whimper":[[["v.",["呜咽","啜泣","抽噎地哭","呜咽着说","啜泣着说"]],["n.",["抽泣","呜咽","啜泣","哭诉"]]],null,13999,1,0,"p:whimpered/i:whimpering/s:whimpers"],"whimsical":[[["adj.",["怪念头多的","反复无常的","古怪的","异想天开的"]]],"gre",13075,1,0],"whimsy":[[["n.",["怪念头","离奇的东西","反复无常","绞盘"]]],"gre",19674,0,0,"s:whimsies"],"whine":[[["v.",["哭诉","嘎嘎响","发呜呜声","哀诉"]],["n.",["哀叫声","嘎嘎声","哀鸣"]]],"gre",7913,1,0,"i:whining/p:whined/s:whines",[["What's happened has happened; there's no use in whining and complaining.","要發生的已經發生了，你搖頭嘆息也沒用。"]]],"whinge":[[["v.",["喋喋不休地抱怨","哭诉"]],["n.",["抱怨不止"]]],null,0,1,0,"i:whingeing/p:whinged/s:whinges"],"whip":[[["v.",["鞭打","搅拌","煽动","召集","仓促制成"]],["n.",["鞭子","抽打","车夫","搅拌器"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky ielts",4254,3,0,"s:whips/p:whipped/i:whipping",[["Whenever I see the clouds, I think of whipped cream.","无论我什么时候看到云，我都会想到奶油。"]]],"whir":[[["v.",["作呼呼声","发飕飕声","使呼呼响"]],["n.",["呼呼声","飕飕声"]]],"toefl",18084,0,0,"p:whirred/i:whirring/3:whirs"],"whirl":[[["v.",["使旋转","使回旋","卷走","回旋","旋转"]],["n.",["回旋","旋转","急走","眩晕"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky ielts",8035,1,0,"p:whirled/i:whirling/3:whirls",[["Water springs out of a fountain, flows downwards in a brook, runs in a beck, stands in a pond, glides in the stream, is whirled about in a whirlpool and causes fens.","水從噴泉中湧出，在溪流中向下流，在溪澗中奔走，在池塘中安定，在河流中順勢流，在漩渦中迴旋，並形成沼澤。"]]],"whirlpool":[[["n.",["漩涡","涡流"]]],"gre",16038,1,0,"s:whirlpools/p:whirlpooled",[["Water springs out of a fountain, flows downwards in a brook, runs in a beck, stands in a pond, glides in the stream, is whirled about in a whirlpool and causes fens.","水從噴泉中湧出，在溪流中向下流，在溪澗中奔走，在池塘中安定，在河流中順勢流，在漩渦中迴旋，並形成沼澤。"]]],"whirlwind":[[["n.",["旋风"]]],null,12458,1,0,"s:whirlwinds",[["Sow the wind, reap the whirlwind.","種的是風，而收獲的是旋風。"]]],"whisk":[[["v.",["扫","拂","挥动","迅速移动","搅拌"]],["n.",["掸","扫帚","毛掸子","搅拌器","拂"]]],null,6314,2,0,"d:whisked/i:whisking/3:whisks"],"whisker":[[["n.",["腮须","胡须","一丝儿"]],["",["晶须"]]],"cet6",13794,1,0,"s:whiskers"],"whiskey":[[["n.",["威士忌酒"]],["adj.",["威士忌酒的"]]],null,7021,1,0,"s:whiskeys",[["He took a drink of whiskey neat.","他喝了一杯純威士忌酒。"]]],"whisky":[[["n.",["威士忌酒","轻便马车"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky",17204,2,0,"s:whiskies",[["There is a bit of whisky in this bottle.","這瓶內有一點威士忌。"]]],"whisper":[[["n.",["耳语","密谈","谣传","沙沙声"]],["v.",["耳语","密谈","沙沙地响","低声说"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky gre",2446,3,1,"p:whispered/i:whispering/s:whispers",[["I whispered to her quietly \"Don't be afraid, I'm here.\"","我轻轻地对她说：《不要怕，我在这儿》"]]],"whistle":[[["v.",["吹口哨","鸣汽笛","发嘘嘘声","用口哨或吹哨传意","用口哨演奏"]],["n.",["口哨","汽笛","啸啸声","口哨声"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky ielts gre",6463,2,1,"p:whistled/i:whistling/s:whistles",[["Inside the venue, sounds of clapping, whistling, yelling, laughing blended together.","会场内，掌声、哨声、喊声、笑声乱成了一锅粥。"]]],"whit":[[["n.",["些微","一点点"]]],"toefl gre",19851,0,0,"p:whited/s:whits"],"white":[[["adj.",["白色的","纯洁的","白种的","苍白的","空白的"]],["n.",["白色","洁白","眼白","白种人","蛋白"],["a member of the Caucasoid race"]]],"zk gk",301,5,1,"s:whites/r:whiter/i:whiting/p:whited",[["French is taught by Mr White, not by Miss Green.","教法語的是懷特老師，不是格林老師。"]]],"white-collar":[[["adj.",["白领阶层的"]]],null,0,1,0],"whitehall":[[["n.",["白厅","英国政府"]]],null,0,2,0],"whiteness":[[["n.",["白","苍白","洁白"]],["",["白度"]]],null,12736,0,0],"whitetail":[[["n.",["白尾鹿"]]],null,14480,0,0],"whitewash":[[["n.",["白色涂料","粉饰","得零分的惨败"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky",20142,1,0,"d:whitewashed/i:whitewashing/s:whitewashes"],"whittle":[[["v.",["逐渐削薄","削整","削弱","削减","削木头"]],["n.",["大刀","屠刀"]]],"toefl gre",15062,1,0,"d:whittled/i:whittling/3:whittles"],"whiz":[[["n.",["飕飕声","精明的人","专家"]],["v.",["(使)飕飕作声"]]],null,16509,0,0,"i:whizzing/p:whizzed/3:whizzes"],"whizz":[[["n.",["飕飕声","精明的人","专家"]],["v.",[