f who. See Who."]]],"zk gk",1018,4,1,[["This is the doctor whom I spoke of last night.","他就是我昨晚提過的那位醫生。"]]],"whomever":[[["pron.",["（作动词或介词的宾语时","有时候用来替代whoever）"]]],null,15288,0,0,[["Give the book to whomever wants it.","这本书谁想要就给谁吧。"]]],"whoop":[[["v.",["叫喊","鸣叫","高声说","唤起"]],["n.",["大叫","呐喊","一点点"]]],null,17648,1,0,"s:whoops/i:whooping/p:whooped/r:whooper",[["\"Hey, when do the dorms lock up?\" \"9 o'clock.\" \"Whoops, if we don't run we won't make it!\"","「喂，宿舍甚麼時候鎖門？」「九點。」「糟了，我們不跑回去的話就趕不及了！」"]]],"whopping":[[["adj.",["巨大的","天大的"]],["adv.",["非常地"]]],null,12747,0,0],"whore":[[["n.",["娼妓"]],["v.",["卖淫"]]],null,8725,1,0,"s:whores/i:whoring/d:whored",[["I'd rather be his whore than your wife.","我寧願當他的情婦也不要當你的老婆。"]]],"whose":[[["pron.",["谁的"],["The possessive case of who or which. See Who, and Which."]]],"zk gk",527,5,1,[["Don't trust a man whose past you know nothing about.","不要相信一个你一点都不了解他过去的人。"]]],"why":[[["n.",["原因","理由"],["the cause or intention underlying an action or situation, especially …"]],["adv.",["为什么"]]],"zk gk",158,5,1,[["I can't understand why you are so critical of him.","我不明白为什么你这么批评他。"]]],"wick":[[["n.",["灯芯","油绳"]]],"gre",17490,0,0,"s:wicks",[["A candle without a wick is no candle at all.","蠟燭沒有了芯，就不能算是蠟燭了。"]]],"wicked":[[["adj.",["坏的","邪恶的","缺德的","刻毒的","恶劣的"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky ielts gre",7732,2,0,[["It is wicked of you to do such things.","你竟然做出那樣的事來，你還是人嗎？"]]],"wicker":[[["n.",["柳条"]],["adj.",["柳条编的"]]],null,11690,1,0],"wicket":[[["n.",["小门","腰门","售票窗"]]],null,27333,3,0,"s:wickets"],"wide":[[["adj.",["宽的","广阔的","普遍的","宽阔的","广泛的"],["having great (or a certain) extent from one side to the other"]],["adv.",["广阔地","遍及各处地","广泛地"]],["n.",["大千世界"]]],"zk gk ielts",940,5,1,"r:wider/t:widest",[["Keep your eyes wide open before marriage, half shut afterwards.","婚前張開眼，婚後半閉眼。"]]],"wide-eyed":[[["adj.",["睁大眼睛的","非常吃惊的","天真的"]]],null,0,1,0],"wide-ranging":[[["adj.",["范围或内容广泛的"]]],null,0,1,0,[["My hobbies are not only wide-ranging but also useful.","我的爱好不但广泛而且有用。"]]],"widely":[[["adv.",["广泛地"]]],"cet4 cet6",2175,0,1,[["The term \"qipao\" is widely used in Northern China.","“旗袍”这个词语在中国北方广为使用。"]]],"widen":[[["v.",["弄宽","加宽","扩大","变宽"]]],"cet4 cet6",5456,2,0,"d:widened/i:widening/3:widens",[["As he looked through the store window, Dima's eyes widened as they fell upon a gorgeous black suit, and then widened even more when he noticed the 3,000,000.99 BYR price tag.","當狄馬透過店外的窗子，看見裏面一件華麗絕倫的黑色西裝時，他不禁睜大了眼睛；接著，當他發現價錢牌上寫著「3,000,00…"]]],"widespread":[[["adj.",["充分伸展的","广布的","普及的","流传广的"]]],"gk cet4 cet6 ky toefl",3282,3,0,[["The jury's guilty verdict gave rise to widespread debate.","陪审团作出的犯罪判决激起了很大的争论。"]]],"widow":[[["n.",["寡妇","孀妇"]],["v.",["使成寡妇"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky toefl",4691,2,0,"s:widows/d:widowed/i:widowing",[["The widow mourned for her husband for a long time.","寡妇为她的丈夫哀悼了很久。"]]],"widower":[[["n.",["鳏夫"]]],null,15702,0,0,"s:widowers",[["A man whose wife is dead is called a widower.","死了妻子的人叫做鰥夫。"]]],"width":[[["n.",["宽度","宽广","广博"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky ielts",6752,1,1,"s:widths",[["What's the width of this road?","這條路的寬度是多少？"]]],"wield":[[["v.",["挥舞","运用"]]],"cet6 toefl ielts gre",7460,1,0,"i:wielding/p:wielded/3:wields",[["Two women wielding giant spatulas continuously stir a brimming wok of shredded beef simmering in curry sauce.","兩名女子揮舞著巨大的鍋鏟，不停地翻炒著盛滿咖哩醬汁的牛肉絲。"]]],"wife":[[["n.",["妻子","太太","夫人","已婚妇女"],["a married woman; a man's partner in marriage"]]],"zk gk",466,5,1,"s:wives",[["My wife asked me to throw this old hat away.","老婆叫我把這頂舊帽子丟掉。"]]],"wig":[[["v.",["给...戴假发","激怒","使发狂","激动","发狂"]],["n.",["假发","斥责"]]],"gre",8616,2,0,"s:wigs/i:wigging",[["I took off my wig.","我摘下了假发。"]]],"wiggle":[[["v.",["扭动着行进","摆动"]],["n.",["扭动","摆动"]]],"gre",10667,1,0,"p:wiggled/i:wiggling/3:wiggles"],"wiki":[[["n.",["维基百科（网站名）"]]],null,19255,0,0],"wild":[[["adj.",["野性的","野蛮的","野生的","失控的","任性的"],["marked by extreme lack of restraint or control"]],["n.",["荒野","荒地"],["a wild primitive state untouched by civilization"]],["adv.",["狂暴地","失控地"]]],"gk cet4 