sed the bus.","他还没来。他肯定错过公交车了。"]]],"yew":[[["n.",["紫杉"]]],null,22979,1,0,"s:yews",[["\"Do you know what kind of tree you just broke?\" \"No, I don't,\" I answered the detective. While looking through the open door, the detective shouted, \"Hey, do you know what kind of tree he just broke?\" \"Um, looks like it's a yew plum pine,\" said the voice of a young woman. After straightening himself in his seat, the detective asked me one more time: \"Do you know what kind of tree you just broke?\"","「你知道你剛才折斷的是什麼樹嗎？」我回答偵探：「不知道。」偵探透過敞開的門往裡面看，喊道：「喂，你知道他剛才折斷的是什…"]]],"yiddish":[[["adj.",["意第绪语的","依地语","<俚>犹太人的"]],["n.",["意第绪语","依地语(犹太人使用的国际语)"]]],null,17778,0,0,[["Yiddish is not Hebrew.","意第绪语不是希伯来语。"]]],"yield":[[["v.",["出产","给予","让出","放弃","使屈服"]],["n.",["生产量","投资收益"]]],"cet4 cet6 ky toefl ielts",2652,3,0,"s:yields/p:yielded/i:yielding",[["When the light is green, cars turning must yield to pedestrians.","绿灯时，拐弯车要让人。"]]],"yo-yo":[[["n.",["溜溜球"]]],null,0,1,0,"s:yo-yos"],"yoga":[[["n.",["瑜珈"]]],"ielts",7878,1,0,[["There's a guy in my yoga class.","有个小伙子在我的瑜伽班里。"]]],"yoghurt":[[["n.",["酸乳","酸奶"]]],"gk",43601,0,0,"s:yoghurts",[["What flavour does this yoghurt have?","這個酸奶是什麼口味的？"]]],"yogurt":[[["n.",["酸乳酪"]],["",["酸乳"]]],null,7467,1,0,"s:yogurts",[["What sort of yogurt do you like best?","你最喜欢哪一种酸奶？"]]],"yoke":[[["v.",["给...上轭","连接","结合","使匹配","匹配"]],["n.",["轭","牛轭","束缚"]],["",["磁轭","磁头组","偏转线圈"]]],"cet6 ielts gre",16099,0,0,"d:yoked/s:yokes/i:yoking"],"yokel":[[["n.",["(贬)乡巴佬","土包子","乡下佬"]]],"gre",34037,0,0,"s:yokels"],"yolk":[[["n.",["蛋黄","卵黄","羊毛脂"]]],"cet6 toefl",11348,1,0,"s:yolks/d:yolked",[["My daughter likes to eat egg yolks.","我女兒喜歡吃蛋黃。"]]],"yon":[[["n.",["那边","那边/远处的东西","远处"]],["adj.",["那边的","远处的"]],["adv.",["在那边","在远处"]]],null,19886,0,0],"york":[[["n.",["约克郡","约克王朝"]]],"ielts",0,0,0,[["My train left at 7 and arrived in New York at 10.","我乘的火车7点出发，10点到了纽约。"]]],"yoruba":[[["n.",["(非洲)约鲁巴人"]]],null,15536,0,0,"s:yorubas"],"you":[[["pron.",["你","你们"]]],"zk gk",14,5,1,[["Don'